<p. 1> 
śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ || 

oṃ atha || 

prāraṃbhe saraṇe bhaṃge yanmadasyaṃdabiṃdavaḥ ||
kāraṇāni prapaṃcasya taṃ vaṃde vāraṇānanaṃ || (1) ||

saccidānaṃdanāthāṃghrisaroruhayugaṃ bhaje || 
yatkaṭākṣakṣaṇotkṣepā chivohaṃ paṃca kṛtyakṛt || (2) ||

prakāśarūpā prathame prayāṇe mṛtavarṣiṇī || 
pratiprayāṇe cāmaṃtaḥ padavyāṃ citkalāṃ bhaje || (3) || 

ālokya sarvataṃtrāṇi yāmyadīnyaśeṣataḥ || 
jñātvā gurumukhātteṣāṃ rahasyārthāṃśca tatvataḥ || (4) || 

saccidānaṃdanāthāṃghri saroja dvaya ṣaṭpadaḥ ||
śrīvidyānaṃdanāthohaṃ vītarāgo viviktadhīḥ || (5) || 

vicaranmedinīmetāṃ vidvadbhirvimalātmabhiḥ || 
prayāge prārthitaḥ prītyai teṣāṃ loka hitāya ca || (6) ||

paṃcaśrotaḥ payogādhaṃ tanmaṃtramaṇisaṃkulaṃ ||
samastayoginīcakraṃ pravālalatikojvale || (7) ||

nityāmaṃḍalapūrṇeṃdu jyotsnājālavijṛṃbhitaṃ ||
navacakra mahādvīpaṃ nyāsajālāṃtaraṃgakaṃ || (8) ||

śrīnāthapādukāpotaṃ caturvargaphalāmṛtaṃ ||
prakāśayāmi saubhāgyaratnākaramati sphuṭaṃ || (9) ||

śrīvidyāyāḥ sabhedāyā nitya naimittikārcanaṃ ||
<p. 1b> 
kāmyārcanaṃ ca dīkṣāṃga bhūtaṃ prācyādi sādhanaṃ || (10) ||

dīkṣābhedaḥ puraścaryā tatkarmaniyamādikaṃ ||
kāmyahomavidhiścaiva saumyakrūravibhedataḥ || (11) ||

samastavyastavidyāyā japātkāmyaphalodayaḥ ||
sadācārādikaṃ caiva likhyate ratnavāridhau || (12) ||

tatra śrīmānsādhako rajanītūryayāme vibudhyāvaśyakaṃ kṛtvā hastau pādau 
prakṣālya dhaute vāsasī paridhāyācamya svāsane samupaviśya 
pūjāmūrtternirmmālyamapakṛṣya pūrvadinapūjāvaśiṣṭapuṣpādinā 
vakṣyamāṇasamastaprakaṭetyādisamaṣṭividyayā tribhirabhyarca 
brahmaraṃdhrasthaśvetasahasradalakamalakarṇikāyāṃ siṃhāsane 
samupaviṣṭaṃ vāmāṃgagatayā devyā 
raktavastrābharaṇamālyānulepabhūṣitaṃ candrakāṃtanibhaṃ trinetraṃ 
jñānamudrāpustakavarābhayakaraṃ śāṃtaṃ suprasannaṃ śivarūpiṇaṃ 
śrīguruṃ dhyātvā taccaraṇāraviṃdayugalavigaladamṛtadhārābhiḥ svadehaṃ 
pariplutaṃ vibhāvya praṇavatritārasūccārya 
vakṣyamāṇaśrīgurupādukāvidyāṃte śrī(-)amukānaṃdanātha

<p. 2> 
śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi iti mānasairūpacāraiḥ saṃpūjya || stotraṃ paṭhet || 
tadyathā ||

stuvīta paṃcabhiḥ ślokaistaṃ nityaṃ sarvasiddhaya || 
prātaḥ prabodhasamaye japāt sudivaso bhavet || (1) ||

namaste nātha bhagavan śivāya gururūpiṇe ||
vidyāvatārasaṃsidhyai svīkṛtānekavigraha || (2) ||

navāya navarūpāya paramārthaprakāśine ||
sarvājñānatamobhedabhānave cidghanāya te || (3) ||

svataṃtrāya dayākḷptavigrahāya śivātmane ||
parataṃtrāya bhaktānāṃ bhavyānāṃ bhavyarūpiṇe || (4) ||

vivekīnāṃ vivekāya vimarśāya vimarśināḥ ||
prakāśānā prakāśāya jñānināṃ jñānarūpiṇe || (5) ||

purastātpārśvayoḥ pṛṣṭhe namaskuryāmuparyyadhaḥ ||
sadā maccittarūpeṇa vidhehi bhavadāsanaṃ || (6) ||

tvatprasādādahaṃ deva kṛtakṛtyosmi sarvadā ||
māyāmṛtyu māhāpāśādvimuktosmi śivosmihaṃ || (7) || 

iti praṇamya ||

prātarārabhya sāyāṃtaṃ sāyāṃdiprāraṃ tataḥ ||
yatkaromi jagaṃnnātha tadastu tava pūjanaṃ || (8) ||

iti samarpya ||

hṛnmaṃtreṇa svahṛdi layaṃ bhāvayet || iti gurudhyānaṃ vidhāya ||

<p. 2b> 
svamūlādhāre caturasraveṣṭitaṃ vādisāṃtavarṇacatuṣṭaya yukta caturdala 
paṃkajaṃ pītavarṇaṃ dhyātvā tatkarṇikāyāṃ somasūryāgnimayamakathādi 
trirekhaṃ kulaśṛṃgāṭaṃ trikoṇaṃ vibhāvya tanmadhye koṭisūryaṃ 
pratīkāśaṃ caṃdrakoṭi susītalaṃ japākusumaprabhaṃ 
satvarajatamoguṇākrāṃtaṃ kāmākhyaṃ biṃduṃ vibhāvya tadūrdhvaṃ 
kuṃḍalanīṃ śaktiṃ cidrūpāmaṣṭatriṃśatkalāyukta paṃcāśadvarṇa vigraha 
śrīvidyā svarūpiṇīṃ taḍitkoṭiprabhā dīptāṃ bisataṃtu tanīyasīṃ prasupta 
bhujagīmiva sārdha trivalayena sthitāṃ svachādaṃḍāhatāṃ 
kṛtvotthāpyagurūpadiṣṭavidhinā suṣumṇā mārgeṇa mūlādhāra 
svādhiṣṭhānamaṇipūrakānāhata viśuddhājñākhya ṣaṭcakra bhedanakrameṇa 
brahmaraṃdhrasthita sahasradalakamalaṃ prāpayya tataḥ sravadamṛtadhārayā 
raktavarṇayā varṇamayyā kuṇḍalinīṃ tāṃ saṃtarpya punaḥ sudhā srota 
svarūpiṇīmakulā mṛtaplavena suṣumṇāṃtargata tattadādhāra tattadhātu 
tattadvarṇa tattadadhi 

<p. 3> 
devatā plāvayaṃtīmājñā viśudhyādi krameṇa mūlādhāraṃ nītvā tathaiva 
sthāpayedityārohāvaroha krameṇa parāṃ śaktiṃ kuṇḍalinīṃ dhyātvā ||

vidyā kūṭa trayaṃ dhyāyet ||

tatra mūlādhāre vahnimaṃḍalaṃ daśa kalātmakaṃ vibhāvya tatra mūla 
vidyāyāḥ prathamaṃ kūṭaṃ vāgbhavākhyaṃ sphurattaḍillatā 
bhāsuramanāhata paryaṃtaṃ prāpta nādaśikhaṃ vibhāvya anāhate 
sūryamaṃḍalaṃ dvādaśakalātmakaṃ dhyātvā | tanmadhye mūlavidyāyāṃḥ 
kāmarājākhyaṃ dvitīya kūṭamughaddinakarasaṃkāśamājñāparyaṃtaṃ 
prāpta nādaśikhaṃ adha ūrdhvaṃ prasṛta rasmikaṃ dhyātvā | ājñācakre 
somamaṃḍalaṃ ṣoḍaśakalātmakaṃ dhyātvā tanmadhye mūlavidyāyāḥ 
śaktyākhyaṃ tṛtīya kūṭaṃ pūrṇacaṃdranibhaṃ brahmaraṃdhraparyaṃtaṃ 
prāptanādaśikhaṃ adha ūrdhvaṃ prasuta raśmikaṃ dhyātvā | tato 
mūlādhārādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ mūlavidyāṃmudyaddinakara 

<p. 3b> 
sahasrabhāsurāṃ tejo daṃḍamayīṃ akhaṃḍāṃ dhyātvā | tattejasā vyāptaṃ 
svadehaṃ pariciṃtya tattejasā pariṇatāṃ śrīparadevatāṃ hṛdaya kamale 
dhyātvā mānasairupacāraiḥ pūjayitvā | mūlavidyayā prāṇāyāma trayaṃ 
mūlavidyāyāḥ vakṣyamāṇa ṛṣyādikaraṣaḍaṃganyāsāṃśca kṛtvā mūla 
vidyāṃ yathāśaktiṃ japitvā japitvā japaṃ samarpya ||

prātarnamāmi jagatāṃ jananyāścaraṇāṃbujaṃ ||
śrīmattripurasuṃdaryā namitāyā harādibhiḥ || (1) ||

prātaḥstripurasuṃdaryā namāmi caraṇāṃbujaṃ ||
harirharo viriṃciśca sṛṣṭyādīn kurute yayā || (2) ||

prātastripurasuṃdaryā namāmi pada paṃkajaṃ ||
yaptādyamaṃbuśiraśi bhāti gaṃgā maheśituḥ || (3) ||

prātaḥ pāśāṃkuśaśaracāpa hastāṃ namāmyahaṃ ||
udyadāditya saṃkāśāṃ śrīmattripurasuṃdarī || (4) ||

prātarnamāmi pādābjaṃ yayedaṃ bhāsate jagat ||
tasyāstripurasuṃdaryā yatprasādānnivarttate || (5) ||

yaḥ śloka paṃcakamidaṃ prātarnityaṃ paṭhennaraḥ ||
tasmai dadyādātma padaṃ śrīmattripurasuṃdarī || (6) ||

iti stutvā praṇamya tasyai nija kṛtyaṃ nivedayet ||

<p. 4> 
tadyathā ||

iti samarpya svakarmānuṣṭānārthaṃ devyājñāṃ prārthayet ||

tadyathā ||

trailokya caitanya mayīśvareśi śrīsuṃdaritvaccaraṇājñayaiva ||
prātaḥsamutthāya tava priyārthaṃ saṃsārayātrāmanuvarta iṣye || (1) ||

saṃsārayātrā manuvartamānaṃ tvadājñayā śrītripure pareśi ||
sparddhā tiraskāra kali pramāda bhayānimāmābhi bhavaṃtu mātaḥ || (2) ||

jānāmi dharmaṃ na ca me pravṛttirjānāmi dharmaṃ na ca me nivṛtiḥ ||
tvayā hṛṣīkeśi hṛdi sthitāhaṃ yathā niyuktosmi tathā karomi || (3) ||

iti devyājñāṃ prārthya(0) svagurūpadiṣṭamārgeṇa nādānusaṃdhāna 
pūrvakaṃ nirasta samastopādhinā kenāpi cidvilāsena pravarttamānosmiti 
vibhāvya svakarmānuṣṭhānāya gurūpadeśena jñātaṃ sahaja 
siddhamajapājapaṃ tattaddevatābhyaḥ samarpayet ||

tadyathā ||

argha pūrvedyura 
horātroccaritamuchvāsaniśvāsātmakaṃ ṣaṭśatādhikamekaviṃśati 
sahasrasaṃkhyākamajapājapaṃ mūlādhāra svādhiṣṭhāna maṇipūrakā 
nāhata viśudhyājñākhyā

<p. 4b> 
brahmaraṃdhreṣu caturdala ṣaṭdala daśadala dvādaśadala ṣoḍaśadala dvidala 
sahasradaleṣu svarṇavidruma nīlapiṃgaladhūmravidyutkarpūra vaṇeṣu sthitebhyo 
gaṇapati brahmaviṣṇurudra jīvātma paramātma śrīgurupādukābhyo yathā 
bhāgaśaḥ samarpayiṣyāmīti kṛtāṃjaliḥ saṃkalpya samarpayet ||

tadyathā || 

oṃ aiṃ hīṃ śrīṃ mūlādhārasthāyagaṇapataye ajapā japānāṃ ṣaṭśatāni 
samarpayāmi namaḥ || (4) ||

(maṇipūraka cakrasthāya viṣṇave a)
svādhiṣṭhāna cakrasthāya brahmaṇe ajapājapānāṃ ṣasahastrāṇi samarpayāmi 
namaḥ || (4) ||

maṇipūrakatrasthāya viṣṇave ajapājapānāṃ ṣaṭsahasrāṇi samarpayāmi 
namaḥ || (4) ||

anāhata cakrasthāya rudrāya ajapājapānāṃ ṣaṭsahasrāṇi samarpayāmi namaḥ 
|| (4) || 

viśuddha cakrasthāya jīvātmane ajapājapānāṃ sahasraṃ samarpayāmi namaḥ |
ājñācakrasthāya paramātmane ajapā japānāṃ sahasraṃ samarpayāmi namaḥ || 

(iti samarpayet || etāvatkartuma) 

<p. 5> 
sahasradala kamalakarṇikā madhyasthāyai śrīguru pādukāyai ajapājapānāṃ 
sahasraṃ samarpayāmi namaḥ || iti samarpayet ||

etāvatkartuma śaktaścet || (4) ||

mayā pūrvedyurahorātroccaritamuchvāsa niśvāsātmakaṃ ṣaṭśatādhikameka 
viṃśati sahasrasaṃkhyākamajapājapaṃ brahmaraṃdhrastha sahasradalakamala 
karṇikā madhye vartinyai śrīgurupādukāyai samarpayāmi namaḥ || iti gurava eva 
samarpayet ||

ityajapājaṃpaṃ samarpya || oṃ || 

adya 
sūryodayamārabhyāhorātreṇochvāsamiśvāsātmakaṃ ṣaṭśatādhikameka(-)
viṃśati sahasrasaṃkhyākamajapājapamahaṃ kariṣye || iti kṛtāṃjalimuṭaḥ 
saṃkalpya ||

ajapā maṃtreṇa prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā || śirasi (4) haṃsāya ṛṣaye namaḥ ||
mukhe (4) avyaktā gāyatrī chaṃdase namaḥ || hṛdi (4) paramahaṃsāya devatāyai 
namaḥ || mūlādhāre (4) haṃ bījāya namaḥ || pādayoḥ (4) saḥ śaktaye namaḥ ||
nābhau (4) sohaṃ kīlakāya namaḥ ||

<p. 5b>
hṛdaye (4) oṃkārāya tatvāya namaḥ || mūrddhni (4) nabhase sthānāya namaḥ || 
sarvāṃge (4) haimāya varṇāya namaḥ || kaṃṭhe (4) udāttāya svarāya namaḥ ||
iti vinyasya | mama mokṣārthe jape viniyogaḥ || iti kṛtāṃjalirvadet || 

tataḥ aṃguṣṭhayoḥ oṃ (3) hsāṃ sūryātmane svāhā hṛdayāya namaḥ || 
tarjjanyoḥ (4) hsī somātmane svāhā sirase svāhā ||
madhyamayoḥ (4) hsūṃ niraṃjanātmane svāhā | śikhāyai vaṣaṭ || 

anāmikayo(0) (4) hseṃ nirābhāsātmane svāhā kavacāya huṃ || 
kaniṣṭhikayoḥ (4) hsauṃ anaṃtatanuḥ sūkṣma pracodayātmane svāhā 
netratrayāya vauṣaṭ ||
karatala karapṛṣṭhayoḥ (4) hsaḥ avyakta bodhātmane svāhā astrāya phaṭ || 
iti karayorvinyasya |
hṛdayādi ṣaḍaṃgeṣvapyetāneva maṃtrānvinyasya ||
dhyānaṃ kuryāt || tadyathā ||

ghāṃ mūrdhhānaṃ yasya viprā vadaṃti khaṃ vai nābhiṃ caṃdrasūryau ca 
netre ||
digmiṃ śrotre yasya pādau kṣitiṃ ca dhyātavyosau sarvabhūtāṃtarātmā || (1) ||

ātmā na bhagnīṣomākhya pakṣayuktaṃ śivātmakaṃ ||
hakāreṇa bahiryāṃtaṃ viśaṃtaṃ ca sakārataḥ || (2) ||

<p. 6> 
haṃsaḥ sohamiti smṛtvā sohaṃ vyaṃjana hīnataḥ ||
pakṣān saṃhṛtya cātmānamaṃḍarūpaṃ vibhāvayet || (3) ||

iti virāṭ svarūpaṃ svātmānaṃ dhyātvā | tadanusaṃdhāyī 
prāṇavāyornirgaṃmapraveśātmakaṃ ajapā maṃtraṃ ||
haṃsaḥ padaṃ paṃcaviṃśativāraṃ japitvā samarpya gurunāthāya || (4) ||

oṃ samudre mekhale devi parvatastanamaṃḍale ||
viṣṇupatni namastubhyaṃ pādasparśaṃ kṣamasva me || (5) ||

dhāraṇaṃ pośaṇaṃ tvatto bhūtānāṃ devi sarvadā ||
tena satyena māṃ pāhi pāpānmocaya dhāriṇi || 

prātaḥkṛtyamakṛtvā tu yo devi bhaktito yajet ||
niṣpalā tasya pūjāsyāchaucahīnā yathā kriyā ||

iti bhūmiṃ prārthya ||

śvāplānusāreṇa tasyāṃ pādaṃ nidhāyotthāya pade astramuccaran 
gṛhādbahirnirgatyagrāmadbahi nai(-)ṛtyāṃ yāmyāṃ vā diśiśakṣepa 
mātrāṃbhūvamatītya | dūre gatvāmalamūtrotsargā śaucācamanādivaṃ 
yathā vidhiṃ vidhāyā niṣiddha dineṣu vihita kāṣṭhena (4) klīṃ kāmadevāya 
sarvajana priyāya nama iti maṃtreṇaṃ daṃtānviśodhya jihvāmullikhya 
daṃtakāṣṭhaṃ prakṣālya purataḥ 

<p. 6b> 
śuddhadeśe parityajya vakṣyamāṇa caturllakṣmī vidyābhirmukhaṃ 
prakṣālyācamya 
tilakuśakusumagaṃdhākṣatāstrābhimaṃtritaśaṃkunāśucisthānāduddhṛta 
mṛdagomaya dhautavastrāṇyādāya nadyādau gatvā astrābhimaṃtrita 
vāriṇātīraṃ prakṣyālya tatrāstrābhimaṃtritaṃ kuśādikaṃ nidhāyoddhṛta 
jalena tīrthādbahiḥ kaṭi śauca sugaṃdhāmalakādyudvarttanāmalāpakarṣaṇa 
snānaṃ mṛdgomayādibhiḥ svaśākhokta vidhinā vaidika snānaṃ ca vidhāya 
nābhi mātre jale sthitvā || (4) ||

oṃ adyetyādi śrīparadevatā prītyarthaṃ tāṃtrika vidhinā snānamahaṃ kariṣye | 
iti saṃkalpa | mūlavidyayā prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā mūlavidyāyā ṛṣyādi 
karaṣaḍaṃganyāsāṃśca vidhāya svapurato hastamātraṃ caturasraṃ tīrthaṃ 
parikalpya || (4) || 

oṃ brahmāḍodara tīrthāni karaiḥ spṛṣṭāni te rave || 
tena satyena deveśa tīrthaṃ dehi divākara || (1) ||

iti sūryāttirthaṃ prārthya ||

kroṃmityaṃkuśamudrayā sūryamaṃḍalaṃ bhitvā || (4) ||

gaṃge ca yamune caiva godāvari sarasvati ||
narmadā siṃdhu kāveri jalesmin saṃnidhaṃ kuru || (1) ||

<p. 7> 
iti sūryyamaṃḍalāttīrthamākṛṣya tajjale puraḥ kalpita tīrtha maṃḍale mūla 
vidyayā saṃyojya punaḥ punaḥ sūryamaṃḍalāddeva ||
oṃ aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ hvāṃ hvīṃ hvūṃ hvaiṃ hvauṃ hvaḥ sarvānaṃda mayi 
tīrtha śakte ehi ehi svāhā ||
iti tīrtha śaktimāvāhya tasmin tīrtha maṃḍala madhye tāṃ dhyāyet || tadyathā ||

sarvānaṃdamayīmaśeṣa duritadhvaṃsāṃ mṛgāṃka prabhāṃ 
tryakṣāṃ cordhva karadvayena dadhatīṃ pāśaṃ sṛṇiṃ ca kramāt ||
dorbhyāṃ cāmṛta pūrṇa hemakalaśaṃ muktākṣamālāvare 
gaṃgāsiṃdhu saridvayādi sahitāṃ śrītīrtha śaktiṃ bhaje || (1) ||

dakṣādyūrdhvayorādye madhyasthābhyāṃ kalaśaṃ dakṣādyadhaḥsthayoranye 
ityāyudhadhyānaṃ ||
iti dhyātvā tadvidyayā gaṃdhādi paṃcopacārairjalamayaistāṃ saṃpūjya || (4) ||

oṃ namo bhagavati aṃbo aṃbālike aṃbike mahāmālini etyehi bhagavati aśeṣa 
tīrthālavāle hrīṃ śrīṃ śivajaṭādhirūḍhe gaṃge gaṃgāṃbike svāhā ||
iti maṃtreṇa saptadhābhimaṃtrya hrīṃkāreṇa jalamāloḍyavamiti dhenumudrayā 
mṛtī kṛtya mūla vidyāyāḥ prathama kūṭamuccārya ātmatatvāṃtmane namaḥ 
miḥ | dvitīya kūṭaṃ vidyā tatvātmane namaḥ |

<p. 7b> 
tṛtīya kūṭaṃ śiva tatvātmane namaḥ |
iti tatva trayaṃ jale vinyasya tatra śrīcakraṃ vibhāvya hṛdaya 
kamalāddevīmāvāhya ṣaḍaṃga nyāsena sakalīkṛtya tāsāṃ 
varṇānāṃstarpayitvā mūlavidyayā yonimudrayā tajjalamaṣṭadhābhimaṃtrya 
tasmi jale devatā maṃtrasmaraṇa pūrvakaṃ trirnimajyonmajya kuṃbhamudrayā 
mū (*) vidyayā svaśirasi trirabhiṣiṃcyācamya mūlavidyayā devīṃ triḥsaṃtarpya 
devīṃ visṛjya vakṣyamāṇa prakāreṇa tatvairācamyatīramāgatya dhaute vāsasī 
paridhāyācamya tīrtha mṛttikādinordhvapuḍraṃ vidhāya sakuṃkumena 
caṃdanena tripuḍraṃ vidhāya vaidika saṃdhyāṃ nirvatya (-) tāṃtrika saṃdhyāṃ 
kuryāt ||

sācaturvidhya ||

prātarmadhyāhna sāyāhna madhyarātribhedāt || tathā coktaṃ tripurārṇave ||
saṃdhyāṃ ||

caturvidhā jñeyā bālākaumāra yauvanā ||
prauḍhā ca niṣkūlā ceti saṃdhyā devi prakīrttitā || (1) ||

prātaḥkāle mahādevī vidyāvāgīśvarī matā ||
kāmeśvarī ca madhyāhne sāyāhne tripura bhaira bhairavī || 
madhya rātre mahādevi jñeyā tripura suṃdari || (2) || iti ||

<p. 8> 
tatra vidhivadācamya mūlavidyayā śikhāṃ badhvā tathaiva prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ 
kṛtvā mūlavidyayā ṛṣyādi karaṣaḍaṃga nyāsān vidhāya svaputo 
dhenumudrayā jalamamṛtīkṛtya mūlavidyayāṣṭavāramabhimaṃtrya tena jalena 
kuśairakārādi kṣakārāṃtaiḥ sabiṃdubhirmātṛkākṣaraiḥ pratyakṣaraṃ 
svaśiraḥ prokṣyamūlavidyayā ca triḥsaṃprokṣya sūryamaṃḍale devīṃ 
yathokta rūpāṃ dhyātvā dakṣiṇa hastena jalamādāya | laṃ vaṃ raṃ yaṃ haṃ 
iti pāṃcaka bhautikairmaṃtraiḥ saptavāramabhimaṃtrya mūlavidyayā ca 
trirabhimaṃtrya tajjala biṃdubhirvāmāṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ mūlavidyayā 
svaśirastriḥprokṣyāvaśiṣṭa jalaṃ vāmahaste nidhāya tejo rūpaṃ tajjalamiḍayā 
kṛṣya svadehāṃta sthitaṃ sakala kaluṣaṃ prakṣālya tajjalaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ 
pigalayā bahirnirgataṃmatvātajjalaṃ punardakṣiṇahaste kṛtvā svavāmabhāge (4) 
valadvajraśilāṃ dhyātvā || (4) || oṃ ślīṃ paśu haṃ phaṭ iti pāśupatāstra 
maṃtreṇa tasyāṃ śilāṃyāmāsphālya hastau prakṣālya 

<p. 8b> 
mūlavidyayā dakṣiṇahaste jalamādāya pravahannāḍyā sahasradala kamala gata 
paramāmṛtenaikībhūtaṃ vibhāvya rājadaṃtavivarānnetramārgeṇa nirgamayya 
tajjalaṃ vāmake nidhāya tena jalena (4) amṛta māli svāhā iti maṃtreṇa kuśaiḥ 
svaśiraḥ triḥprokṣyaḥ || (4) || 
prathama kūṭamuccārya ātmatatvaṃ śodhayāmi svāhā || (4) || 
dvitīya kūṭamuccārya vidyātatvaṃ śodhayāmi svāhā || (4) ||  
tṛtīya kūṭamuccārya śivatatvaṃ śodhayāmi svāhā || 
iti trirācamya punaretadvaiparityenaṃ trirācamya || tadyathā || (4) || 
tṛtīya kūṭamuccārya śivatatvaṃ śodhayāmi || (4) || 
dvitīya kūṭaṃ vidyātatvaṃ śo(0) | prathama kūṭaṃ ātmatatvaṃ śo(0) || punaḥ |
samasta vidyāmuccārya sarvatatvaṃ śodhayāmi svāhā || iti tridhā ||

evaṃ navadhā jala prāśanena trirācamya || (4) || 

mūlavidyayā śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi iti 
gaṃdhapuṣpākṣataistriḥ saṃpūjya || 
jalamaṃjali nādāyotthāya (4) prathama kūṭamuccārya vāgīśvarī viprahe dvitīya 
kūṭamuccārya kāmeśvarī dhīmahī | tṛtīya kūṭamuccārya tannaḥ śaktiḥ 
pracodayāt ||
śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī śrīpādukāyai eṣorghaḥ svāhā ||

<p. 9> 
iti trirarghyaṃ datvā || (4) || 
hrāṃ hrīṃ haṃsaḥ śrīsūryaṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ iti sūryaṃ triḥ sapūjya || (4) ||
hrāṃ hrīṃ haṃ saḥ śrīsūrya eṣate'rghaḥ svāhā iti 
sūryābhimukhamarghamaṃjali trayaṃ datvā || (4) ||
mūlavidyayā śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī śrīpādukāṃ tarpayāmi namaḥ iti 
mahādevīṃ triḥsaṃtarpya || (4) ||
hrāṃ hrīṃ haṃ saḥ śrīsūryaṃ tarpayāmi namaḥ iti triḥ saṃ (*) rpya ||
mūlādhāre prathamakūṭaṃ taḍitkoṭi samaprabhaṃ mūlādi 
brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ saṃcitya tattejaḥ suṣumṇā vartmanā brahmaraṃdhraṃ 
nītvā vahannāsādhvanā ākāśastha vahnimaṃḍale samāvāhya 
tattejasodbhūtāṃ vāgeśvarīṃ dhyāyet || tadyathā ||

pītāṃ pītāṃvarāṃ pīta sragvibhūṣānulepanāṃ ||
taḍitkoṭi prabhābhāsāṃ bālāmakṣasragujvalāṃ || (1) ||

pustakāḍhya karāṃ bhojāṃ vahi pīṭha niṣeduṣīṃ ||
vāgbhavīṃ vāgbhavodbhūtāṃ tryakṣaṇāṃ sasmitāṃ smaret || (2) ||

ityākāśastha vahnimaṃḍale dhyātvā || (4) || pratha (*) kūṭamucārya tripurā 
vāgīśvarī śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi iti gaṃdhapuṣpākṣataiḥ striḥ saṃpūjya 
punarvakṣyamāṇa vāgbhava gāyatrīṃ uccārya tripurā vāgīśvarī 
śrīpādukāyai 

<p. 9b> 
arghyaṃ kalpayāmi svāhā iti trirarghāṃjalimukṣipya ||
punaḥ pratha (*) kūṭamuccarya tripurā vāgīśvarī śrīpādukāṃ tarpayāmi 
namaḥ iti triḥ saṃtarpya || śrīguru praṇamya ||

pūrvavat prāṇāyāma ṛṣyādi karaṣaḍaṃgaṃ nyāsāṃ vidhāya 
mātṛkānyāsasthāneṣu praṇavatritāra mūlavidyādi na nityā vidyā haṃsaḥ |
aṃ namaḥ || (3) ||
ityādinā mātṛkāṃ vinyasya | pūrvoktāṃ turīya gāyatrīṃ yathāśaktiṃ 
japitvā vāgbhava kūṭa gāyatrīṃ japet || sā yathā || 

aiṃ tripure devi vidmahe vāgīśvarī dhīmahi || tanno muktiḥ pracodayāt ||
iti vāgbhavagāyatrīṃ japet yathā śaktiṃ || tato mūlavidyāṃ prātaritthaṃ japet 
|| tadyathā ||

tatra prātarmūlādhāragate kamale vahnimaṃḍale ||
vāgbījarūpāṃ nityāṃ tāṃ vidyutpaṭala bhāsurā || (1) ||

puṣpabāṇekṣu ko daṃḍa pāśāṃkuśa lasatkarāṃ ||
svechāgṛhīta vapuṣīṃ yuga nityākṣarātmikāṃ || (2) ||

ghaṭikā varaṇopetāṃ paritaḥ prāṃjalī natha ||
jñānamudrā varakarān vāgbhavopāsti tatparāṃ ||

navanāthān smaren mūla paṃkaje yoni maṃḍale ||
dakṣādhaḥ karabhārabhya dakṣordhva kara paryaṃṭataṃ āyudha dhyānaṃ ||

<p. 10>
itthaṃ saṃdhyā catuṣṭayepi || iti dhyātvā ||

praṇava tritārādyāmūlavidyādi na nityā vidyā haṃ saḥ aṃ āṃ iṃ īṃ uṃ 
ūṃ ṛ ṝṃ hrīṃ śrīprakāśānaṃdanātha rūpiṇī śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī 
śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi || (4) ||

mūlavidyāmuccārya prāgvat dina nityā vidyā haṃ saḥ ḷṃ eṃ aiṃ oṃ auṃ 
aṃ aḥ hrīṃ śrīṃ vimarśānaṃdanātharūpiṇi śrīpādukāṃ pū(0) || (4) ||
mū(0) diḥ vihaṃsaḥ kaṃ khaṃ gaṃ ghaṃ ṅaṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ 
ānaṃdānaṃdanātha rū(0) pādukāṃ || (4) ||

mūlaṃ di(0) haṃ saḥ caṃ(0) (4) hrīṃ śrīṃ śrījñānānadanātha rūpi(0) 
pādukāṃ pū(0) || (4) || mū(0) di(0) haṃ saḥ || ṭaṃ (4) hrīṃ śrīṃ 
śrīsatyānaṃdanātharū(0) pādukāṃ pū(0) | mū(0) di(0) haṃ saḥ taṃ (4) hrīṃ śrīṃ 
śrīpūrṇānaṃdanātharū(0) pādu(0) || (4) ||
mūlaṃ di(0) ha saḥ paṃ (4) hrīṃ śrīṃ svabhāvānaṃdanātharū(0) pā(0) || (4) ||
mūlaṃ di(0) haṃ saḥ yaṃ (4) hrīṃ śrīṃ pratibhānaṃdanātharū(0) pā(0) || (4) ||
mū(0) di(0) haṃ saḥ ṣaṃ (4) hrīṃ śrīṃ subhagānaṃdanātha rūpi(0) pā(0) 
pūjayāmi || 

iti navanāthātmakatvena mūlavidyāṃ japet ||
tatastaddina nityā vidyāṃ yathāśaktiṃ japitvā || iti kāla nityā japaḥ ||

tato mūlādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ mūlavidyāmudyatsūrya sahasra 
samaprabhāṃ

<p. 10b> 
dhyāyan mūlavidyāmaṣṭottaraśataṃ japitvā bahirākāśasthāgni maṃḍale 
pūryoktarūpāṃ vāgbhaveśvarīṃ dhyāyan prātarvāgbhava kūṭamaṣṭottara 
śataṃ japet ||

tataḥ prāṇāyāma trayaṃ ṛṣyādi karaṣaḍaṃganyāsāṃśca vidhāya kṛtaṃ 
japaṃ devyai nivedya praṇamya stutvā sūryamaṃḍalādvahnimaṃdalācca 
mūladevīṃ vāgbhaveśvarīṃ ca svahṛdaye mūlādhāre ca visṛjya guruṃ 
praṇamediti ||

iti prātaḥ saṃdhyāvidhiḥ ||

atra karma kāleṣu gurudhyānamuktaṃ rudrayāmale ||
dīkṣākāle yathārūpaṃ svasyānugraha karmaṇi ||
dṛṣṭaṃ taṃ tena bhāvena dhyāyannāhnikamācaret || 

iti guroriti śeṣaḥ ||

etadgurudhyānaṃ prātaḥsmaraṇāti riktakāleṣu jñeyaṃ ||
prātaḥ saṃdhyeyamīśāni sarvakarmasu sarvadā ||
kartavyā maṃtriṇā nityaṃ maṃtrasiddhiḥ samṛddhaye || (1) ||

prātaḥ saṃdhyāṃ parityajya karma kurvan brajatyadhaḥ ||
prātaḥ saṃdhyāṃ parityajya devatā pūjanaṃ caret ||
aśuddhaḥ sudurācāraḥ sarvakarma bahiḥkṛtaḥ || (3) ||

prātaḥ saṃdhyāṃ parityajya deva pūjādikaṃ caret ||
<p. 11> 
mohāt kṛtvā maheśāni nārakī jāyate naraḥ || (4) ||

prātaḥ saṃdhyāṃ parityajya homaṃ vā tarpaṇaṃ śive ||
kurvanna kāraṇaṃ viprastyajan śvāno bhave dhṛvaṃ || (5) ||

piśāco jāyate devi api vedāṃta pāragaḥ ||
saṃdhyānāmapi sarvāsāṃ prātaḥ saṃdhyā garīyasī || (6) ||

tasmāt tāṃ na tyajedviprastyajannarakamāpnuyāt ||
iti tripurārṇavavacanādi yaṃmavaśyaṃ kartavyeti śivaśāsanaṃ ||

atha ghaṭikā pārāyaṇa tvena ṣaṣṭi japaṃ kuryāt ||

sa ca paṃcabhirdivasairmātṛkāyāḥ ṣaḍāvṛtti rūpaḥ || tathā ca tatra rāja paṭale 
|| (4) ||

ārabhya bhānorudayamekaśo ghaṭikā kramāt ||
ekaikaṃ mātṛkā varṇāḥ paṃcāśat parivṛttitaḥ || (1) ||

divasaiḥ paṃcabhistasyāḥ ṣaḍāvṛttirudīriteti ||

tasyā mātṛkāyāḥ || ayamarthaḥ ||

caturyugeṣvapi tattadyuga prathama dine sūryodaya kāle akāra udayati ||  
tato dvitīya ghaṭikādi paṃcāśat ghaṭikā paryaṃtāsu ghaṭikāsu | akārādi 
kṣakārāṃtā varṇā visarga svara rahitāḥ svasva ghaṭikodaya kāle samudyaṃti ||
tata eka paṃcāśat ghaṭikāmārabhya śiṣṭa daśaghaṭikāsu akārādi 
ḷkārāṃtaḥ

<p. 11b> 
daśavarṇāḥ svasva ghaṭikodaya kāle samudyaṃti ||
itthaṃ dvitīya divase sūryodaya kāle ekāra udeti || 
tataḥ svasva ghaṭikodaya kāle ekārādyā ekona catvāriṃśadvarṇā akārādyā 
viṃśati varṇāśca samudyaṃti || (2) ||

tṛtīya divase sūryodaya kāle cakāra udeti ||
tataḥ svasva ghaṭikodaya kāle chakārādi kṣakārāṃtā akārādi ṇakārāṃtā 
ekona ṣaṣṭivarṇāḥ samudyaṃti || (3) ||

caturtha divase sūryodayakāle takāra udeti ||
tata svasva ghaṭikodaya kāletha kārādi kṣakārāṃtā akārādi makārāṃtā 
ekona ṣaṣṭhi varṇāḥ samudyaṃti || (4) ||

paṃcama divase sūryodaya kāle yakāra udeti || 
tataḥ svasva ghaṭikodaya kāle rakārādi kṣakārāṃtāḥ akārādi 
kṣakārāṃtāścaikona ṣaṣṭhivarṇā samudyaṃti ||
evaṃ paṃcabhirdivasairmātṛkāyāḥ ṣaḍāvṛttirbhavati ||
evaṃ krameṇaibhirvarṇairghaṭikā pārāyaṇākhyaḥ ṣaṣṭhi japaḥ kāryaḥ ||

tatprakāraḥ pradarśate ||

tataḥ tatra akārādi kṣāṃtāḥ paṃcāśadvarṇā visargarahitā

<p. 12a> 
daśa dakṣaśa bhūtvā paṃcavargāḥ aṁ eṁ caṁ taṁ yaṁ tāmāno bhavaṃti 
nai(0) ṣaṣṭhi japaḥ kāryasta prakārastu || (4) ||

mūlaṃ dina nityā vidyā haṃsaḥ aṃ || (4) ||
mūlaṃ dina nityā vidyāhaṃsaḥ āṃ ||
evaṃ kṣāṃtān paṃcāśadvarṇānāvṛtya punārādi vargamāvartayet ||
evaṃ ṣaṣṭhirāvṛttayo mūla vidyāyā bhavaṃti ||
dvitīya dine (4) mūlaṃ dina nityā vidyā haṃsaḥ |
eṃ evaṃ punastathā japtā aiṃ | evaṃ kṣātān caturo vargānā vṛrtya(0) 
punarādya dvitīyavargāvāvartayet || evaṃ ṣaṣṭhirāvṛttayaḥ ||

tṛtīya dine (4) mūlaṃ (-) dina nityā vidyāhaṃsaḥ caṃ | 
evaṃ kṣāṃ tāṃstrinvargā nāvartya(0) punarādyāṃstrīnāvarttayet ||
evaṃ ṣaṣṭhirāvṛttayo mūlavidyāyā bhavaṃti ||
caturtha dine (4) mūlaṃ taddina nityā vidyā haṃsaḥ yaṃ | evaṃ kṣātaṃ vargaṃ 
vartayitvā (-) punarakārādyān kṣāṃtāt paṃcāśadvarṇānāvartayet ||
evaṃ(0) tataḥ ṣaṣṭhe dine punarakārādita ārabhyoktarītyā ghaṭikā pārāyaṇa 
japa manavarataṃ kuryāt ||
atrādhunāvartamāna samayo sādhakairjyotiḥśāstrokta prakāreṇāhargaṇena 
kaliyugasya

<p. 12b> 
gata dinādi jñātvā svakramāraṃbha dinaparyaṃtaṃ gaṇayitvā 
paṃcabhirāhṛtyorvarita dinenodayākṣaraṃ jñātvā yasmin dine udayākṣara 
makāro bhavati tasmin dine prārabhya ghaṭikā pārā (*) ṇaṃ prokta krameṇa 
kāryamiti ghaṭikā pārāyaṇa japaḥ prātareva kāryaḥ ||
taṃtrarājoktyā kāla trayepi kāryaḥ ||

atha mādhyaṃdina saṃdhyā ||

tatra prāṇāyāmādi sūrya tarpaṇāṃ taṃ prātaḥ saṃdhyāvadeva vidyāya bīja 
saṃdhyāṃ kuryāt ||

sāyathā ||

tatra madhyāhne anāhata cakre mūlavidyāyāḥ kāmarājakūṭaṃ raktavarṇaṃ 
dhyāyan tattejaḥ suṣumṇā mārgeṇa vahannārā puṭādhvanā niḥsāryya 
sūryamaṇḍale samāvāhya tadbhutā kāmaiśvarīṃ dhyāyet ||

tadyathā ||

raktāṃ suraktaṃbara bhūṣaṇāḍhyāṃ 
pāśāṃkuśābhītti varāṃ dadhānāṃ ||
śucismitā madbhūtayauvanāḍhyāṃ 
kāmeśvarīṃ saṃsmata trinetrāṃ || (1) ||

iti dhyātvā (4) kāmarākūṭamūccārya śrītripurākāmeśvarī śrīpādukāṃ 
purtayāmi iti triḥsaṃpūjya (-) punaḥ (4) kāmarājakūṭa 

<p. 13a> 
gāyatrīmuccārya śrītripurā kāmeśvari śrīpādukāyai arghyaṃ kalpayāmi 
svāheti trirarghyāṃ jalimutkṣipya punaḥ kāmarāja kūṭamuccārya 
śrītripurākāmeśvari śrīpādukāṃ tarpayāmi namaḥ iti triḥsaṃtarpya ||
prāṇāyāmādi puraḥsaraṃ pūrvavanmātṛkāṃ vinyasya pūrvavattūrīya 
vīdyā gāyatrīṃ japitvā kāmarājakūṭa gāyatrīṃ japet ||

sāyathā || klīṃ tripure devī vidmahe kāmeśvarī dhīmahi || tannaḥ klinnā 
pracodayāt ||

iti kāmarāja kūṭa gāyatrīṃ yathā śaktiṃ japitvā ||
ṣaṭtriṃśattatvātmakatvena mūlavidyāṃ japet || 

tadyathā || tatastatra ||

madhyāhne hṛdayāṃbhojakarṇike sūryamaṃḍale ||
kāmarājātmikāṃ devīmalaktakasamārūṇāṃ || (1) ||

prasūnabāṇapuḍrekṣucāpapāśāṃkuśānvitāṃ ||
paritaḥ svatma mukhyābhiḥ ṣaṭtriśattatvaśaktibhiḥ || (2) ||

raktamālyāṃbarālepabhūṣābhiḥ parivāritāṃ ||
yuganityākṣaramayīṃ ghaṭikāvaraṇāṃ smaret || (3) ||

puṣpabāṇekṣukodaṃḍa dharāḥ śoṇavapurdharāḥ ||
hṛtpaṃka ca tāḥ kāmarājopāsti parāyaṇāḥ || (4) ||

<p. 13b> 
iti deviṃ dhyātvā || 

(4) mūlavidyāṃ dinanityā vidyāṃ haṃsaḥ padaṃ coccārya aṃ śivatatvarūpiṇī 
