devīṃ vṛddhāṃ dhyāyet || tadyathā ||

śuklāṃ śuklāṃbarālepa sragvibhūṣāvibhūṣitāṃ ||
jaṭājūṭadharāṃ netra trayodbhāsi mukhāṃbujāṃ || (1) ||

iṣat sphuṭita daṃṣṭrāṃ ca bhairavīrūpamāsthitāṃ ||
jarāpalita saṃkīrṇāṃ laṃbamāna payodharāṃ || (2) ||

pāśāṃkuśau pustakaṃ ca sphaṭikākṣa srajaṃ karaiḥ |
dadhānāṃ śakti bījotthāṃ pūrṇeṃdormaṃḍale sthitāṃ || (3) ||

dhyāyedādyāṃ parāṃśaktiṃ śaktimadbhirniṣevitāṃ ||
<p. 15a> 
bhogamokṣa pradāṃ śāṃtā manaṃtāmamṛteśvarī || (4) ||

vāmādyūrddhayorādye tadādyadhasthayoranye ityāyudha dhyānaṃ || iti 
dhyātvā ||

mūlavidyāstṛtīyaṃ kūṭamucārya tripurāmṛteśvarī śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi 
iti gaṃdhādibhiḥ saṃpūjya vakṣyamāṇa tārtīya kūṭa gāyatrīmuccārya 
