sūryamaṃḍalāccaṃdramaṃḍalācca mūla 

<p. 16b> 
devīmamṛteśvarīṃ hṛdi bhrūmadhye ca visṛjyediti ||

sāyaṃ saṃdhyā vidhiḥ ||

atha turīyasaṃdhyāvidhiḥ ||

tatordharātre turīya saṃdhyāmupāsīt || sāyathā ||

arkamaṃḍale devī dhyānaṃ vinā prāṇāyāmādyācamanaparyaṃtaṃ 
pūrvavadvidhāya sahasrāra kamale turīyakūṭaṃ mūlavidyā 
trayodaśākṣararūpaṃ padmarāga samaprabhaṃ dhyātvā vahannāsāpuṭena 
tārakamaṃḍalādbahiḥ paramākāśe samāvāhya tadudbhūtāṃ bhagavatīṃ 
yathokta rūpā dhyāyan || (4) ||

turīyakūṭamuccārya śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi iti 
triḥsaṃpūjya | yathoktarūpāṃ dhyāyan turīyakūṭamuccārya 
śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī śrīpādukāyai arghyaṃ kalpayāmi svāheti trirarghyaṃ 
datvā punasturīya kūṭamuccārya śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī śrīpādukāṃ 
tarpayāmi iti triḥ saṃtarpya prāṇāyāmādi pūrvakaṃ pūrvoktāṃ 
turīyagāyatrīṃ yathāśaktiṃ japitvā kālanityā vidyāṃ 
mūlavidyāmaṣṭottaraśatavāraṃ tarīyabījaṃ cāṣṭottaraśatavāraṃ japitvā 
prāṇāyāmādi pūrvakaṃ japaṃ samarpya(0) devīṃ stutvā paramākāśāt 
sahasradalakamalakarṇikāyāmudvāsya kāṃmakalārūpamātmānaṃ dhyāyediti 
turīyasaṃdhyāvidhiḥ ||

etatsaṃdhyācatuṣṭayametadvidyopāsakā nāmāvasyakaṃ ||

<p. 17a> 
vāhya śaktau dhyānarūpamapyarddharātrasaṃdhyopāsanaṃ kāryamiti ||
akṛtaṃ dvitīya dine prāyaścittārthamaṣṭottaraśataṃ mūlavidyāṃ japitvā 
punaḥ karmakartumadhikārī bhavatīti śivaśāsanaṃ || snānasaṃdhyārcanālope 
aṣṭottaraśatamiti taṃtrarāja vacanāt || japenmūla vidyāmiti śeṣa || 

atra || saṃdhyālopona kartavyaḥ śaṃbhorājaivameva hi || dīkṣitaḥ saṃdhyayā 
hīno na vidyāphalamaśnuta | iti vacanāt saṃdhyā catuṣṭayaṃ 
sādhakairavaśyaṃ kartavyamiti saṃkṣepaḥ || atra pramādādyadi saṃdhyālopo 
bhavati | tadātvanya saṃdhyāsamaye prokta prāyaścita pūrvakaṃ 
pūrvasaṃdhyā kriyāṃ vighāya tatkālasaṃdhyāṃ kuryāt || uktaṃ ca 
tripurārṇave ||

saṃdhyāhīnonya saṃdhyāyāṃ pūrvasadhyā kriyāmatha ||
vidhāyottarasaṃdhyāyāḥ kriyāṃ kuryāt samāhita iti || (1) ||

śrīvidyānaṃdanāthena śivayoḥ priyasūnunā ||
kṛte saubhāgyaratnābdhau taraṃgaḥ prathamogamat || (1) ||

[iti śrīsaccidānaṃdanātha caraṇāraviṃda dvadvāṃte vasinā śrī 
śrīvidyānaṃdanāthena viracite saubhāgyaratnākara prathamastaraṃgaḥ] || (1) ||
<p. 17b> 
itthaṃ saṃdhyāṃ vidhāva prakṛteḥ prātaḥsaṃdhyānaṃtaraṃpitrāritarpayāṃ 
nirvartyatāṃ trikatarpaṇaṃ kuryāt | tatra prāṇāyāma 
trayaṃ ṛṣyādinyāsapūrvakaṃ svapurato jale pūrvavattīrthamāvātvavamiti | 
dhenumudrayā amṛtīkṛtya mūlenāṣṭavāramabhimaṃtrya tatra śrīcakraṃ 
vibhāvya tanmadhye vakṣyamāṇa prakāreṇa pīṭhapūjā puraḥsaraṃ 
devīmāvāhya ṣoḍaśopacārairjale devīṃ saṃpūjya 
vakṣyamāṇavidhināṃgāvaraṇa devatāḥ saṃpūjya punarmūlena devīṃ 
saṃpūjya(0) (4) mūlavidyāmuccārya śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī śrīpādukāṃ 
tarpayāmi namaḥ || 

ityeṣṭottaraśataṃ tadarddhamaṣṭāviṃśativāraṃ vā yathāśakti tattīrthajalaiḥ 
paradevatā mukhakamale paramāmṛta budhyā saṃtarpyāvaraṇa devatāḥ yathā 
kramaṃ pūjokta maṃtraiḥ pūjayāmīti sthāne 
tarpayāmītyaṃtairekaikāṃjalinā tarpayet || tadaśaktau baṭukādi 
catuṣṭayaṃ ṣaḍaṃga yuvatī gurupaṃkti trayaṃ saptadaśa nityābhiḥ sahitāṃ 
caturasra vṛtto yeta trikoṇamaṃḍalamadhyasthāṃ sāyudha trikoṇāvaraṇa 
śaktiyutāṃ mūladevīṃ tarpayet ||

<p. 18a> 
tatrāpyaśaktau saṃskṛte jale devīṃ dhyātvā saṃpūjya devīmeva tarpayediti 
tarpasāvidhiḥ || athaivaṃ kṛta prātaḥ saṃdhyāvaṃdanādi kriyaḥ 
svagurūpadiṣṭavidhinā ṣaṭtriṃśaduttarasaptaśatādhikaviṃśati 
sahasrasaṃkhyābhiryugākṣaradinākṣarottha kālaniyā vidyābhiḥ 
sahamūlavidyāyāḥ nāma pārāyaṇa japaṃ kuryāt ||

kālanityā vidyāstu taṃtrarājoktā uddhriyaṃte ||

tatra 
akārādikṣāṃtāḥ ṣaṭtriṃśattatvavarṇāḥ ṣoḍaśanityābhiḥ ṣoḍaśasvaraiḥ 
pratyekaṃ saṃyojitāḥ ṣaṭsatyatyuttarapaṃcaśatasaṃkhyākāḥ 
pūrṇamaṃḍalākhyā varṇāḥ bhavaṃti || ete varṇāḥ kālanityā vidyānāṃ 
prāguktasaṃkhyā nāmekaiko varṇaḥ ṣaṭtriṃśat ṣaṭtriṃśat vidyānāmādi 
varṇā iti sarve varṇā vāgbhavākhyā bhavaṃti || prāgukta ṣaṭtriṃśat tatva 
varṇāstu sarvāsāṃ vidyānāṃ mākāreṇa kṛtasaṃdhikāḥ punaḥ punakrameṇa 
kāmarājākhyā dvitīya varṇā bhavaṃti || īkārastu sarvāsāṃ vidyānāṃ śakti 
kūṭākhyastṛtīya varṇā bhavaṃti || athaitāḥ vidyāḥ krameṇa 

<p. 18b> 
pārāyaṇa japaparipādyaiva pradarśyaṃte ||

tatrādau sādhako vivikte deśe nadyādi tīre ekāṃte svagṛhe vā svāsanamāstīrya 
|| (4) || hrīṃ ādhāraśakti kamalāsanāya namaḥ || ityāsanaṃ saṃpūjya ||

tatra prāṅmukhaḥ svastikādyāsanenopaviśya gurugaṇapati sveṣṭa devatāḥ 
praṇamya prāṇāyāma traya pūrvakaṃ saṃkṣepato bhūtaśuddhiṃ 
prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ mātṛkānyāsaṃ ca kṛtvā mastaka dakṣabāhu 
mūlādi ṣaṭtriṃśat sthāneṣu pratisthānaṃ ṣoḍaśadalapadmaṃ 
vibhāvyateṣvakārādi kṣakārāṃtān ṣaṭtriṃśatatvavarṇāḥ 
pratyekaṃ ṣoḍaśasvarasaṃyuktān vibhāvya madhye tatprathamākṣaraṃ vinyasya 
pūrvādi daleṣuttattadakṣara vikṛta ṣoḍaśavarṇāṃstadādikān vinyasedityevaṃ 
pūrṇamaṃḍalavarṇān vinyasya punastadina nityā vidyayā sahita mūlavidyayā 
prāṇāyā trayaṃ kṛtvā śirasi (4) dakṣiṇā mūrttaye namaḥ || mukhe (4) paṃktaye 
chaṃdase namaḥ | hṛdaye (4) kālanityārūpiṇyai śrīmāhātripurasuṃdaryai 
devatāyai namaḥ || iti ṛṣyādikaṃ vinyasya mama mokṣārthe nāma pārāyaṇa 
jape viniyogaḥ || iti kṛtāṃjaliruktā ||

<p. 19a> 
tattaddinaniyā vidyākṣaraistribhiḥ kūṭaiḥ ddirāvṛtyā yathāvidhi 
karaṣaḍaṃganyāsaṃ vakṣyamāṇa caturāsana nyāsaṃḥ vāgdevatāṣṭaka 
nyāsaṃ ca vidhāya dhyāyet tadyathā ||

raktāṃ raktāṃbarā rakta sragvibhūṣānulepanāṃ ||
pāśāṃkuśekṣu ko daṃḍa prasūna viśikhāṃ smaret || (1) ||

iti kālanityāṃ hṛdaye dhyātvā vakṣyamāṇa vidhinā hṛdaye śrīcakraṃ 
