mūlavidyāṃ japet ||

<p. 21b> 
yugākṣara dinākṣare tu tattaddina nityā vidyāyāḥ prathamākṣaraṃ 
dvitīyākṣaraṃ ca boddhavyaṃ || yugākṣarottha vidyā jape viśeṣastu(0) yasmin 
yuge yatsvarayutaṃ yugākṣaraṃ bhavati tatsvaramārabhya pratisvaraṃ ṣaṭtriṃśat 
krameṇa tadvisargāṃtimavidyā paryaṃtaṃ japitvā punastadakṣarasya prathama 
svaramārabhya ārabdha svarasya pūrvasvarāṃta vidyāvadhipajet || tadā 
mūlavidyāyāḥ ṣaṭsaptatyuttara paṃcaśatasaṃkhyā ko japo bhavati || atra yugastu 
ṣaṭtriṃśaddinātmako bhavati || prāgukta pūrṇamaṃḍalaṃ 
varṇeṣu ṣaṭsaptatyuttara paṃcaśata saṃkyākeṣvekaikākṣarasyaikaikayugaṃ 
pratiyugākṣaratvaṃ ca bhavati || etatsarvaṃ gurumukhātsamyagvijñāya 
pārāyaṇa japaḥ kāryaḥ || dinanityā vidyā kramaśca 
gurumukhādevāvagaṃtavya iti || evaṃ dvipaṃcāśaduttaraikādaśaśatasaṃkhyā 
ko japo bhavaṃti mūla vidyāyāḥ || aṃgavidyā japastvekaika vargādāveka navati 
saṃkhyākastena vargadvayādau japodvyaśītyuttara śatasaṃkyāko bhavaṃti | 
kevala mūlaṃ vidyā 

