<p. 23b> 
atra ṣaṭtriṃśaddineṣu ca prāguktaparipādyā 
pratyahaṃ ṣaṭcatvāriṃśaduttaratrayodaśaśatasaṃkhyaṃ yathā bhavati tathā 
japaṃ kṛtvā vargadvayasyāpyaṃte stotra pāṭhaṃ ca kuryāt || atra pārāyaṇe 
paryāya bhedaḥ paṃcadhā bhavaṃti || tathā ca taṃtrarāje || 

dinato vārataḥ pakṣān māsāt ṣaṭtriṃśatā dinaiḥ ||
japaṃtovāramekaṃ tu vidyānityātmikāstutāḥ || (1) ||

āyurārogyamaiśvaryaṃ vijayaṃ vāṃchitaṃ kramāt ||
labhaṃte lalitāyābhiḥ saṃpradāyavatī bhavet || (2) ||

ekasmin divase tveka vārāvṛttau vidhistvayaṃ ||
madhyāhne tu samārabhya madhyarātre samāpayet || (3) ||

vāreṣu caikadā jāpe prathame ravivārake ||
vaśinyāḥ prathamaṃ vargaṃ kāmeśvaryā dvitīyakaṃ || (4) ||

japtvā vargadvayaṃ maṃtrī somavārādi ṣaṭsvapi ||
dineṣu modinī vargādekaikaṃ prajapet sudhīḥ || (5) ||

pakṣepi caikadā jāpe prathamādi tithiṣvapi ||
paṃkti dvayotthā vidyāstu prajapet prativāsaraṃ || (6) ||

paṃcamī daśamī paṃcadaśīṣu tithiṣu kramāt ||
pūrṇāsu prajapedvidyāścatuḥpaṃkti bhavāḥ sudhīḥ || (7) ||

<p. 24a> 
māse pratidinaṃ vidvānekaikāṃ yonimeva tu ||
pūrṇāsuddidviyonyutthā japet ṣaṭ svapitāḥ kramāt || (8) ||

ṣaṭtriṃśatsudineṣvevamekaikāṃ yonimeva tu ||
japet pratidinaṃ vidvānevaṃ pūrṇā bhavaṃtittāḥ || (9) ||

naitābhiḥ sadṛśī kāpi vidyālokeṣu vidyate ||
tasmādābhirupāyaistaiḥ sādhayet sarvamīpsitaṃ || (10) ||

yadyannijepsitaṃ tattaduṣkaraṃ sukaraṃ bhavet ||
japatarpaṇa homārcāsekaiḥ saṃtarpaye sthiraḥ || (11) ||

paṃcāśadvāramāvatyī vidyā bhakti samanvitaḥ ||
mucyate nigaḍaiḥ kṛchrairvairirodhaiḥ sudāruṇaiḥ || (12) ||

śatavāraṃ samāvartya vidyāvividha vaibhavāḥ ||
labhate tanayān vadhyā api sarvaguṇānvitān || (13) ||

adhyarddhaśatavāraṃ tu vidyāśryāvartyabhaktitaḥ ||
guṇarūpādisaṃpannāṃ bhāryāṃ viṃdatya yatnataḥ || (14) ||

tāvadāvartya kanyā vā patiṃ sarvaguṇānvitaṃ ||
labhate putra pautrādyairedhate saṃpadanvitā || (15) ||

dviśataṃ tāḥ samāvartya dāridryānmucyate dhruvaṃ ||
triśatairbhūmi sasthāḍhyaścaturbhiśca śatairdhanī || (16) ||

