hyrauṃ dhriṃ śrīmārttaṃḍabhairavāya prakāśaśakti sahitāya dvādaśa 
kalātmane sagraharāśinakṣatratithivārayogakaraṇa parivṛttasana saṃsthitāya 
śrīsūryāyārghaṃ samarpayāmi svāheti maṃtreṇārghyaṃ datvā 
