oṃ mahādevāya somamūrttaya namaḥ || oṃ īśānāya sūryamūrttaya namaḥ || iti 
saṃpūjya(0) praṇālikāyāṃ oṃ hrīṃ umāyai namaḥ || iti pūjayet || tataḥ 
sāṃgāya saparivārāya śrīśivāya namaḥ || iti tri(0) saṃpūjya(0) oṃ śivāya nama 
iti trirdhūpādi tāṃbulāṃ tānupacārān datvā || 

oṃ sarvajñajñānavijñāna pradānaika mahātmane ||
<p. 30b> 
namaste deva deveśa sarvabhūta hiterata || (1) ||

anaṃta kīrti saṃpanna anekāsana saṃsthita ||
anaṃta kāṃti saṃproga parameśa namostute || (2) ||

parāparaparātīta utpattisthitikā |
sarvārtha sādhanopāya viśveśvara namostute || (3) ||

svabhāva nirmalā bhoga sarvavyādhi vināśana |
yogi yogi mahāyogi yogeśvara namo (*) ste || (4) ||

kṛtvā liṃga pratiṣṭhāṃ tu stavamenamudīrayet ||
liṃga stavaṃ mahāpunyaṃ yaḥ śuṇoti sadā nara || (5) ||

notpadyate ca saṃsāre sthānaṃ prāpnoti śāśvataṃ ||
tasmātsarvaprayatnena śṛṇuyālliṃgasaṃstavaṃ || (6) ||

pāpa kaṃcuka nirmuktaḥ prāpnoti paramaṃ padaṃ ||
iti stutvā ekāgramanā'maṃtraṃ paṭhet ||

aṃgahinaṃ kriyāhīnaṃ vidhihīnaṃ maheśvara ||
pūjitosi mayā deva tatkṣamasva mramāt kṛtaṃ || (1) ||

yadyapyupahaḥtairapāstairbhāvadūṣitaiḥ ||
keśa kiṭapaviddhaiśca pūjitosi mayā prabho || (2) ||

anyatrāsakta cittena kriyāhinena vā prabho ||
manovākkāya duṣṭena pūjitosi trilocana || (3) ||

yaccopahata pātreṇa kṛtamarghādikaṃ mayā ||
tāmase na ca bhāvena tatkṣamasva mama prabho || (4) ||

<p. 31a> 
maṃtreṇākṣara hīnena puṣpena viphalena ca ||
pūjitosi mahādeva tatsarvaṃ kṣamyatāṃ mama || (5) ||

vrataṃ saṃpūrṇatāṃ yātu phalaṃ cākṣayyamastu me ||

iti paṭhītvā pradakṣiṇā namaskāraiḥ samyak paritoṣya śrīmahādeva kṣamasveti 
svātmani saṃhāramudrayā visṛjya nirmālyamādāye(0) (4) caṃḍeśvarāya nama iti 
iśānakoṇe nikṣipya tat liṃgaṃ nirmālyapuṣpārcādikaṃ ca jaladhye nadyādau 
visṛjet | atra pārthiva liṃga pūjāyāṃ pārthiva liṃgaṃ yathā yathā bṛhattathā 
tathā phalaṃkaṃ bāhulyaṃ(0) yathā yathā sūkṣmaṃ tathā tathā phalamalpaṃ ||
sūkṣmepi palatrayānyūnaṃ na karyamiti pārthiva liṃga pūjana prakāraḥ || 

atha dvārapūjā || 

tatra svarṇa prākārasya pūrvadvāreṇāṃtaḥ praviśya prādakṣiṇena 
maṃḍapasya paścimadvāraṃ gatvā tadārabhya maṇimaṃḍapaṃ 
pradakṣiṇīkṛtya paścimadvāreṇāṃtaṃ praviśya sādhakaḥ pūjayeddevīmiti 
kramaste naiva krameṇa dvārapūjanamiti || yāgamaṃḍapasya prākārāsaṃbhave 
maṃḍapasya dvārāgrastadasaṃbhave 

<p. 31b> 
yāgamaṃḍapasya paścime dvāre maṃḍapāsaṃbhavagomayopaliptāyāḥ 
yāgabhūmeḥ paścime bhāge kvāpi sthitvā sāmānyārghaṃ vidyāyaivaṃ 
kalpayitvā krameṇa pūjaye || tadyathā || 

koṭi koṭi yojana vistīrṇa sudhārṇava catuṣṭayāṃtargataṃ koṭiyojana vistarāṃ 
yāmaṃ mahādbhūtaṃ navaratna mayaṃ dvīpaṃ sahasrāditya tejasaṃ tanmadhya 
tṛtīyāṃśe madanonmādanaṃ nāma nānāpuṣpalatākulaṃ kadaṃbakān na 
garbhaṃ naṃdanodyānaṃ tanmadhya tṛtīyāṃśe koṭi sūrya pratīkāśaṃ jvalat 
svarṇa prākāra veṣṭitaṃ nānā surabhiśālittoraṇadvāra nānāratnamaṃḍitaṃ 
paritaḥ sevārtha māyāteṃdrādi devagaṇa samākulaṃ māṇikyamayaṃ 
śrīmaṃḍataṃ dhyātvā sāmānyārghodakenābhyukṣya puṣpādibhiḥ krameṇa 
pūjayet || tadyathā || (4) sudhārṇava catuṣṭayāya namaḥ || (4) aṃ (51) navakhaṃḍa 
virājitāya navaratna dvipāya namaḥ || (4) naṃdanodyanāya namaḥ || (4) svarṇa 
prākārāya namaḥ || tadvārasya dakṣiṇottara śākhayoruparyadhaśca (4) gaṃ 
gaṇeśāya namaḥ || (4) kṣeṃ kṣetrapālāya namaḥ || (4) dvāṃ dvāra śriyai namaḥ || 
(4) dehalyai namaḥ || iti saṃpūjya ||

<p. 32a> 
prākārāṃtaḥ praviśya pradakṣiṇa kameṇeṃdrādi daśadikpālān svasvadiśi 
saṃpūjya maṇimaṃḍapasya paścimadvāraṃ gatvā sāmānyārghaṃ 
vakṣyamāṇavidhinā saṃsthāpya tenodakenāstramaṃtreṇa 
toraṇadvāramabhyukṣya sāmānyārgha karaṇāśaktau tāmrādi pātrastha jalaṃ 
mūlenāṣṭavāramabhimaṃtryadhenumudrāyāmṛtīkṛtya tenodakena vā 
prokṣayet || 

tataḥ (4) kadaṃbakānanāya || taddakṣiṇe (4) kāmadevaratibhyāṃ ||
taduttare (4) vasaṃta prītībhyāṃ namaḥ || iti saṃpūjya || (4) śrīratnamaṃḍapāya 
namaḥ || iti maṃḍapāṃ saṃpūjyatoraṇadvārasya paścimabhāge 
dvārābhimukhamupaviṣṭāṃ vārāhīṃ vakṣamānarūpāṃ dhyātvā | 
tadviprayā tāṃ saṃpūjya tadvāramastreṇābhyukṣyadvārasyordhva 
śākhāyāṃ dakṣiṇe (4) māṃ mahālakṣmyai namaḥ || vāme (4) saṃ sarasvatyai 
namaḥ || madhye (4) duṃ durgāyai namaḥ || (4) dvāṃ dvāraśriyai namaḥ || dvārasya 
dakṣiṇavāma śākhayoradhodhaḥ krameṇa (4) śaṃ 
śaṃkhanidhivasudhārābhyāṃ namaḥ || (4) paṃ padmanidhavasumatībhyāṃ 
namaḥ || (4) gaṃ gaṇapataye namaḥ || (4) kṣeṃ kṣetrapālāya namaḥ || (4) māṃ 
māyā śaktyai namaḥ || (4)

<p. 32b>
ciṃ cichaktyai namaḥ || (4) gaṃ gaṃgāyai namaḥ || (4) yaṃ yamunāyai namaḥ || (4) 
dhaṃ dhātre(0) (4) viṃ vidhātre(0) dahalyāṃ(0) deṃ dehalyai(0) dvārāgre (4) vaṃ 
varuṇāya namaḥ iti paścimadvāraṃ saṃpūjya || tatrottara dvāraṃ gatvā(0) 
tathaivābhyukṣya tasyordhva śākhāyāṃ dakṣiṇavāmapārśve yoḥ prāgvana 
mahālakṣmīratyasvatyau saṃpūjya madhye (4) baṃ baṭukāya namaḥ || (4) dvāṃ 
dvāraśriyai(0) punaḥ pūrvavat śaṃkhanidhyādi dehalyaṃ taṃ saṃpūjya 
dvārāgre (4) soṃ somāya namaḥ || iti saṃpūjya || 

tataḥ pūrvadvāraṃ gatvā tathaivābhyukṣya tasyordhvaśākhāyāṃ 
dakṣiṇavāmapārśvayoḥ prāgvanmahālakṣmī (*) rasvatyau saṃpūjya(0) madhye(0) (4) 
kṣeṃ kṣetrapālāya namaḥ || (4) dvāṃ dvāraśriyai namaḥ || punaḥ 
prāgvachaṃkhanidhyādi dehalyaṃ taṃ saṃpūjya(0) dvārāgre (4) laṃ iṃdrāya 
namaḥ | tato dakṣiṇadvāraṃ gatvārghodakenābhyukṣya tadūrdhva śākhāyāṃ 
dakṣiṇavāmapārśvayoḥ prāgvanmahālakṣmī sarasvatyau saṃpūjya(0) madhye(0) 
(4) glaiṃ gaṇanāthāya namaḥ | (4) dvāṃ dvāraśriyai namaḥ || iti saṃpūjya | 
dvāraśākhayoḥ prāgvachaṃsvanidhyādi dehalyaṃ taṃ saṃpūjya dvārāgre 
(4) ṭaṃ yamāya(0) tataḥ punaḥ 

<p. 33a> 
paścimadvāraṃ gatvā vāmapādaparaḥsaraṃ tattoraṇāṃtaḥ praviśya || (4)
ratnasopāna paṃktaye namaḥ iti sopānapaṃktiṃ saṃpūjya(0) tāmāruhya 
maṃḍapasya paścimadvārādi caturdvāreṣu paṃcastha devatāḥ saṃpūjayet ||
tatra prathamaṃraskāraṇīṃ || 

śyāmavarṇāṃ madāghūrṇā raktanetratrayānvitāṃ ||
kṛṣṇāṃbarāṃ gadāṃ khaḍgaṃ dadhatīṃ ca bhujadvaye || (1) ||

dorbhyo manoharābhyāṃ ca kharjūrī kubhadhāriṇīṃ ||
nīlaṃ turaṃgamāruḍhāṃ prauḍhāṃ pīnaghanastanī || (2) ||

muktakeśīṃ vivasanāṃ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitāṃ ||
svayonidarśanānmuhya saśuvargānnanusmaret || (3) ||

kṛṣṇāṃbarāmiti kṛṣṇavarṇa prachadapaṭāṃ |
vivasanāmadhovastra rahitāṃ | kharjūrī kuṃbhadhāriṇī kharjūra sabharita 
kuṃbha dhāriṇīmityarthaḥ || dakṣādyūrdhvayorāghe athasthayoḥ kuṃbhamiti 
dhyātvā paścimadvārāgre kiṃcidbahiḥ (4) aiṃ namo bhagavati māheśvari 
paśujana manaścakṣustiraskaraṇaṃ kuru kuru svāhā || tiraskaraṇī devī 
śrīpādukāṃ(0) || iti saṃpūjya maṃcastha devatāḥ pūjayet || tatpūjā krama 
uḍḍīśa mate ||

sarasvatīṃ ramāṃ caiva paścime paripūjayet ||
<p. 33b> 
māyāṃ durgāṃ dakṣiṇe tu pūjayet parameśvari || (1) ||

bhadrakālīṃ tataḥ svastiṃ pūrve ca parikalpayet ||
svāhāṃ śubhaṃkarīṃ gaurīṃ yakṣe ca paripūjayet || (2) ||

vāgīśīṃ lokadhātrīṃ ca dakṣa paścimadvārake ||
etāmaṃca sthitāḥ pūjyā yathānukramayogataḥ || (3) ||

iti || athaitāsāṃ pūjā yathā || paścimadvārasya vāmabhāge || (4) sāṃ 
sarasvatīśrī(0) dakṣiṇabhāge (4) māṃ mahālakṣmīśī(0) tato dakṣiṇadvāri |
vāmabhāge (4) māṃ māyāśrī(0) dakṣaṇabhāge (4) duṃ durgāśrī(0) tataḥ 
pūrvadvāri || vāme (4) bhadrakālīśrī(0) dakṣe (4) svaṃ svastiśrī(0) tata uttaradvāre(0) 
vāme (4) svāṃ svāhāśrī(0) dakṣe(0) (4) śuṃ śubhaṃkarīśrī(0) dvārāgre(0) (4) gau 
gaurīśrī(0) punardakṣiṇadvāraṃ gatvā tadvārāgre (4) loṃ lokadhātrīśrī(0) tataḥ 
paścimadvāraṃ gatvā dvārāgre(0) (4) vāṃ vāgīśvarīśrī(0) iti saṃpūja || 

pālitaṃ bahuriṃdrādyaiḥ paramaiśvarya śobhitaṃ ||
prapadye paścimadvāraṃ bhavānyāmaṃdiraṃ mahat || (1) ||

iti dhyātvā (4) paścimadvārāya maṃḍapāya nama iti maṃḍapaṃ saṃpūjya(0) 
tālatraya pūrvakaṃ tadvāramuraghāṭaya 

<p. 34a> 
siddhārthākṣatabhasmakuśakusumāni nārācāstraprayogeṇa (4) 

apakrāṃmaṃ tu bhūtāni pi śācāḥ preta guhyakāḥ ||
ye cātra nivasaṃtyanye devatābhūvisaṃsthitāḥ || (1) ||

apasarpaṃtu ye bhūtā ye bhūtā bhūvi saṃsthitāḥ ||
ye bhūtā vighnakarttāraste nasyaṃtu śivājñayā || (2) ||

ityaṃte astramuccaraṇūmaṃdapāṃtaḥ prakṣipya tasminnirgachatāṃ 
vighnasaṃdhānāṃ svavāmāṃgasaṃkocena mārgaṃ datvā trividha 
vighnānutsārayet || tadyathā || (4)

ryā khaṃḍakāriṇo bhūtvā bhūmau ye cāṃtarigāḥ ||
divi loke sthitā ye ca te naśyaṃtu śivājñayā || (1) ||

ityaṃte astra muccaran vāmapārṣṇighātatrayeṇa bhaumānūrdhvordhva 
tālatrayeṇāṃtarikṣagān tīkṣṇadṛṣṭyavalokanena divyān vighnānutsārya(0) 
vāmapādapuraḥsaraṃ maṃḍapāṃtaḥ praviditi dvārapūjā || atra pratidvāra 
gamanā saṃbhave paści (*) dvāra eva sthitvā tattadvārāṇi kalpayitvā pūjayet ||

atha yathākramaṃ dvāra devatānāṃ dhyānaṃ likhyate ||

padmadvaya varāmīti bhāsvatyāgi catuṣṭayāṃ ||
padmavarṇāṃ tyajetpadmāṃ padmāṃkṣīṃ padmavāsinīṃ || (1) ||

<p. 34b> 
akṣasrak pustakadharā pūrṇacaṃdra samadyūtiḥ ||
viśvavidyā mayī devī bhāratī bhāsvatāṃ mayi || (2) ||

śaṃkhacakāṃkiṃtakarā kumārī kuṭilālatā ||
mṛgeṃdravāhanā devī durgā durgāṇi haṃtu me || (3) ||

taptakārtra svarābhāsā divyaratnavibhūṣitā ||
dvāra śrīrūrdhva padmasthā varābhaya karāṃbujā || (4) ||

muktā māṇikya saṃkāśau kiṃcit smita mukhāṃbujau |
anyonyā liṃgana parau śaṃkhapaṃkajadhāriṇau || (5) ||

vigaladratna varṣābhyāṃ śaṃkhābhyāmūrdhni lāṃchitau ||
śaṃkhāsana samāsīnau viśvasaṃkalpakalpakau || (6) ||

tuṃdilaṃ kaṃbuka nidhiṃ vasudhārāṃ ghanastanīṃ ||
vāmataḥ paṃkaja nidhiṃ priyayā sahitaṃ yajet || (7) ||

siṃdūbhau bhujāśliṣṭau ratnapadmotpalānvitau ||
niḥsaradratnavarṣābhyāṃ padmābhyāṃ mūddhni lāṃchitau || (8) ||

padmāsanasamāsīnau viśvasaṃkalpa kalpakau ||
tuṃdilaṃ paṃkaja nidhiṃ tanvīṃ vasumatīmapi || (9) ||

palāśapāṭalachāyaṃ ramaṇīyaṃ rati priyaṃ ||
puṃḍrekṣu (4) cāpa puṣpeṣu maṃtaṃ vade manobhavaṃ || (10) ||

prapadye prīti dayitaṃ pūrṇeṃdu sadṛśaṃ vibhuṃ ||
vasaṃtaṃ naṃdanodyāne vasaṃtaṃ tatotsvavaṃ || (11) ||

pāśāṃkuśa phalāṃbhoja pāṇi pāṭala tuṃdilaṃ ||
<p. 35a> 
vīraṃ vighneśvaraṃ vaṃde gajavakraṃ trilocanaṃ || (12) ||

kapālaśūlau bibhrāṇaṃ kṛpāluṃ kṛṣṇavigrahaṃ ||
tīkṣṇaṃ tryakṣaṃ samarcāmi kṣetreśaṃ kṣata vidviṣaṃ || (13) ||

varābhaya karāṃ saumyāṃ somakoṭisamaprabhāṃ ||
bhaje gaṃgāṃ mahādevyāḥ pādyodaka taraṃgiṇīṃ || (14) ||

vāma pādārghasaṃbhūtāṃ paradevyāstaraṃgiṇīṃ ||
varābhayakarāṃ vaṃde kāliṃdiṃ kālavigrahāṃ || (15) ||

bhattāraṃ jagatāṃ vade śaṃkhaṃ cakraṃ gadāṃbujaṃ ||
vibhrāṇaṃ garuḍā rūḍhaṃ dhātāraṃ kṛṣṇavigrahaṃ || (16) ||

raktaṃ raktāraviṃdasthaṃ varābhayakamaṃḍaluṃ |
haṃsārūḍhavidhātāraṃ vade'kṣa srak samanvitaṃ || (17) ||

siṃhārūḍhāṃ śyāmalāṃgīṃ khaḍgakheṭakadhāriṇīṃ ||
adhasthāṃ dehalīṃ vaṃde paścimāsyāsurakṣiṇīṃ || (18) ||

pāśābhayadharaṃ vaṃde pūrṇeṃdu sadṛśachavīṃ ||
varuṇaṃ makarārūḍhaṃ dvāreśrīpāradaivate || (19) ||

kara kalita kapālaḥ kuṃḍalī daṃḍapāṇistaruṇa timira nīlovyālayajñopavītī ||
krama samaya saparyā vighnavidhvaṃsa heturjayati baṭukanāthaḥ siddhidaḥ 
sādhakānāṃ || (20) ||

dhūmravarṇo gadāhastaḥ kubero naravāhanaḥ ||
saumya dvārādhipaḥ pāyātparadevyā dhaneśvaraḥ || (21) ||

<p. 35b> 
vyālavyagrajaṭādharaṃ trinayanaṃ nīlāṃjanādri prabhaṃ dordaḍātta gadā 
kapālamaruṇasragvastragaṃdhojvalaṃ ||
ghaṃṭāghurghuramekhalādhvanimiladdhūṃkārabhīmaṃ vibhuṃ 
vaṃdehaṃsitasarpakumaṃḍaladharaṃ taṃ kṣetrapālaṃ sadā || (22) ||

sito gajāsyaḥ paraśuṃ daṃtaṃpāśaṃ triśūlakaṃ ||
bhujaiścatubhirbibhrāṇo mūṣakoparisaṃsthitaḥ || (23) ||

pūrvadvārādhipaḥ śakraḥ paradevyā (dhaneśvaraḥ ||) supītakaḥ ||
vajrahastaḥ sahasrākṣaḥ pāyādairāvataḥ sthitaḥ || (24) ||

gaṇeśaśyāmavarṇaṃ ca caturbāhuṃ digaṃbaraṃ ||
vāmadakṣordhva bāhubhyāṃ pāśāṃkuṃśa dharaṃ tathā || (25) ||

dakṣiṇādhaḥ kareṇaiva madhupūrṇaṃ kapālakaṃ ||
dadhānaṃ vāmahastena devyāmadanamaṃdiraṃ || (26) ||

spṛśanvāmāṃga saṃsthāyā raktāyā dakṣa pāṇinā ||
ātmayonaunyastaliṃgaṃ padmaṃ vāmena pāṇinā || (27) ||

dadhatyāḥ śuṃḍayā yoniṃ jighran dhyātvā prapūjayet ||
nīlāṃjana cayaprakhyaṃ yamaṃ mahiṣa vāhanaṃ || (28) ||

daṃḍamaṃḍitadordaṃḍaṃ dakṣadvārādhipaṃ bhaje ||

atha maṃcastha devatā dhyānaṃ ||

<p. 36a> 
akṣasrak pustakābhītīrdadhānāṃ bahubhirvaraṃ ||
trilocanāṃ smared devīṃ sarvaśuklāṃ sarasvatīṃ || (29) ||

padmadvaya varābhīti bhāsvatpāṇi catuṣṭayāṃ ||
nirdagdha hema gaurāṃgīṃ mahālakṣmīṃ trilocanā || (30) ||

varāṃkuśau pāśamabhīti śulaukarairdanyaṃbhavabhāvamūlaṃ ||
ghanāghanaugha prabhadeha kāṃtiṃ māyāṃ trinetrāṃ maniśaṃ smarāmi || (31) 
||

śaṃkhacakradhanurbāṇā ca dhārayaṃtī trilocanāṃ ||
dūrvādalanibhāṃ vaṃde dūrgāṃ dūrgārti nāśinīṃ || (32) ||

kapālaṃ kheṭakaṃ khaḍgaṃ triśūlaṃ bibhratīṃ karaiḥ ||
bhinnāṃjana cayaprakhyāṃ bhadrakālīṃ namāmyahaṃ || (33) ||

śakti svastika mudrābhī hastāṃ caṃdra samaprabhāṃ ||
trinetrāṃ saṃsmareddevīṃ svastiṃ svasti karīṃ parāṃ || (34) ||

raktotpala dvaṃdva varābhayānikarairbahaṃtīṃ smitaśobhivaktrīṃ || 
raktāṃ trinetrāmaruṇāṃbarāḍhyāṃ svāhāṃ bhaje devagaṇābhivaṃdyāṃ || 
(35) ||

śāli kalpalatāśārṅa bāṇapāṇi catuṣṭayā |
jvalatkāṃcana varṇābhā śubhaṃ kuryāchubhaṃkarī || (36) ||

pāśāṃkuśa varābhītīrbibhrattīmaruṇaprabhāṃ || 
<p. 36b> 
trinetrāṃ mātaraṃ vaṃde gaurīṃ raktāṃbaro jvalāṃ || (37) ||

nāghusalavarābhītirbibhratīṃ kāṃcanaprabhāṃ ||
mātaraṃ divyaratnāṃgīṃ lokadhātrī namāmyahaṃ || (38) ||

śvetāṃ śvetāṃbarāṃ śveta bhūṣaṇasragvilepanāṃ ||
padmadvaya varādarśa karāṃ vāgīśvarīṃ bhaje || (39) ||

iti śrīparadevatāyā maṃḍapadvārādhi devatānāṃ dhyānaṃ ||

itthaṃ dvāra devatāḥ dhyāyan pūjayediti ||

[śrīvidyānaṃdanāthena śivayoḥ priyasūnunā śrīśrīvidyānaṃdanāthena 
viracite saubhāgyaratnākare dvitīyastaraṃgaḥ] || (2) ||
tato maṃḍapāṃtaḥ praviśya vastreṇa dvāramāchādya ghaṃṭāvādana 
pūrvakaṃ paṃcagavyārghatoyābhyāmastramaṃtreṇa maṃḍapāṃtaḥ prokṣya 
nānāvarṇarajaścitraiḥ puṣpamālāvitānādyairmaṃḍapamalaṃkṛtya 
lākṣāsiṃdūrādibhirbhittistaṃbhādikamaruṇīkṛtya vedī paritaści sthāyinaḥ 
pradīpān prajvālya kālāgurvādibhirdhūpayitvā tadabhāve tādṛśaṃ dhyātvā 
tato maṃḍapasya | nair(-)ṛti koṇe || (4) vāstu puru śāṃya namaḥ || (4) 
vāstvadhīśvarāya brahmaṇe namaḥ ||

<p. 37a> 
īśāna bhāge || (4) kulanātha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi || (4) raktavarṇa dvārau 
daśaśakti sahita śrīdīpanātha pādukāṃ pū(0) | iti dīpanāthaṃ saṃpūjya ||
asmin kṣetre dīpanātha nirvighnaṃ siddhihetave || 
śrīcakrakramapūjārthamanujñāṃ dīyatāṃ mamī || (1) ||

iti dīpanāthājñāṃ prārthya || tataḥ paścimādi dvāracatuṣṭaye madhye ca || 
dūtaryaṃbā śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi || (4) (pūrvokta viparī)takṛt || 

phalakāyāṃ paṭebhittau sthāpayetta kadācana ||
sthāpitaṃ yadi mohena lobhenājñānatopi vā ||

kulaṃvittamapatyaṃ ca nirmūlayati sarvatheti || tathā lakṣasāgare || vaṃgetha 
sīsake lohena karttavyaṃ kadācaneti || śrīcakrastha pīṭhamānaṃ 
dravyapramāṇaṃ cāha || kūla mūlāvatāre || 

agniraṃgulavistāraṃ prāk pratyak dakṣiṇottarāṃ | 
pala pramāṇaṃ kartavyamarcā piṭhaṃ manoharaṃ ||

yavārddhāccaṃ prakurvīta caturasraṃ samaṃtataḥ ||
tasmin pīṭhe ca nirmāṇaṃ śrīcakrasya tu kārayet || iti ||

lakṣa sāgare ||
(agniraṃgulaṃ hemasya rajatasya tathaiva ca ||
tāmrasya pūrvasaṃkhyaiva māṇikyādau yathechayā ||) 

<p. 37b> 
suṃdaryaṃbāśrī(0) || (4) sumukhyaṃbāśrī(0) (4) virūpāṃbāśrī(0) (4) 
vimalāṃbāśrī(0) (4) aṃtaryaṃbāśrī(0) (4) badaryaṃbāśrī(0) (4) 
puraṃdaryaṃbāśrī(0) iti dvārasya vāmadakṣiṇayordvaṃdvaṃ sapūjya || madhye 
(4) puṣpamardinyaṃbāśrī(0) iti pūjayet || 

tataḥ tīkṣṇadaṃṣṭramahākāya kalpāṃtadehanopamaḥ ||
bhairavāya namastubhyaṃ manujñāṃ dātu marhasi || (1) ||

iti paṭhitvā bhairavājñāmādāyā aḥ pūḍiti pūjyā vedīṃ gatvā || sirasi (4) 
merupṛṣṭhaye ṛṣaye namaḥ || mukhe (4) sutalāyachaṃdase namaḥ || hṛdaye (4) 
pṛthivyai devatāyai nama iti vinyasya pṛthivī prārthane viniyogāḥ || iti 
kṛtāṃjalirukvā (4) 

pṛthvī tvayā dhṛtā lokā devitvaṃ viṣṇunā dhṛtā ||
tvaṃ ca dhāraya māṃ devi pavitraṃ kuru cāsanaṃ || (1) ||

iti pṛthivīṃ prārthya ||

japasthānaṃ mūlamaṃtreṇa vīkṣyāstreṇa prokṣyāstreṇaiva kuśaiḥ 
triḥsaṃtāḍya kavaca maṃtreṇābhyukṣya vakṣyamāsāṇa pīṭhapūjā krameṇa 
(4) maṃ maṃḍūkāya namaḥ || ityādi kālāgni rudrādi vedikāṃtaṃ saṃpūjya ||
tasyāṃ vedikāyāṃ yathoktamāsanasvāsanasthāne āstīrya tadastreṇa prokṣyā 
(4) hrīṃ ādhāraśakti kamalāsanāya namaḥ ||

<p. 38a> 
ityāsanaṃ saṃpūjya tasyāsanasyāgneṃyādi koṇeṣu (4) gaṃ gaṇapataye namaḥ || 
(4)
duṃ durgāyai namaḥ || (4) saṃ sarasvatyai namaḥ || (4) kṣeṃ kṣetrapālāya namaḥ | 
iti saṃpūjya tatra prāṅmukhaḥ padmādyāsanenopaviśya raktagaṃdhāṃbara       
sragābharaṇabhūṣitastāṃbūlā pūrita mukhaḥ 
karpūramṛganābhisuvāsitāṃbarosyāṃgaḥ pramudita cittaḥ śivohamiti 
vibhāvayan svaśirasi pūrvoktaṃ mātṛkābujaṃ dhyātvā gurūpadeśa vidhinā 
svapurataḥ samaṃ bhūtale nirmita saudhādisthaṃḍile siṃdūrādinā 
vakṣyamāṇaṃ śrīcakramuddharet || athavā svarṇādi paṭṭe nirmitaṃ 
vakṣyamāṇa vidhinā pratiṣṭhitaṃ caṃdanādi pīṭhe purataḥ saṃsthāpya 
vakṣyamāṇa samaṣṭi yoginī maṃtreṇa puṣpāṃjaliṃ kṣipet || tatpratiṣṭha 
prakārastu śrītaṃtrarāje ||

cakre devyāṃ tathā śiṣye pratiṣṭhā trividhocyate ||
sā ca tatvavidā kārya saṃpradāyānurodhinā || (1) ||

cakre pūjā cakre | devyā devi mūrtau | tatvavidā pratiṣṭhā vidhijñena 
pūrṇābhiṣiktena gurutaḥ prāsānujñena | taduktaṃ taṃtrarāje ||

gurvanujñāmṛte mohāllobhādvā kurute yadi ||
<p. 38b> 
sa putradāro nidhanaṃ prāpnuvaṃnnirayaṃ vrajet || (2) ||

tasmāt pūrṇābhiṣekene prātyānujñaḥ samācaret || iti ||

evaṃ vidhena kriyamāṇāyāṃ pratiṣṭhāyāṃ kālaviśeṣastatraiva | 

sthire śubhagrahopete'nukūle guṇaśālini |
mūhūrtte kārayedyadvā pūrṇāyāṃ vā śubhodaye || (1) ||

akṣaratraya saṃpāta dine pūrṇā dina traye ||
prokteṣu paṃca svanyeṣu sarvadā vā śubhodaye || (2) ||

pūrṇāyāṃ paurṇamāsyāṃ |
akṣaratraya saṃpāta dine ekasyaivākṣarasya dinākṣaratvenodayākṣaratvena ca 
sthitiryasmin dine ||
anyeṣu paṃcaparvasu gurorjanmadina vidyā prāpti dina svajanmadina darśa 
gurumaraṇadineṣviti || pūrṇāyāṃ viśeṣamāha || yadveti || pūrvokta 
lakṣaṇayutadināsiddhau pūrṇāyāmeva svātmanaḥ śvāsasya śubhodaye 
pakṣāṃtaramāha | sarvadā vā śubhodaya iti || tatra tatva vidā kṛtātma 
sākṣāṃtkāreṇa prokta tithivārādikaṃ sarvamanavekṣya svātmanaḥ śvāsasya 
śubhodaya evetyarthaḥ || kuryādi ayaṃ pakṣaḥ siddhaviṣayaḥ || nānyaiḥ kāryaḥ |
kuryāt pratiṣṭhāṃ siddhātmānatvanyojñānagarvita iti tatraivokta tvāt || 

<p. 39a> 
tatrāpi saṃpradāyānurodhinā vidita tatvanapi nityanaimitikopāsti niratena || 
tatrādau śrīcakrādhikaraṇāni(0) śrīrudrayāmale |

tataḥ kuṃkumasiṃdūraiḥ kāryaṃ yaṃtraṃ tu yoginā ||
sauvarṇo rajate tāmre sphāṭike vai drume tathā ||

cakre yathokta vidhinā pūjyā devī narottamairiti || tathā ca taṃtrarāje ||

ratne hemanirūpe vā tāmre dṛṣadi ca kramāt ||
kṛtvā cakrasya nirmāṇaṃ sthāpayet pūjayedapi ||

lakṣmīṃkāṃtaṃ yaśaḥ putra dhanārogyādi siddhaye || 

dṛṣadigaṃḍakīśilāyāṃ ||
gaṃḍakī bhava pāṣāṇe svarṇe rajata tāmrayoriti dakṣiṇāmūrtti saṃhitā 
vacanāt || atha dhātu viśeṣe pūjākāla saṃkhyā viśeṣamāha || ratnasāgare ||

yāvajjīvaṃ suvarṇe syādrūpye dvāviṃśatiḥ priye |
tāmre dvādaśakaṃ varṣaṃ tadarddha bhūrjapatrake || 

iti || sārasaṃgrahe ||

tāmre dvāda (*) kaṃ varṣaṃ sphāṭikādau tu sarvadā ||
teṣāṃ madhye sphāṭikaṃ tu sarvasiddhipradaṃ bhavet ||

śrīcakramiti śeṣaḥ | athāddhikaraṇa viśeṣe phalaviśeṣamāha || lakṣasāgare ||

bhūmau siṃdūrarajasā racitaṃ sarvakāmadaṃ ||
<p. 39b> 
suvarṇa racitaṃ yaṃtraṃ sarvarāja vaṃśaṃkaraṃ ||
rajatena kṛtaṃ yaṃtraṃmāyorārogya kāmadaṃ ||

tāmre tu racitaṃ yaṃtraṃ sarvaiśvarya pradaṃ mataṃ ||
yaṃtraṃ hi sphāṭike devi manobhilaṣita pradaṃ ||

māṇikya likhitaṃ yaṃtraṃ rājyadaṃ muktidaṃ yataṃ ||
gomeda racitaṃ yaṃtraṃ sarvaiśvarya pradaṃ mataṃ ||
kḷptaṃ marakatairyyaṃtraṃ sarvaśatruvināśanaṃ ||
loha trayodbhavaṃ yaṃtraṃ sarvasiddhikaraṃ mataṃ ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

loha trayodbhavaṃ yaṃtraṃ kathaṃ kāryaṃ maheśvara ||
tanme vadasva kṛpayā yadyahaṃ tava vallabhā ||

śrī īśvara uvāca ||

bhāgā daśa suvarṇasya rajatasya ca ṣoḍaśa ||
tāmrasya ravibhāgena pīṭhaṃ kuryānmanoharaṃ ||

tasmin pīṭhe tu nirmāṇaṃ śrīcakrasya tu kārayet ||
śāṃtidaṃ puṣṭidaṃ proktaṃ sarvaśatru nivarhaṇaṃ ||

āyurārogyajanakaṃ kāṃtidaṃ puṣṭidaṃ matamiti ||

atha cakrasya prastārabhedena traividhyaṃ tatraiva ||
traividhyaṃ śruṇu cakrasya bhūprastārordhva merukaṃ ||

pātālavāsināṃ devi prastāro nimna rekhakaḥ ||
ūrdhvarekhaṃ maheśāni martyaloka nivāsināṃ ||

svargalokādhivāsināṃ yaṃtrarāṭ meru saṃjñakaḥ ||

<p. 40a> 
bhūpuraṃ tu samārabhya baiṃdavāṃtaṃ maheśvari ||
kramāt samunnataṃ sarvaṃ merurūpaṃ mayoditaṃ ||

samordhvarekhaṃ navakamūrdhvarekhaṃ prakīrtitaṃ ||
nimnarekhāsamāyogādbhūprastāro prastāro mayoditaḥ ||

yaṃtrarāja svarūpaṃ te mayā snehāt prakāśitaṃ ||
gopanīyaṃ tvayā bhadre svaguhyamiva saṃtatami ||

athai tatprastāra trayasya phalāni prastārāṃtaraṃ ca taṃtrarāje ||
caturasraṃ samārabhya navacakrāṇyanukramāt ||

unnatonnatamā madhyāccakraṃ syānnidhanaṃ dhanaṃ ||
tritrikramādunnattaṃ tadaprajatvaṃ śriyaṃ labhet ||

ekadvitrikramonnāmaṃ śriyai kīrtye ca kalpate ||
navāni samarūpāṇi sarvābhīṣṭārthasiddhaye ||

tathā kulamulāvatāre ||

uchritaṃ kramaśo devi vittaprāptistatomṛtiḥ ||
bhūcakraṃ ṣoḍaśāraṃ cāpyaṣṭāraṃ ca samaṃ bhavet ||

śeṣamunnatamīśāni cārthāptya prajadaṃ bhavet ||
caturasraṃ samaṃ devi ṣoḍaśārādi biṃdukaṃ ||

mithaḥ samunnataṃ devi śriyai kīrtyai ca kalpate ||
caturasraṃ samārabhya biṃdvataṃ samarekhakaṃ ||

tathā śrīḥ kīrtirārogyamamṛtāyopakalpate || iti ||

<p. 40b> 
atha śrīcakrādhikaraṇe niṣiddha dhātūn anyāni niṣiddhādhikaraṇāni cāha || 
taṃtrarāje ||

sīsakāsyādiṣu punaḥ pūrvoktaviparītakṛt ||
phalakāyāṃ paṭe bhittau sthāpayetta kadācana ||

sthāpitaṃ yadi mohena lobhenājñānatopi vā ||
kulaṃvittamapatyaṃ ca nirmūlayati sarvatheti ||

tathā lakṣasāgare ||

vaṃgethasīsake lohena kartavyaṃ kadācaneti ||
śrīcakrasya pīṭhamānaṃ dravyapramāṇaṃ cāha ||

kulamūlāvatāre ||

agniraṃgulavistāraṃ prāk pratyaka dakṣiṇottaraṃ ||
palapramāṇaṃ karttavyamarcāpiṭhaṃ manoharaṃ ||

yavārddhāccaṃ prakurvīta caturasraṃ samaṃtataḥ ||
tasmin pīṭhe ca nirmāṇaṃ śrīcakrasya tu kārayet ||

<p. 41a> 
sautrāmaṇitaṃtre ||

rajurekhā bhavellakṣmī vakrarekhā daridratā ||
agniraṃgulavistāro yavārddhenochriti bhavet || iti ||

lakṣasāgare ||

agniraṃgulaṃ hemasya rajatasya tathaiva ca ||
tāmrasya pūrvasaṃkhyaiva māṇidau yathechayā ||

<p. 41b> 
agniraṃgulavistāramiti hemasyeti ca divyatvāt || tryaṃgulavistārāyāmityarthaḥ || 
palaṃ viṃśatyuttaratriśataguṃjāparimitaṃ || ādi padena puṣpanīlādayo 
ratnaviśeṣā ucyate || tryaṃgulavistārastu mānāṃtarāṃgulamānena || 
vedikāpīṭhaśibikā rathādīnāṃ vidhiḥ punaḥ | mānāṃtarāgulenaiva 
bhavennānyena kenacaditi || mahākapilapaṃcarātravacanāt || 
śrīcakrādhikaraṇasya pīṭhaśabda vācyatvāt pīṭhaśabda pratipādaka vacanāni 
tu prāgeva likhitāni || mānāṃtarāṃgula lakṣaṇaṃ kapila paṃcarātra eva || 

vinyastaistiryyagaṣṭābhiryavairmānāṃtarāṃgulaṃ || 
śālibhirvā ṛjunyastaistribhirmānāṃtaraṃ bhavediti || 

athaitatpratiṣṭhāprakāraḥ || 

tatra taṃtrarāje ||

kṣaudrājya dugdhaiḥ prathamaṃ nārikelāṃbhasā tataḥ ||
abhiṣecyātha toyena kvathitenākṣarauṣadhaiḥ ||

āvāhyābhyarcatallagne cakre saṃsthāpya pūjayet ||
nityāttatvāpti kālottha vidyayābhyarcyatāḥ kramāt ||

spṛśan japet karāgreṇa śrīcakraṃ pūjayedapi ||
evaṃ dinatrayaṃ kṛtvā tato nityakramaṃ bhajet ||

gaṃdhaiḥ puṣpairnavairdhūpai dīpairnaivedya tarpaṇaiḥ ||
<p. 42a> 
trirātraṃ pūjayeddevīṃ yogibhīḥ samaṃ (* * *) ||

evaṃ devī pratiṣṭhāyāṃ kramaḥ sānnidhya kārakaṃ iti ||

athaitatprayogaḥ ||

tatra yathokta mānena nirmitaṃ cakraṃ svarṇādi dhātu nirmitaṃ cedamlarasena 
śuddhaṃ prakṣālitaṃ vedokta vividhinā kṛtāgnyattāraṇaṃ kvacitpātre 
saṃsthāpya tatrāgne dīkṣāprakaraṇe vakṣyamāṇa śubhamāsapakṣarkṣa 
tithivārakaraṇamūhūrtta viśiṣṭe sādhakasya caṃdratārādyunukūle divase 
sthiralagne madhvājya dugdhanārikelajalaiḥ pṛthak pṛthagabhiṣicya sugaṃdha 
salilenāpyabhiṣiṃca paṃcāśadakṣarauṣadhi kvāthajalenāpyabhiṣiṃcya punaḥ 
sugaṃdhajalaiḥ prakṣālya pūrvavat dvārapūjādi pīṭhapūjāṃtaṃ kṛtvā 
tasmin pīṭhe taccakraṃ saṃsthāpya tathaiva pīṭha maṃtrāṃtaṃ saṃpūjya 
tasmiṃścakre devīmāvāhya taddina nityā vidyayā vighā tṛtīyakūṭena 
mūlavidyayā ca pratyekaṃ tritrivāramabhyarcya yathokta vidhināṃgāvaraṇa 
pūjāṃ vidhāya pūvokta ṣaṭtriṃśaduttara satyaśatādhikaviṃśati 
sahasrasaṃkhyābhiḥ kālanityā vidyābhiścakraṃ spṛśan abhimaṃtrya punaḥ 
śrīcakra pūjā krameṇa saṃpūjya dhūpadīpādi nānāvidhabhojyairdevīṃ 
śaktisāmayikāṃśca tathaiva saṃpūjya saṃtarpya praṇamya visṛjet | 
  
<p. 42b> 
dinatrayaṃ devīṃ na visṛjet || pratyahaṃ trisaṃdhyaṃ kramārcanaṃ ca kuryāt | iti 
pratiṣṭhite cakre nityārcanādi kuryāditi | mūrtti pratiṣṭhāyāmapyeṣa eva 
vidhirjñeyaḥ || tatra sthirāyāṃ visarjanaṃ nāstīti viśeṣaḥ || iti cakrarājaṃ 
samudhṛtya svavāmāgre vakṣamāṇavidhinā sarvabhūta baliṃ datvā bali 
sthānādūttarataḥ pakṣirājaṃ dhyāyet tadyathā || 

aṣṭāpadaṃ pakṣati mūla rāja
dvajrāṃkuraṃ hāṭaka pakṣa kūṃṭaṃ ||
hemāgamaṃgīkṛta padmarāgaṃ 
caṃcūpuṭollāsi mukhāraviṃdaṃ || (1) ||

sūryānaleṃdudyutirājamānaṃ netratrayollāsitapadmarāgaṃ ||
nīlāśmadīptākhilaromasaṃghaṃ śītāṃśukhaṃḍojvalitottamāṃgaṃ
raviprā hi dvaṃdvabaddhottamakapiśajaṭābhāra saṃcārigaṃgā(-)
bhaṃgākrāṃtottamāṃgātkramagalitapṛṣat saṃgahārābhirāmaṃ ||
agroghannāgavaṃdhakramaghaṭitaphaṭāgraṃthipaṃcāṃgulodyat 
puchasthagrathiṃbāhūdbhavabhujagayugollāsimālābhirāmaṃ || (3) ||

kakṣāsaṃbaddhavaiśyā hi padayugalalasaccaṃdratīvrāṃśulīlā
<p. 43a> 
ghaṃṭāṭopākulāśādeśakapatikulaṃ vairisaṃghaikapālaṃ || 
pāśākārāṃsaloladvṛṣalakulabhaṃvāsīviṣādhīśabhoga
sphūrjat phūtkāraghoraṃ khurapuṭanikarakṣaṇa sarvaṃ sahāṃtaṃ || (4) ||

bhakṣayaṃtaṃ pakṣirūpaṃ bhaktānāṃ vairi saṃcayaṃ ||
śalabhaṃ sālvaṃ rūpaṃ ca dhyāyedekāgramānasaḥ || (5) ||

iti śalabharūpaṃ śivaṃ dhyātvā (4) oṃ ai hrī śrīṃ oṃ nnamo bhagavate śalabha 
sālvāya pakṣirājāya mama śatrunnāśaya nāśaya ghe ghe hūṃ phaṭ svāhā || 
