paritastrirbhrāmaṇena bahiprākāra trayaṃ ca kṛtvā mūlavidyayā 
prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā praṇavadvādaśāvṛtyā nāḍī śuddhiṃ vidhāya 
bhūtaśuddhi kuryāt || tadyathā pādādi jānuparyaṃtaṃ pṛthvī sthānaṃ 
caturasraṃ vajralāṃchitaṃ pītavarṇaṃ brahmadaivatyaṃ nivṛtti kalādhiṣṭhitaṃ 
laṃ bījayuktaṃ ciṃtayetvā || jānvādi nābhiparyaṃtaṃ apāṃ 
sthānamarddhacaṃdrākāraṃ śuklavarṇaṃ śṛṃgadvayepi padmalaṃchitaṃ 
viṣṇudaivatyaṃ pratiṣṭhā kalādhiṣṭhitaṃ vaṃ bījayuktaṃ dhyātvā 
nābhyādikaṃṭhaparyaṃtaṃ vahnimaṃḍalaṃ svastikopetaṃ trikoṇākāraṃ 
raktavarṇaṃ rudradaivatyaṃ vidyā kalādhiṣṭhitaṃ raṃ bījayuktaṃ dhyātvā 
kaṃṭhādi bhrūmadhyaparyaṃtaṃ 
vāyumaṃḍalaṃ ṣaṭkoṇākāraṃ ṣaṭbiṃdulāṃchitaṃ vṛttopetaṃ 
kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ iśvaradaivatyaṃ śāṃtikalādhiṣṭhitaṃ yaṃ bījayuktaṃ 
vicityabhrūmadhyādi brahmaraṃdhraparyaṃtaṃ ākāśa sthānaṃ vṛttākāraṃ 
dhvajalāṃchitaṃ dhūmravarṇaṃ sadāśivadaivatyaṃ śāṃtyatīte 
kalādhiṣṭhitaṃ haṃ bījayuktaṃ dhyātvā || 

<p. 45b> 
tatra paṃcabhūta maye dehe | dharmakaṃdasamudbhūtaṃ 
jñānanālakamaiśvaryāṣṭadalopetaṃ paraṃ vairāgya karṇikaṃ 
svahṛdayāraviṃdaṃ vibhyāvya tatkarṇikāyāṃ jīvātmānamārāgramātraṃ 
pradīpa kalikābhāsuramanādimalasaṃchannaṃ paracidrūpaṃ saṃciṃtya yoni 
mudrāṃ badhvā prāgukta rūpeṇa mūlā dhārātkuṃḍalinīmutthāpya 
suṣumṇā vartmanā mulādhārā ghanāhatāṃta cakrastha varṇavarṇādhi 
devatāgra saṃtīṃ hṛdaya kamalamānīyatayā kavalīkṛtaṃ jīvātmānaṃ 
dhyāyansuṣumṇā vartmanā viśudhyādi cakrastha varṇavarṇādhi 
devatāgrasaṃtī brahmaraṃdhraṃ nītvā tatra sthita sahasradala kamalakarṇikā 
madhyavarttinī paramātmajyotiṣi sarvavarṇavarṇādhidevatā kadaṃbakaṃ 
jīvātmānaṃ (4) haṃsaḥ iti maṃtreṇa saṃyojya astreṇa rakṣā kṛtvā 
kuṃḍalinīṃ svasthānamāniyatatva saṃhāraṃ kuryāt || tadyathā ||

