tatsaṃsarga padadvaṃdvamaṃgapratyaṃgapātakaṃ ||

upapātakaromāṇa raktaśmaśruvilocanaṃ ||
khaḍgacarmadharaṃ kruddhaṃ kukṣaupāpaṃ viciṃyetat ||

iti pāpapuruṣa viciṃtyaṃ vāmanāsāraṃdhre sāyaṃ bījena 
