kuṃbhakena yaṃ bījaṃ catuḥṣaṣṭhivāramāvarttayan

<p. 47a> 
tadusthitena mahāvāyunā sahapāpapuruṣaṃ svaśarīraṃ saṃśoṣyayaṃ 
