sa cātra vidyāyāṃ śuddhaka kalāmūrti prapaṃcayāga bhedāccaturvidhaḥ || 
śuddhādayopyasyāṃ vidyāyāṃ trayodaśa vidhāḥ || śuddho biṃduyuto

<p. 50a> 
visargayukto viṃduvisargayukto hṛllekhādmo lakṣmyādyaḥ kāmabījādyo 
māyāśrī kāmabījādyo bālā saṃpuṭitaḥ parā saṃpuṭitaḥ 
śrīvidyānvitohaṃsādika paramahaṃsādikaśceti || kalā yuktopi dvividhaḥ || 
tārokṣakalāṃ nyāsastejastritayottha kalā mātṛkā nyāsaśceti || mūrtinyāsopi 
dvividhaḥ || keśavādi śrīkaṃṭhādi bhedāt || caturthaḥ prapaṃcayāgaḥ || 
tatrādau mātṛkā varṇaiḥ prāṇāyāma trayaṃ kṛtvā nyāsaṃ samārabhet | tatra 
svarai pūrakaḥ paṃcavargaiḥ kuṃbhakaḥ yādibhirecakaḥ | iti mātṛkā 
prāṇāyāmaḥ itthaṃ prāṇāyāma trayaṃ kṛtvā nyāsaṃ kuryāt tatrātha 
prathamaṃ śuddha mātṛkā nyāsaḥ || 

oṃ asya śrīśuddha mātṛkā nyāsasya brahmā ṛṣiḥ gāyatrī chaṃdaḥ 
śrīmātṛkā sarasvatī devatā halo bījāni svarāḥ śaktayaḥ avyaktaṃ kīlakaṃ | 
mama śrīvidyāṃgatve nyāse viniyogaḥ || iti kṛtāṃjaliḥ | ṛṣyādikaṃ smṛtvā 
mūrddhādiṣu vinyaset || tadyathā || śirasi (4) brahmaṇe ṛṣaye namaḥ || mukhe (4) 
gāyatrī chaṃdase namaḥ | 

<p. 50b> 
hṛdaye (4) śrīmātṛkā sarasvatyai devatāyai namaḥ | guhye (4) halvyo vījebhyo 
