<p. 54a> 
dakṣādhaḥ karamārabhya vāmādhaḥ karaparyaṃtaṃ āyudha dhyānaṃ ||
iti varṇāraviṃde dhyātvā (4) hrīṃ aṃ namaḥ | ityādi kṣākārāṃtān varṇān 
