nigamāgama saṃkḷpta samunnati suśobhitaṃ || (5) ||

śivaśaktyātmaka chāyā samāśrita jagattrayaṃ ||
yamāśritya munīṃdraudyāḥ vāṃchitārthān prapedire || (6) ||

evaṃ bhūtārṇa vṛkṣasya mūle tvakṣara paṃkaje ||
vāgīśvarīṃ smarennityaṃ sakaleṣṭa phalapradāṃ || (7) ||

