hastāṃbhojairvarajapavaṭīṃ pustakaṃ puṃkapālaṃ ||
bibhrāṇāṃ tāṃ madhumadala sadvihvalā yugma netrāṃ 
devīṃ dhyāyellipi mayatanuṃ yauvan prāptaśobhāṃ || (8) ||

