sarvavaśaṃkariṇī śaktyai(0) | vāmapārśve (4) jhaṃ sarvaraṃjinī śaktyai(0) | 
vāmāṃtye (4) ñaṃ sarvonmādānakāriṇīśaktyai(0) | vāmakapole (4) ṭaṃ 
sarvārthasādhinī śaktyai(0) | lalāṭa vāmapārśve (4) ṭhaṃ sarvasaṃpatprapūriṇī 
śaktyai(0) | lalāṭe (4) ḍaṃ sarvamaṃtramayīśaktyai(0) | cūḍādhaḥ (4) ḍhaṃ 
sarvadvaṃdvakṣayaṃkarī śaktyai namaḥ | iti vinyasya | hṛdaye (4) haiṃ ha klīṃ 
hasauḥ tripuravāsinī cakreśvaryai namaḥ || tasyā dakṣe (4) īśitvaśidhyai namaḥ | 
tasyā vāme | blūṃ sarvavasya mudrāyai namaḥ | iti vinyasya (4) etāḥ 
saṃpradāyayoginyaḥ

<p. 82a> 
sarvasaubhāgyadāyake cakre samudrā ityādi vyāpakaṃ nyaset | blūṃ iti 
sarvavaśyamudrāṃ pradarśayet || iti caturthāvaraṇanyāsaḥ |

tataḥ (4) hasaiṃ hasklīṃ hasauḥ sarvārthasādhaka cakrāya nama iti vyāpakaṃ 
vinyasya | tato bahirdaśāra cakrāya nama iti vyāpakaṃ vinyasya | dakṣanetre 
(4) ṇaṃ sarvasiddhipradādevyai namaḥ || nāsāmūle (4) taṃ 
sarvasaṃpatpradādevyai(0) | vāmanetre (4) thaṃ sarvapriyaṃkarī devyai(0) | 
vāmakukṣerupari (4) daṃ sarvamaṃgalakāriṇī devyai(0) | vāmakukṣeradhaḥ | (4) 
dhaṃ sarvakāmapradādevyai(0) | vāmajānuni (4) naṃ sarvaduḥkhavimocinī devyai(0) |
dakṣajānuni (4) paṃ sarvamṛtyupraśamanī devyai(0) | gude (4) phaṃ 
sarvavighnavināśinī devyai(0) dakṣakukṣeradhaḥ (4) baṃ sarvāṃgasuṃdarī devyai(0) 
| dakṣakukṣerupari | (4) bhaṃ sarvasaubhāgyadāyinī devyai namaḥ | iti vinyasya(0) 
hṛdaye (4) hasaiṃ hsklīṃ hasauḥ tripurāśrīcakreśvaryai namaḥ || tasyā dakṣe (4) 
vaśitva śidhyai namaḥ | tasyā vāme | (4) saḥ sarvonmādinī mudrāyai namaḥ | iti 
vinyasya || (4) etāḥ kulakaula yoginyaḥ sarvārthasādhake cakre samudrā ityādi (4) 
vyāpakaṃ kuryāt | saḥ sarvonmādinimudrāṃ prada(0) | iti 
paṃcamāvaraṇanyāsaḥ ||

tataḥ | (4) hrīṃ klīṃ ble sarvarakṣākara cakrāya namaḥ || tatoṃtardaśāracakrāya 
namaḥ iti vyāpakaṃ vinyasya || 

<p. 82b> 
dakṣanāsāpuṭe (4) maṃ sarvajñā devyai namaḥ | dakṣasṛkkiṇi (4) yaṃ 
sarvaśaktidevyaiḥ | dakṣastane (4) raṃ sarvaiśvarya pradā devyai(0) | dakṣamuṣke (4) 
laṃ sarvajñānamayī devyai(0) | sīvanyāṃ (4) vaṃ sarvavyādhivināśinī devyai(0) 
vāmamuṣke (4) śaṃ sarvādhārasvarūpā devyai(0) | vāmastane (4) ṣaṃ 
sarvapāpaharā devyai(0) | vāma sṛkkiṇi (4) saṃ sarvānaṃdamayī devyai(0) 
vāmanāsāpuṭe (4) haṃ sarvarakṣāsvarūpiṇī devyai(0) | nāsāgre (4) kṣaṃ 
sarvasthita phalapradādevyai namaḥ | iti vinyasya | hṛdaye (4) hrīṃ klīṃ bleṃ 
tripurā mālinīcakreśvaryai namaḥ | tasyā dakṣiṇe | (4) prākāmya sidhyai namaḥ | 
tasyā vāme kroṃ mahāṃkuśā mudrāyai(0) | iti vinyasya | (4) etāḥ 
nigarbhayoginyaḥ sarvarakṣākare cakre samudrā ityādi vyāpakaṃ kuryāt || kroṃ 
ityaṃkuśa mudrāṃ pradarśayediti ṣaṣṭhāvaraṇanyāsaḥ ||

tataḥ (4) hrīṃ śrīṃ sauḥ sarvarogaharacakrāya namaḥ tato'ṣṭāracakrāya namaḥ 
iti vyāpakaṃ vinyasya || cibuka dakṣapārśve (4) aṃ āṃ (14) blūṃ vaśinī 
vāgdevatāyai namaḥ | kaṃṭha dakṣabhāge (4) kaṃ (4) blūṃ hrīṃ kāmeśvarī 
vāgadevatāyai(0) | hṛdaya dakṣapārśve (4) aṃ āṃ (14) blūṃ vaśinī vāgdevatāyai 
namaḥ | nābherdakṣapārśve (4) ṭaṃ (4) ylūṃ vimalā vāgdevatāyai(0) | 
nābhervāmapārśve (4) taṃ (4) jmrīṃ aruṇāvāgdevatāyai(0) | 

<p. 83a> 
hṛdayaṃ vāmapāśve (4) paṃ (4) hasalavyūṃ jayinī vāgdevatāyai(0) | kaṃṭha 
vāmabhāge (4) yaṃ (3) jhamarayīṃ sarveśvarī vāgdevatāyai(0) | cibuka vāmabhāge 
(4) śaṃkṣmrīṃ kaulinī vāgdevatāyai namaḥ | iti vinyasya | hṛdaye (4) hrīṃ śrīṃ 
sauḥ tripurā siddhācakreśvaryai(0) | tasyā dakṣe | (4) bhukti sidhyai(0) | tasyā vāme (4) 
hasakhphraṃ khecarīmudrāyai namaḥ | iti vinyasya | 

(4) etā rahasya yoginyaḥ sarvaroga hare cakre samudrā ityādivyāpakaṃ kuryāt 
hasakhphreṃ iti khecarī mudrāṃ pradarśayediti saptamāvaraṇa nyāsaḥ ||

tataḥ aṃtarālacakrāya namaḥ | iti vyāpakaṃ vinyasya | hṛdaya trikoṇasya 
bahirdakṣa vāma vāmadakṣeṣu (4) drāṃ drīṃ klīṃ blūṃ saḥ | yāṃ rāṃ lāṃ 
vāṃ sāṃ jaṃbhanebhyaḥ kāmeśvara kāmerī bāṇebhyo namaḥ | 
hṛdayasyāgneye || (4) dhaṃ thaṃ mohanābhyāṃ kāmeśvara kāmeśvarī 
cāpābhyāṃ namaḥ | hṛdayasya īśānabhāge | (4) ā hrīṃ vaśīkaraṇābhyāṃ 
kāmeśvara kāmeśvarī pāśābhyāṃ namaḥ | hṛdaya nair(-)ṛtye | (4) kroṃ kroṃ 
staṃbhanābhyāṃ kāmeśvara kāmeśvaryaṃ kuśābhyāṃ namaḥ | hṛdaya 
vāyavye | iti vinyasya | (4) hasraiṃ haslīṃ hasrauḥ sarvasiddhipradacakrāya namaḥ | (4)
trikoṇacakrāya namaḥ iti vyāpakaṃ vinyasya | trikoṇasyāgrakoṇe (4) 
prathakūṭamuccārya agnicakre kāmagiripīṭhe mitrīśanāthātmike 
jagṛddaśādhiṣṭhāyake ichāśaktyātmaka rudrātmaśakti śrīkāmeśvarī devyai 
namaḥ | 

<p. 83b> 
trikoṇasya vāmakoṇe (4) dvitīkūṭaṃ uccārya sūryacakre 
jālaṃdharapīṭhe ṣaṣṭhīśanāthātmike svapnadaśādhiṣṭhāyake 
jñānaśaktyātmaka viṣṇavātmaśakti śrīvajreśvarī devyai namaḥ ||
dakṣakoṇe (4) tṛtīyakūṭamuccārya somacakre pūrṇagiripīṭhe 
uḍḍīśanāthātmike suṣuptidaśādhiṣṭhāyake kriyāśaktyātmaka 
brahmātmaśakti śrībhagamālinī devyai namaḥ | iti vinyasya | hṛdaye (4) hasraiṃ 
hasakalarīṃ hasrauḥ tripurāṃbikā cakreśvaryai namaḥ | tasyādakṣe (4) ichā 
sidhyai namaḥ | tasyā vāme (4) hasauṃ sarvabīja mudrāyai namaḥ | iti vinyasya (4) 
etāḥ parāpararahasya yoginyaḥ sarvasiddhi prade cakre samudrā ityādi vyāpakaṃ 
kuryāt hasauṃ iti bījamudrāṃ pradarśayediti aṣṭāvaraṇanyāsaḥ ||

tataḥ (4) turīyavidyāmuccārya sarvānaṃdamayacakrāya namaḥ | biṃducakrāya 
namaḥ | iti vyāpakaṃ vinyasya | hṛdaya trikoṇamadhyasya biṃdumadhye (4) turīya 
vidyāmuccārya brahmacakre mahoḍyāṇapīṭhe śrīcaryānāthātmike 
turyaturyyātīta daśādhiṣṭhāyake parabrahmātma śakti 
śrīmahātripurasuṃdaryai devyai namaḥ |

<p. 84a> 
hṛdaya eva (4) mūlapaṃcadaśīmuccārya śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī cakreśvaryai 
namaḥ | tasyā dakṣe (4) prāpti sidhyai namaḥ | tasyā vāme | (4) aiṃ yonimudrāyai 
namaḥ | iti vinyasya (4) eṣā parāparāti rahasya yoginīḥ sarvānaṃdamaye 
mahācakre parabrahma svarūpiṇī parāmṛtaśaktiḥ sarvamatreśvarī 
sarvavidyeśvarī sarvapīṭheśvarī sarvavīreśvarī sarvayogeśvari sarvavāgiśvari 
sarvasiddheśvarī sakala jagadutpatti mātṛkā sacakrā sadevatā samudrā sasiddhiḥ 
sāyudhā sāsanā savāhanā saparivārā sālaṃkārā sarvopacāraiḥ 
śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī parayā cāparayā parāparayā ca saparyayā pūjitāḥ 
saṃtuṣṭāstu namaḥ | iti vyāpakaṃ vinyasya | 

punarhṛdaya eva mulamuccārya samastacakreśvarī śrīmahātripurasuṃdaryai 
devyai namaḥ | tasyā dakṣe (4) sarvakāmasidhyai namaḥ | tasyā vāme | (4) hasraiṃ 
hasakalmī hasrauḥ trikhaṃḍā mudrāyai namaḥ |

<p. 84b> 
iti hṛdaya eva vinyasya aiṃ yonimudrāṃ pradarśayet | hṛdaya trikoṇa evāgrādi 
vāmāvarttena pravatritārādi caturthī namoṃ tattattannityā nāmāṃ 
tattattannityā vidyayā nityāṣoḍaśakaṃ vinyasya hṛdaya trikoṇasya pṛṣṭhabhāge 
rekhātrayaṃ vibhāvya tatra pūjā prakaraṇe vakṣyamāṇaṃ gurupaṃkti trayaṃ 
nyaset | tato hṛdaya trikoṇasyāṣṭa koṇasya cāṃtarāleṣu pūjā prakaraṇe 
vakṣyamāṇa prakāreṇa ṣaḍaṃga yuvatirvinyasya biṃducakramadhye 
vakṣyamāṇa prakāreṇa paṃcapaṃcaka devatāḥ vinyasya dakṣāṃsapṛṣṭha 
tatkarṇa pṛṣṭha tachaṃkha tadbhāla taddakṣināsāpuṭacibuka hṛdayāvadhi 
ca ṣaṭdarśaṇa devatā vinyasya biṃducakra eva vakṣyamāṇa prakāreṇa 
catuḥsamaya devatāḥ vinyasya turīya vidyayā sarvāṃge vyāpakaṃ vinya (*) tato 
mūlavidyāmuccārya mahoḍyānapīṭhanilaya sarvacakreśvarī dhyāta paṃca 
śrīpaṃcakośa paṃcakalpalatā paṃcakāmadughā paṃcaratna 
vṛṃdamaṃḍitāsana saṃsthita sarvadarśanaśevita ṣaḍaṃga yuvatīstuta 
catuḥsamaya devatā pūjita mahāsaubhāgya janana mahāmokṣaprada 
śūnyāśūnya vivarjita saśakti saccidānaṃda parabrahma 
śrīmanmahātripurasuṃdarī śrīpādukāyai nama 

<p. 85a> 
iti mūrddhādi pādaparyaṃtaṃ trirvyāpakaṃ nyaset | tato brahmaraṃdhre 
svagurupādukā vinyasya mūlādhāre svaguru kṛta svanāma vinyasya tatraiva 
mahākāmakalā dhyānaṃ kuryāt || iti saṃhāra śrīcakranyāsaḥ ||

atha sṛṣṭi śrīcakranyāsaḥ ||

tatra śirasi (4) trikoṇaṃ vibhāvya | oṃ aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ turīyavidyāmuccārya | 
sarvānaṃdamaya mahācakrāya namaḥ | biṃducakrāya namaḥ || iti vyāpakaṃ 
vinyasya |

tatra śirastrikoṇastha mahābiṃdau turīyavidyāmuccārya brahmacakre 
śrīmahoḍyāṇapīṭhe ityādi pūrvavadvinyasya | bhrūmadhye mūlavidyāccārya 
prāgvat tāmeva cakreśvarīṃ vinyasya taddakṣiṇa vāmapārśvayoḥ prāpti 
siddhiṃ sarvakāmasiddhiṃ yonimudrāṃ trikhaṃḍā mudrāṃ prāgvat vinyasya (4) 
eṣā parāparāti rahasya yoginīḥ sarvānaṃdamaye mahācakre ityādi prāgvat 
vyāpakaṃ vinyaset aiṃ yoni mudrāṃ da(0) iti biṃducakranyāsaḥ ||

tataḥ śirastrikoṇasya pṛṣṭhabhāge rekhātrayaṃ vibhāvya tatra pūjā 
prakaraṇaṃ vakṣamāṇa gurupaṃkti trayaṃ nyasyet | tato 
mātṛkāyāḥ ṣoḍaśasvaranyāsasthāneṣu praṇava tritārādi caturthī namoṃ 
tattattannityā nāmāṃta 

<p. 85b> 
tayā tattannityā vidyayā nityā ṣoḍaśakaṃ vinyasya (4) hasraiṃ hasakalarīṃ 
hasrauḥ sarvasiddhipradacakrāya namaḥ | aṃtarālacakrāya namaḥ || iti vyāpakaṃ 
vinyasya | trikoṇāṣṭakoṇayoraṃtarālabudhyā prāguktā āyudha devatya nyaset | 
tadyathā || dakṣanetre | (4) drāṃ drīṃ klīṃ blūṃ saḥ jaṃbhanebhyaḥ 
kāmeśvara bāṇebhyo namaḥ || vāmane yāṃ rāṃ lāṃ vāṃ sāṃ 
jaṃbhanebhyaḥ kāmeśvarī bāṇebhyo namaḥ | dakṣabhruvi (4) dhaṃ mohanāya 
kāmeśvara cāpāya namaḥ | vāmabhruvi (4) thaṃ mohanāya kāmeśvarī cāpā 
namaḥ | dakṣa karṇe (4) āṃ vaśīkaraṇāya kāmeśvara pāśāya namaḥ | 
vāmakarṇe (4) hrīṃ vaśīkaraṇāya kāmeśvarī pāśāya namaḥ || 
dakṣanāsāyāṃ (4) kroṃ staṃbhanāya kāmeśvarāṃ kuśāya namaḥ | 
vāmanāsāyāṃ (4) kroṃ staṃbhanāya kāmeśvaryaṃ kuśāya namaḥ |
ityāyudha devatāḥ vinyasya trikoṇasya koṇatraye pūrvokta kāmeśvaryādi devī 
trayaṃ prāgvadvinyasya | hṛdaye prāgvat tripurāṃbikā cakreśvarīṃ vinyasya 
tadvakṣa vāmayorichāsiddhiṃ bījamudrāṃ ca vinyasya (4) etāḥ parāpara rahasya 
yoginyaḥ sarvasiddhiprade cakre samudrā ityādi vyāpaka kuryāt | (2) tataḥ (4) hrīṃ 
śrīṃ sauḥ sarvaroga hara cakrāya namaḥ | aṣṭāracakrāya namaḥ || iti vyāpakaṃ 
vinyasya | 

<p. 86a> 
śiraḥpurobhāgamārabhya muṃḍamālā krameṇaṣṭasu sthāneṣu pūrvokta 
vaśinyādi vāgve devatāṣṭakaṃ vinyasya || maṇipūraka cakre pūrvoktāṃ 
tripurā siddhā cakreśvarī vinyasya tadakṣa vāmayorbhukti siddhiṃ khecarī 
mudrāṃ ca vinyasya | (4) etāḥ rahasya yoginyaḥ sarvaroga hare cakre samudrā ityādi 
vyāpakaṃ nyaset | (2) 

tataḥ (4) hrīṃ klīṃ bleṃ sarvarakṣākara cakrāya namaḥ | iti vyāpakaṃ vinyasya | 
dakṣanetra mūla tadapāṃga dakṣaśrotra tatpṛṣṭha cūḍā kūpasya 
dakṣapārśva vāmapārśva vāmaśrotrapṛṣṭha vāmaśrotra vāmāpāṃga 
vāmanetra mūleṣu dasusthāneṣu prāgukta sarvajñādi daśaśaktirvinyasya |
svādhiṣṭhāne cakre pūrvoktāṃ | tripuramālinīṃ cakreśvarīṃ vinyasya tadakṣa 
vāmayoḥ prākrāmya siddhiṃ mahāṃkuśā mudrāṃ ca prāgvadvinyasya (4) 
etāni garbha yoginyaḥ sarvarakṣākare cakre samudrā ityādi vyāpakaṃ nyaset (4) 
tataḥ (4) hasaiṃ hasklīṃ hasauḥ iti vyāpakaṃ vinyasya | kaṃṭhe viśuddhi 
cakre ṣoḍaśa daleṣu ekasminnekāśaktiḥ traye dalepyekāśaktiḥ ityevaṃ krame 
saptamī śakti paryaṃtaṃ vinyasyāvaśiṣṭadalatraye śeṣaśakti 

<p. 86b>
trayaṃ nyasediti prādakṣiṇyena sarvasiddhi pradādi daśaśaktīrvinyasya | 
mūlādhāre tripurācakreśvarīṃ prāgvadvinyasya tadakṣa vāmayorvaśitva 
siddhimunmādinī mudrāṃ ca prāgvadvinyasya (4) etāḥ kulakaulayoginyaḥ 
sarvārtha sādhaka cakre samudrā ityādi vyāpakaṃ nyaset | (4) haiṃ haklīṃ hasauḥ 
sarvasaubhāgyadāyaka cakrāya namaḥ | iti vyāpakaṃ vinyasya | 

hṛdaya anāhata cakre dvādaśadalakamale daśadaleṣu sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇyādi 
daśaśaktirvinyasyāṃtimadala dvaye pratidalaṃ śakti dvayaṃ śakti dvayamiti 
śiṣṭaśakti catuṣṭayaṃ nyasediti caturdaśaśaktirvinyasya | ūtadvaye pūrvoktāṃ 
tripuravāsinīṃ cakreśvarīṃ prāgvadvinyasya taddakṣavāmayorīśitvasiddhiṃ 
vaśyamudrāṃ ca prāgvadvinyasya (4) etāḥ saṃpradāya yoginyaḥ 
sarvasaubhāgyadāyaka cakre samudrā ityādi vyāpakaṃ nyaset || (4) tataḥ hrīṃ 
klīṃ sauḥ sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇa cakrāya namaḥ iti vyāpakaṃ vinyasya | 
pṛṣṭhavaṃśa vāmapārśvodarayormadhye udara dakṣiṇa pārśveṣu (rmadhya 
dakṣiṇa pārśvapṛṣṭhavaṃśayormadhye) catuṣṭa sthāneṣu pūrvoktānaṃga 
kusumādyāścatuḥśāktīrvinyasya pṛṣṭhavāmapārśvayormadhye 
vāmapārśvodarayormadhya udara dakṣiṇa pārśvayormadhye dakṣiṇapārśva 

<p. 87a> 
pṛṣṭhavaṃśayormadhye ca sthānacatuṣṭaye anaṃgarekhādi catuḥśaktīrvinyasya 
| jānudvaye pūrvoktāṃ tripurasuṃdarīṃ cakreśvarīṃ pūrvavadvinyasya 
taddakṣavāmapārśvayormahimāsiddhiṃ ākarṣaṇī mudrāṃ ca vinyasya (4) etāḥ 
guptatara yoginyaḥ sarvasaṃkṣobhakare cakre samudrā ityādi vyāpakaṃ nyaset || (9)
tataḥ (4) aiṃ klīṃ sauḥ sarvāśāparipūrakacakrāya namaḥ iti vyāpakaṃ vinyasya 
| svādhiṣṭhāne ṣaṭdalakamale svāgrādi prādakṣiṇyena paṃcasu daleṣu 
pratidalaṃ śakti trayamaṃtimadale tvekāṃ śaktimiti 
kāmākarṣiṇyādi ṣoḍaśaśaktīrvinyasya | jaṃghayoḥ pūrvoktāṃ 
tripureśvarīṃ vinya (*) taddakṣa vāmayorlaghimāsiddhiṃ drāviṇī mudrāṃ ca 
vinyasya (4) etāḥ guptayoginyaḥ sarvāśāparipūrake cakre samudrā ityādi 
vyāpakaṃ nyaset | (8) | tataḥ (4) aṃ āṃ sauḥ trailokya mohacakrāyaḥ | iti vyāpakaṃ 
vinyasya | aṃtaścaturasra rekhāyai nama iti vyāpakaṃ vinyasya || mūlādhāre 
caturdala kamalasya dalacatuṣṭaye tadaṃtarāla catuṣṭaye ca 
pūrvadaleśānāṃtarālayormadhye paścimadale nair(-)ṛtyaṃtarālayormadhye ca 
pūrvokta sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇyādi mudrādaśakaṃ nyaset |  

<p. 87b> 
tataḥ (4) caturasra madhyarekhāyai nama iti vyāpakaṃ vinyasya | dakṣajaṃghāyāṃ 
digvidi krameṇa pūrvoktā brāhmyādyaṣṭaśaktīrnyaset | tataḥ (4) bāhya 
caturasrarekhāyai nama iti vyāpakaṃ vinyasya | vāmajaṃghāyāṃ digvidi 
krameṇa pūrvoktāṇimādi sidhyaṣṭakaṃ vinyasya | dakṣapāde prāpti siddhiṃ 
vāmapāde sarvakāmasiddhiṃ ca vinyasya | pādadvaye prāgvat tripurā 
cakreśvarīṃ vinyasya taddakṣavāmayoraṇimāsiddhiṃ sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇī 
mudrāṃ ca vinyasya (4) etāḥ prakaṭa yoginyaḥ trailokya mohane cakre samudrā 
ityādi vyāpakaṃ vinyasya saraśmika śrīmahātripurasuṃdarya bhedena 
svātmānaṃ dhyāyet || iti sṛṣṭi śrīcakranyāsaḥ ||

atha sthiti śrīcakranyāsaḥ ||

sa ca vidyācakra cakreśvarītyaṃga trayātmakaḥ | tatra prathamaṃ saṃpradāyāt 
pūrvavat karaśuddhi vidyayā aṃ āṃ sauḥ karaśuddhiṃ vidhāya tathaivatāṃ 
vinyasya tathaiva hrīṃ klīṃ sauḥ ātmarakṣāṃ kṛtvā nyāsamārabhet | tatrādau 
trirvidha mūlavidyānyāsaḥ | sa yathā || mūrddhni (4) prathamakūṭaṃ namaḥ | 
guhye (4) dvitīya kūṭaṃ namaḥ || hṛdaye (4) tṛtīya kūṭaṃ namaḥ | dakṣanetre (4) 
prathama kū(0) | vāmanetre (4) dvitīya kū(0) | bhāle (4) tṛtīya kū(0) | dakṣakarṇe (4) pra(0) 
kū(0) |

<p. 88a> 
vāmakarṇe (4) dvi(0) kū(0) | mukhe (4) tṛ(0) ku(0) | dakṣāṃse (4) pra(0) kū(0) | vāmāṃse (4) 
dvi(0) | kū(0) | pṛṣṭhe (4) tṛtī(0) | kū(0) | dakṣajānuni (4) pra(0) | kū(0) | vāmajānuni (4) dvitī(0) 
| kū(0) | nābhau (4) tṛ(0) kū(0) | namaḥ | iti mūlavidyā kūṭanyāsaḥ || mūrddhni (4) 
kaṃ namaḥ | guhyai (4) eṃ namaḥ | hṛdaye (4) īṃ dakṣanetre laṃ(0) | (4) vāmanetre (4) 
hrīṃ namaḥ | bhālanetre (4) haṃ namaḥ || dakṣakarṇe (4) saṃ namaḥ vāmakarṇe (4) 
kaṃ namaḥ | mukhe (4) haṃ namaḥ | dakṣabhuje (4) laṃ namaḥ | vāmabhuje (4) hrīṃ 
namaḥ | pṛṣṭhe (4) saṃ namaḥ | dakṣajānuni (4) kaṃ namaḥ | vāmajānunī (4) laṃ 
namaḥ | nābhau (4) hrīṃ namaḥ | ityakṣaranyāsaḥ | samasta mūlavidyāṃ 
praṇavatārādi namoṃtāṃ mūrddhādi nābhyaṃta paṃcadaśa pūrvokteṣu 
pratyekaṃ (2) nyasediti trividhaḥ | pādayoḥ (4) aṃ āṃ sauḥ namaḥ | jaṃghayoḥ (4) 
aiṃ klīṃ sauḥ namaḥ | janvoḥ (4) hrīṃ klī sauḥ namaḥ | urvoḥ (4) haiṃ hasklīṃ 
hasauḥ namaḥ | spicyoḥ (4) hasaiṃ hasklīṃ hasauḥ namaḥ | liṃgāgre (4) hrīṃ klīṃ 
bleṃ namaḥ | mūlādhāre (4) hrīṃ śrīṃ sauḥ | namaḥ | iti mūrtividyāṃ vinyasya 
| (2) haṃ klī (2) anāhate vā hasraiṃ hasklīṃ hasrauḥ nama ityā vāhanī vīdyāṃ 
vinya (*) | (4) hasakalaraḍaiṃ hasakalaraḍīṃ hasakalaraḍauḥ namaḥ |
brahmaraṃdhre | 

tato (4) mūlavidyāyā mūrddhādi pādāṃtaṃ pādādi hṛdayāṃtaṃ ca 
vyāpakaṃ nyaset || tato mūlādhāre (4) aiṃ klīṃ sauḥ |

<p. 88b> 
sarvāśāparipūraka cakrāya namaḥ svādhi (4) ṣṭhāne | (4) hrīṃ klīṃ sauḥ | 
sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇacakrāya namaḥ || maṇipūrake (4) (4) hai haklīṃ hasauḥ 
sarvasaubhāgyadāyaka cakrāya namaḥ || anāhate (4) hasaiṃ hasklīṃ hasauḥ 
sarvārthasādhaka cakrāya namaḥ || viśuddhicakre (4) hrīṃ klīṃ bleṃ 
sarvarakṣāracakrāya namaḥ | laṃbikāgre (4) hrīṃ śrīṃ sauḥ 
sarvarogaharacakrāya namaḥ | ājñāyā (4) hasraiṃ hasklīṃ hasrauḥ 
sarvasiddhiprada cakrāya namaḥ | biṃdau (4) mūla paṃcadaśākṣarīmuccārya 
sarvānaṃdamaya śrīmahācakrāya namaḥ || iti navacakrāṇi vinyasya 
navacakreśvarī nyāsaṃ kuryāt || 

tatra mūlādhārādhaḥ prāk nyastatrailokya mohanacakre (4) aṃ āṃ sauḥ 
tripurācakreśvaryai namaḥ | mūlādhārastha sarvāśāparipūrakacakre (4) aiṃ 
klīṃ sauḥ tripureśvarī cakreśvaryai namaḥ | svādhiṣṭhāna sthita 
sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇa cakre (4) hrīṃ klīṃ sauḥ | tripurasuṃdarī cakreśvaryai namaḥ |
maṇipūra sthita sarvasaubhāgyadāyaka cakre (4) hai haklīṃ hasauḥ | tripuravāsinī 
cakreśvaryai namaḥ || anāhatastha sarvārthasādhakacakre (4) hasauṃ hasklīṃ 
hasauḥ tripurā śrīcakreśvaryai namaḥ | viśuddhi sthita sarvarakṣākara cakre (4) 
hrīṃ klīṃ bleṃ tripuramālinīcakreśvaryai namaḥ ||

<p. 89a> 
laṃbikāgra sthita sarvarogahara cakre (4) hrīṃ śrīṃ sauḥ tripurā siddhā 
cakreśvaryai namaḥ || ājñā cakrastha sarvasiddhi pradacakre (4) hasraiṃ 
hasakalarīṃ hasrauḥ tripurāṃbikā cakreśvaryai namaḥ | mahābiṃdustha 
biṃducakre (4) mula paṃcadaśākṣarīmuccārya mahātripurasuṃdarī 
mahācakreśvarī śrīpādukāyai namaḥ || iti vinya tattaccakraṃ 
parasparasaṃlagnaṃ tattaccakreśvaryadhiṣṭhitaṃ samyak dhyātvā punaḥ 
karaśuddhi vidhāya tripurasuṃdaryātma rakṣāṃ kṛtvā pūrvokta ṣaḍaṃgaṃ 
vinyasya (4) vāgbhavaṃ mūlādhāre (4) kāmarājaṃ hṛdaye (4) tṛtīyaṃ bhrūmadhye 
(4) turīya vidyāṃ brahmaraṃdhre ca vinyasya (4) samasta prakaṭa gupta guptatara 
saṃpradāya kulakaulanigarbharahasya parāpara rahasya parāparāti rahasya 
śrīcakra yoginī śrīpādukābhyo nama iti svaśarīraṃ śrīcakrarūpaṃ dhyāyan | 
vyāpakaṃ kuryāt || iti śrī sthiti śrīcakranyāsaḥ ||

atha śrīcakranyāsaphalaṃ ||

tatra rudrayāmale ||

ya evaṃ vinyaseddehe sādhaka sthira mānasaḥ | 
vimucya mānuṣaṃ bhāvaṃ sasadyaḥ śivatāṃ vrajet || (1) ||

trikālaṃ dhārayed yastu tasya sarvāṃgasaṃgataṃ || 
satataṃ bhāsate devi samastaṃ yoginī padaṃ || (2) ||

<p. 89b> 
dharaṇī kṣetratāṃ yāti yāvad dvādaśayojanaṃ ||
etatte kathitaṃ bhadre nyāsaṃ trailokya durlabhaṃ || (3) ||

śiṣyāya bhaktiyuktāya sādhakāya prakāśayet |
bhraṣṭebhyaḥ sādhakebhyo vā bāṃdhavebhyo na darśayet || (4) ||

dattaṃ cetsiddhi hāniḥ syādityājñā śāṃkarī matā ||
maṃtrāḥ parāṅmukhāyāṃti kruddhā bhavati suṃdarī || (5) ||

aśubhaṃ ca bhavet tasya tasmādyatnena gopayet ||

iti trividha śrīcakranyāsaḥ ||

śrīvidyānaṃdanāthena śivayoṃ priyasūnunā ||
kṛte saubhāgyaratnābdhau taraṃgaḥ saptamo gamat || (1) ||

[iti śrīsaccidānaṃdanāthācaraṇāraṃviṃdadvadvāṃte vāśinā 
śrīśrīvidyānaṃdanāthenaviracite saubhāgyaratnākare saptamastaraṃgaḥ] || (7) ||

atha karaśuddhyādinyāsaḥ ||

tatra prathamaṃ prāgukta prathama cakreśvarī vidyayā prāgvat karayoḥ sthiti 
krameṇa madhyamāditalāṃtaṃ vinyasyāsanaṃ nyāsaṃ kuryāt || sa ca dvividhaḥ 
|| caturāsana nyāsaḥ ṣaḍāsana nyāsaśceti || tatrādau caturāsananyāsaḥ || 
sayathā || pādayoḥ (4) hrīṃ klīṃ sauḥ tripurasuṃdarī devyātmāsanāya namaḥ |

<p. 90a> 
jaṃghayoḥ (4) haiṃ haklīṃ hasauḥ tripurāvāsinī sarvacakrāsanāya namaḥ || 
jānvoḥ (4) hasaiṁ hasakalīṁ hasauḥ tripurā sarvamaṃtrāsanāya namaḥ || 
mūlādhāre (4) hrīṁ klīṁ bleṁ tripuramālinī sādhyasiddhāsanāya namaḥ || iti 
caturāsananyāsaḥ ||

atha ṣaḍāsananyāsaḥ ||

tatra pādayoḥ | (4) aṁ āṁ sauḥ tripurāsudhārṇavāsanāya namaḥ | jānvoḥ | (4) eṁ klīṁ 
sauḥ tripureśvarī yotāṃbujāsanāya namaḥ || ūrvoḥ | (4) hrīṁ klīṁ sauḥ 
tripurasuṃdarī devyātmāsanāya namaḥ || sphicyoḥ || (4) haiṃ haklīṁ hasauḥ 
tripuravāsinī sarvacakrāsanāya namaḥ || gude (4) hasaiṁ hasklīṁ hasauḥ tripurā 
śrīsarvamaṃtrāsanāya namaḥ || mūlādhāre (4) hrīṃ klīṃ bleṃ tripuramālinī 
sādhyasiddhāsanāya namaḥ | iti ṣaḍāsananyāsaḥ |

atha ṣaḍaṃganyāsaḥ ||

sa ca trividhaḥ | rakṣāṣaḍaṃganyāso mūlavidyā ṣaḍaṃganyāsaḥ ṣaḍaṃga 
yuvatīnyāsaśceti || tatrādau rakṣāṣaḍaṃganyāsaḥ || sa yathā || (4) eṁ klīṁ sauḥ 
namastripurasuṃdarī māṃ rakṣa rakṣa hṛdayāya namaḥ | evaṃ ṣaḍaṃgeṣu 
tattanmudrayā sahatattanmaṃtreṇa saha nyaset ||

atha mūla ṣaḍaṃganyāsaḥ |

sa ca mūla kūṭatrayasya dvirāvṛtyā ṣaḍaṃgasthāneṣu prāgvanyāso jñeyaḥ || 

<p. 90b> 
ṣoḍaśārṇo pāsakaistu ādyabīja paṃcakena hṛdayaṃ | taduttara bīja trayeṇa 
śiraḥ | tadūrdhvagata kūṭatrayeṇa śikhādi netrāṃtamaṃgatrayaṃ || aṃtima 
bījapaṃcakenāstramiti mūla ṣaḍaṃganyāsaḥ kāryaḥ || 

atha ṣaḍaṃgayuvatīnyāsaḥ ||

sa ca dvividhaḥ | bālāmūla vidyayoryoga bhedāt || tatrādau bālāyoganyāsaḥ | 
tatra (4) eṁ sarvajñāyai hṛdayāya namaḥ | (4) klīṁ nityatṛptāyai śirase svāhā || (4) 
sauḥ anādibodhāyai śikhāyai vaṣaṭ | (4) eṁ svataṃtrāyai kavacāya huṃ || (4) klīṁ 
nityamaluptāyai netratrayāya vauṣaṭ ṣaṭ || (4) sauḥ aṃnaṃtāyai astrāya phaṭ | 

atha mūla ṣaḍaṃga yuvatīnyāsaḥ ||

tatra (4) prathamakūṭaṃ śrīmahātripurasuṃdari sarvajñatā śaktidhāmne 
hṛdayāya namaḥ | (4) dvitīya kūṭaṃ śrīmahātripurasuṃdari nityatṛpti 
śaktidhāmne śirase svāhā || (4) tṛtīya kūṭaṃ śrīmahātripurasuṃdari anādi 
bodha śakti dhāmne śikhāyai vaṣaṭ | (4) punarādyaṃ kūṭaṃ 
śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī svataṃtraśaktidhāmne kavacāya haṃ || (4) dvitīya 
kūṭaṃ | śrīmahātripurasuṃdari nityamalupta śaktidhāmne netratrayāya vauṣaṭ (4) 
tṛtīya kūṭaṃ śrīmahātripurasuṃdari anaṃtaśakti dhāmne astrāya phaṭ ||

<p. 91a> 
iti ṣaḍaṃga yuvatīnyāsaḥ ||

atha kāmakalāpāraṃparyanyāsaḥ ||

tatra prathamaṃ prāgvat svaśirasi guru pādukāṃ dhyātvā saṃpūjya praṇamya 
dakṣāṃse (4) prathama kūṭaṃ haṃsaḥ prakāśacaraṇābhyāṃ namaḥ || 
vāmāṃse (4) dvitīya kūṭaṃ sohaṃ vimarśa caraṇābhyāṃ namaḥ | hṛdaye (4) 
tṛtīya kūṭaṃ haṃsaḥ sohaṃ prakāśavimarśacaraṇābhyāṃ namaḥ || 
mūrddhni (4) turīya vidyāmuccārya haṃsaḥ śivaḥ sohaṃ nirvāṇa 
caraṇābhyāṃ namaḥ || iti kṛtāṃjaliścaraṇa catuṣṭayaṃ praṇamya || 
kāmakalāpāraṃparyanyāsasya | (4) kāmeśvara ṛṣiḥ (4) paṃktichaṃdaḥ (4) 
parasaṃvitkalā śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī devatā(0) śrīparadevatā prasāda 
sidhyarthe viniyogaḥ | iti ṛṣyādikaṃ smṛtvā vinyasya | (4) 
āmityādi ṣaṭdīrghasvaraiḥ karaṣaḍaṃganyāsaṃ kṛtvā praṇavasaṃpuṭitayā 
kāmakalārūpayā śrīmūlavidyavyāpakaṃ vinyasya dhyānaṃ kuryāt || 
tadyathā ||

prakāśa madhya sthita viśvarūpāṃ 
varābhaye saṃdadhatīṃ trinetrāṃ ||
siṃdūra vārṇāmati komalāṃgīṃ 
māyāmayīṃ tatvamayīmupāse || (1) ||

iti dhyātvā mūlādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ śrīmūla paṃcadaśākṣarī prāgukta 
rūpāṃ dhyātvā tasyā ekaikākṣaralayena turyasvara rūpāmaṃtimakalāṃ

<p. 91b> 
brahmaraṃdhragatāmavaśeṣayet | tatastāmeva paṃcadaśākṣara garbhāṃ 
svātmānubhavarūpa saccidānaṃdarūpiṇīṃ turyasvaratvena pariṇatāṃ 
kāmakalāṃ nābhau dhyāyannyaset || tatra nābhau (4) īṃ namaḥ | ityaṃguṣṭha 
tarjanī madhyamā nāmābhirnyaset | tato nābhervāmapārśve (4) saccidānaṃda 
paramasaṃvit īṁ namaḥ | nābherdakṣe (4) saccidānaṃda paramasaṃvit īṁ namaḥ | 
ityetadvayaṃ madhyamānāmāṃguṣṭhairnyaset || tataścaraṇa catuṣṭayaṃ 
nyāsaḥ | tatra śirasi trikoṇasyāgrakoṇe (4) īṁ prathama kūṭaṃ haṃsaḥ 
prakāśacaraṇābhyāṃ namaḥ | vāmakoṇe (4) īṁ dvitīya kūṭaṃ sohaṃ 
vimarśacaraṇābhyāṃ namaḥ | dakṣaṇe koṇe (4) tṛtīya kūṭaṃ haṃsaḥ sohaṃ 
prakāśavimarśa caraṇābhyāṃ namaḥ | madhye (4) turyavidyāmuccārya haṃsaḥ 
śivaḥ sohaṃ nirvāṇacaraṇābhyāṃ namaḥ || iti caraṇa catuṣṭayaṃ 
śivaśaktyātmaka dakṣiṇavāmakara dhṛtasaṃghaṭa mudrayā vinya tatastrikoṇa 
pṛṣṭharekhāyāṃ (4) sakalānaṃdanātha śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ | (4)
niṣkalāṃnaṃdanātha śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ | (4) 
navātmānaṃdanātha śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi (4) akūrānaṃdanātha 
śrīpādukāṃ pū(0) | iti guru catuṣṭayaṃ paṃkti krameṇa svadakṣiṇādi 
vāmāṃtaṃ vinyasya | śirastrikoṇa madhye (4) īṁ paramasaṃvitkalā 
śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī śrīpādukāṃ pū(0) | mukhamaṃḍale (4) īṁ saparārddha 
kalānaṃdanāthordhva biṃduvakrāya namaḥ |

<p. 92a> 
stanadvaye (4) īṁ saparārddha kalānaṃdanāthādho biṃdudvayastanāya namaḥ || 
ityetadvayamaṃguṣṭhamadhyamānāmikābhirvinyasya | yonisthāne (4) īṁ 
saparārddha kalānaṃdanātha vyaṃjitarekhā yonaye namaḥ || iti 
yonimudrayānyaset ||

tataḥ prāgukta ṛṣyānyāsān ṣaḍaṃga kara ṛṣyādi krameṇa vaiparītyena 
prathamaṃ ṣaḍaṃganyāsaḥ paścāt karanyāsaḥ paścādṛṣyādiriti vinyasya 
pūrokta bhagavatī rūpaṃ svātmānaṃ dhyātvā yathāśakti vāmakalā vidyāṃ 
japediti kāmakalā pāraṃparya nyāsaḥ |

athāṃtaḥ kāmakalānyāsaḥ ||

sa ca parāpaśyaṃtī madhyamā vaikharī bhedāccaturvidhaḥ | tatrādau 
parānyāsaḥ | sa yathā || brahmaraṃdhre aruṇādho mukha 
sahasradalakamalakarṇikāyāmaruṇaṃ pūrṇacaṃdramaṃḍalaṃ vibhāvya 
tanmadhye udyadāditya saṃkāśaṃ svaśikhā mūlāgraṃ śṛṃgāṭaṃ 
dhyātvā tadaṃtargatamakathādi krameṇa samastākṣaramayamakulāsanaṃ 
vāgbhavaṃ dhyātvā tanmadhye hakṣa pāśvamādi varṇakadaṃbakaṃ 
dīptamavarṇa rūpamanuttara manatkaṃtarahātmakaṃ viciṃtya 
tanmadhyādudyaṃtīṃ bisataṃtu nibhāṃsitāṃ hārddha kalā rūpiṇīmakula 
kuṃḍalinīṃ mūla śṛṃgāṭaka

<p. 92b> 
madhya paryaṃtamachinnāṃ mahākāmakalāmamṛtakuṃḍalinīṃ dhyātvā 
mulādhāre caturdala kamala karṇikāyāmapi vahni maṃḍale 
trikoṇasyāgrakoṇāgraṃ pūrvavat śṛgāṭaṃ dhyātvā tadaṃtaḥ 
pūrvavadvāgbhavaṃ kulāsanaṃ vibhāvya tatra pūrvokta manatkaṃ viviṃtya 
tanmadhyādughaṃtīṃ saparārddha kalāmayīmagnikuṃḍalinīṃ kāmakalāṃ 
jvaladagninibhāṃ madhyamārgaṃ praviśya graṃthi saṃcayaṃ bhitvā tada kula 
padāvadhyūrddhaṃ prāptāṃ dhyātvā akulāṃ budhi madhyagata 
daṃḍākārataradaṃḍalīṃgena praveśayitvā tayoramṛtānala 
kuṃḍaliṃnyoryoniliṃgarūpayormathanasaṃbhavairniraṃtaranibiḍasravadaruṇā(-)
mṛtapūrairātmānaṃ siktaṃ dhyātvā pūrayitvā tayoḥ 
sāmarasyādekanādarūpiṇīṃ parāṃśakti ātmānaṃ ca bhāvayet || iti 
parānyāsaḥ || tarala kṣaṇaṃ tu bhairavayāmale ||

tarasthaṃtaramadhyasthaṃtarasthataramadhyagaṃ ||
taraṃtaraṃḍamadhyasthaṃ yojānāti sakailikaḥ || (1) ||

śīrṣapāṇi caraṇairvivarjitaṃ hyakṣaraṃ bhavarujāpahaṃ paraṃ ||
yasya hṛtkuharagaṃ suvartatte tena mṛtyurapi bhasmasātkṛtaḥ || (2) ||

<p. 93a> 
śaivaṃ caiva tathā śāktaṃ sāmarasyaṃ tu madhyamaṃ ||
ekībhūtaṃ yadā kāle tadā tadvarṇamuttamaṃ || (3) || 

śūnyātprasaramutpannaṃ prasarotthamakālakaṃ ||
akālāttatvamutpannaṃ viśvaṃ yat paṃcadhā sthitaṃ || (4) ||

dhyāna sthāna vihīno yo rūpoccāravivarjitaḥ ||
anāhato nadatyaṃtarmukhānmukha pade sthitaḥ || (5) ||

dhāma trayādvirahito yogeśīnāṃ mukhe sthitaḥ |
satyaṃ tu kathitaṃ tābhiḥ svayaṃ muccarate tu saḥ || (6) ||

śūnyā chaṃbhustataḥ śaktiḥ śakterdhāma trayātmakaṃ ||
prabhavecca tataḥ sarvamādivarṇakadaṃbakaṃ || (7) ||

anuttaraṃ tadevoktaṃ sadyaḥ kaulika siddhidaṃ ||
tarahaṃ ca tadevasyāccaṃdramāskara madhyagaṃ || (8) ||

takāraḥ somadhāmasyādyo rephaḥ sa tu bhāskaraḥ |
daṃḍavadramate vahnirekībhūtaṃ tadātmaka || (9) || iti ||

atha paśyaṃtī nyāsaḥ ||

