atha phaṇānyāsaḥ |

ādhāre caturdalakamalakarṇikāyāṃ svarābjaṃ avargāṃkitaṃ ciṃtayitvā tatra 
kuṃḍalinīṃ ca phaṇānvitāṃ viciṃtya teṣu phaṇeṣu (4) prathamakūṭaṃ 
paṃcavarṇaṃ manasā vinyasya ||

tato' anāhate dvādaśadalakamalakarṇikāyāṃ tathaivābjaṃ ka vargāṃkitaṃ

<p. 101a> 
vibhāvya tatra tāṃ ṛtuphaṇānvitāṃ viciṃtya teṣu phaṇa ratneṣu (4) dvitīya 
kūṭārṇān vinyasya | tato hakṣābje tathaivābjaṃ tha vargāṃkitaṃ vicitya tatra 
tāṃ veda pūnānvitāṃ dhyātvā (4) tatra śaktikūṭārṇānvinyasya | tataḥ 
sahasradalakamalakarṇikāyāṃ varṇāraviṃdaṃ dhyātvā tatra tāṃ paṃcadaśa 
phaṇānvitāṃ viciṃtya tatra mūlārṇānvinyasediti phaṇānyāsaḥ ||

atha sarvasaṃmohananyāsaḥ |

śirasi (4) aiṃ klīṃ sauḥ hrīṃ śrīṃ nādanādāya namaḥ | lalāṭe (4) hrīṃ śrīṃ 
