akṣaranādāya namaḥ | (4) mūlena sarvaśarīre vyāpakaṃ nyasediti 
sarvasaṃmohananyāsaḥ ||

atha guhya ṣoḍhānyāsaḥ ||

tadyathā || 
śaṃkara uvāca ||

