sahakṣamalavarayīṃ śrī(-)amukānaṃdanātha hasauḥ hasphreṃ śrīṃ hrīṃ aiṃ 
oṃ śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi(0) || iti śāṃbhavataṃtrokta gurupādukā vidyayā 
śrīgurupādukāṃ śirasi saṃghaṭamudrayā vinyasya dhyātvā gadhādibhiḥ 
saṃpūjya || (6) dakṣiṇāṃse aiṃ hrīṃ śrī hasphreṃ hasauḥ glauṃ hasauḥ 
hasphreṃ śrīṃ hrīṃ aiṃ heraṃbāya namaḥ || vāmāṃse aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ 
hasphreṃ hasauḥ uṃ hasauḥ hasphreṃ śrīṃ hrīṃ aiṃ durgāyai namaḥ || 
dakṣorau (5) baṃ (5) baṭukabhairavāye namaḥ || vāmorau (5) saṃ (5) sarasvatyai namaḥ || 
hṛdaye (5) hrīṃ huṃ haṃ kṣaṃ jvālāmukhabhairavājñayā māṃsāvṛdrakṣa 
rakṣa hūṃ svāhā (5) kṣetrapālāya namaḥ || mukhe (5) paṃ (5) paramātmane namaḥ 
|| iti vinyasya pūjayitvā bāhya (5) oṃ namo bhagavati nīlavajrāsane mama śarīra 
rakṣa rakṣa hūṃ phaṭ svāhā (5) ātmāsanāya namaḥ | iti svāsanaṃ pūjya ||

<p. 125b> 
dakṣavāmahastau śivaśaktyātmakau dhyātvā sahasraḥ phaḥ astrāya phaṭ iti 
maṃtreṇa tālatrayaṃ daśadigbaṃdhanamagniprākāraṃ nva kṛtvā kaniṣṭhayoḥ 
(5) glūṃ gaganaratnāya glūṃ (5) namaḥ || anāmayoḥ (5) slūṃ svargaratnāya slūṃ 
(5) namaḥ || madhyamayoḥ (5) mlūṃ martyaratnāya mlūṃ (5) namaḥ || tarjanyoḥ (5) 
plūṃ pātālaratnāya plūṃ (5) namaḥ || aṃguṣṭhayoḥ (5) nlūṃ nāgaratnāya 
nlūṃ (5) namaḥ || karatala karapṛṣṭhayoḥ (5) glūṃ slūṃ mlūṃ plūṃ nlūṃ 
paṃcaratnāya (5) namaḥ || iti paṃcaratnanyāsaḥ ||

tataḥ (5) sahasrauṃ aiṃ pheṃ (5) iti parameśvara parameśvarī vidyābhyāṃ 
karayorvyāpakaṃ kṛtvā mūrddhādi pādāṃtaṃ sarvāṃgavyāpakaṃ kuryāt || 
tataḥ (5) sahasrāṃ phāṃ (5) hṛdayāya namaḥ || (5) sahasrīṃ phīṃ śirase svāhā || (5)
sahasruṃ phūṃ (5) śikhāyai vaṣaṭ || (5) sahasraiṃ phaiṃ (5) kavacāya huṃ || (5) 
sahasrauṃ phauṃ (5) netratrayāya vauṣaṭ || (5) sahasra phaḥ (5) astrāya phaṭ || iti 
kaniṣṭhāditalāṃtaṃ karayorvinyasya hṛdayādiṣu ca nyaset ||

atha vaktranyāsaḥ ||

tatra cūḍādhaḥ (5) śastrauṃ phāṃ (5) paścimavaktrāya namaḥ || vāmakarṇe (5) 
śsrīṃ phīṃ (5) uttaravaktrāya namaḥ | dakṣakarṇe (5) śsruṃ phūṃ (5) 
dakṣiṇavaktrāyaḥ || mukhe (5) śsraiṃ phaiṃ pūrvavaktrāya namaḥ |

<p. 126a> 
śirasi (5) śsrauṃ phauṃ (5) ūrdhvavaktrāya namaḥ | brahmaraṃdhre (5) sahasraḥ 
phaḥ (5) paravaktrāya namaḥ || iti tryaṃganyāsaḥ ||

atha bījaṣoḍhānyāsaḥ ||

tatra kalimūle (5) sjūṃ (5) namaḥ | brahmaraṃdhe (5) hrūṃ hraṃ (5) hrūṃ (5) namaḥ |
bhāle (5) rakhaṭasahagharayūṃ (5) namaḥ | dakṣaśaṃkhe (5) sahakṣarayūṃ (5) namaḥ 
vāmaśaṃkhe (5) kṣrūṃ oṃ namaḥ | dakṣabhruvi (5) śphreṃ (5) namaḥ | 
vāmabhruvi (5) śrūṃ (5) namaḥ | bhruvormadhye (5) srūṃ (5) namaḥ | jihvāyāṃ (5) 
śrīṃ (5) namaḥ | tāluni (5) kṣara kṣrūṃ (5) namaḥ | dakṣakarṇe (5) phaṭaḥ (5) namaḥ | 
vāmakarṇe (5) śraṃ (5) namaḥ | corakūpe (5) lamayarūṃ (5) namaḥ | galakāṃḍe (5) 
hasruṃ (5) namaḥ | kaṃṭhagartte (5) ḍarayūṃ (5) namaḥ | dakṣastano (5) jū ya rū auṃ 
(5) namaḥ | vāmastanopari (5) ḍayarūṃ (5) namaḥ | dakṣastana maṃḍale (5) hasaiṃ (5) 
namaḥ || vāmastanamaṃḍale (5) jūṃ namaḥ | dakṣakakṣe (5) sa ka lrīṃ (5) namaḥ | 
vāmakakṣe (5) aiṁ namaḥ | nābhau (5) hasauṃ (5) namaḥ | dakṣapāṇitale (5) phaḥ (5) 
namaḥ | vāmapāṇitale (5) phreṃ (5) namaḥ | liṃgāgre (5) śrīṃ (5) namaḥ | 
liṃgamūle hrauṃ (5) namaḥ | medasi (5) bhreṃ (5) namaḥ | dakṣāṃse (5) phreṃ (5) 
namaḥ | vāmāṃse (5) sahakṣamalavayaṃrūṃ (5) namaḥ | brahmasūtre (5) haṃ (5) 
namaḥ | pāyauṃ (5) ha sa pha ra yūṃ (5) namaḥ | gudadakṣiṇe (5) ha sa pha rūṃ (5) 
namaḥ | gudavāme (5) hasrauṃ (5) namaḥ | pāyumārge (5) hrauṃ (5) namaḥ |

<p. 126b> 
dakṣajānucakre (5) krāṃ (5) namaḥ | vāmajānucakre (5) rūṃ (5) namaḥ | 
dakṣajaṃghāyāṃ (5) ḍahu auṃ (5) namaḥ | vāmajaṃghāyāṃ (5) saharasrūṃ (5) 
namaḥ | dakṣagulphe (5) braṃ (5) namaḥ | vāmagulphe (5) yraṃ (5) namaḥ | 
dakṣagulphādhaḥ (5) hrakṣa phaṭ (5) namaḥ | vāmagulphādhaḥ (5) aṃ (5) namaḥ | 
dakṣayamadvāre (5) naphayarīṃ (5) namaḥ | yamadvāramiti 
pādāṃguṣṭhābhyaṃtarastha nimnapradeśaḥ || vāmayamadvāre (5) jasakṣahrauṃ 
(5) namaḥ | dakṣapādatale || hasrūṃ (5) namaḥ | vāmapādatale (5) hara phaṭ (5) namaḥ | 
pṛṣṭhavaṃśe (5) calamahīṃ (5) namaḥ | dakṣapārśve (5) jasahasajūṃ (5) namaḥ | 
vāmapārśve (5) kṣaṃ (5) namaḥ | dakṣakūrpare (5) hraḥ phaṭ (5) namaḥ | 
vāmakūrpare (5) śīṃ (5) namaḥ | dakṣamaṇibaṃdhe (5) ga sa ma ya na lūṃ (5) namaḥ 
| vāmamaṇibaṃdhe (5) lavarayahasūṃ (5) namaḥ | dakṣāṃse (5) hasphreṃ (5) namaḥ |
vāmāṃse (5) kṣa phaṭ kṣa rūṃ (5) namaḥ | dakṣacibuke (5) phreṃ (5) namaḥ | 
vāmacibuke (5) kṣmyrūṃ (5) namaḥ | dakṣanetre (5) ha ra phaṭ phrīṃ (5) namaḥ | 
vāmanetre kṣrauṃ (5) namaḥ | nāsāgreṃ (5) ha yūṃ (5) namaḥ | 
dakṣatarjanyaṃguṣṭhasaṃdhau (5) hrīṃ (5) namaḥ | vāmatarjanyaṃguṣṭhasaṃdhau 
(5) ha sa ka la hrīṃ (5) namaḥ | dakṣānāmikāyāṃ (5) hrīṃ (5) namaḥ |
vāmānāmikāyāṃ (5) sa ka lhrīṃ (5) namaḥ | iti vinyasya mūrddhādi pādāṃtaṃ 
pādādi mūrddhāṃtaṃ ca vyāpakaṃ tvena paṃcapraṇavapuṭi(-)

<p. 127a> 
tairakārādikṣakārāṃtermātṛkākṣaraiḥ sakṛnyaset || iti bījaṣoḍhānyāsaḥ ||

atha mālinyādiṣoḍhānyāsaḥ ||

tatra prathamo mālinī nyāsaḥ || śikhāyāṃ (5) naṃ nādinyai (5) namaḥ paścimosye 
(5) ṛ nivṛtyai (5) namaḥ | uttarāsye (5) ṝṃ pratiṣṭhāyai (5) namaḥ dakṣiṇāse (5) ḷṃ 
vidyāyai (5) namaḥ | pūrvāsye (5) ḹṃ śāṃtyai (5) namaḥ | ūrdhvāsye (5) thaṃ 
graṃsinyai (5) namaḥ | netrayoḥ (5) dhaṃ priyadarśinyai (5) namaḥ | nāsāyāṃ (5) īṃ 
guhyaśaktyai (5) namaḥ | urdhvanetre (5) caṃ cāmuṃḍāyai (5) namaḥ | vadane (5) vaṃ 
vaijriṇyai (5) namaḥ | dakṣordhvadaṃtapaṃktau (5) kaṃ karālyai (5) namaḥ | 
vāmordhvadaṃtapaṃktau (5) khaṃ kapālinyai (5) namaḥ | ūrdhvaśūle (5) gaṃ 
śivāyai (5) namaḥ | adhaḥ śūle (5) ghaṃ ghoṣāyai (5) namaḥ | daṃṣṭrāyāṃ (5) 
vaṃ vīrāyai (5) namaḥ | jihvāyāṃ (5) iṃ māyāyai (5) namaḥ | vāci (5) aṃ 
vāgīśvaryai (5) namaḥ | karṇayoḥ (5) ṇaṃ nārāyaṇyai (5) namaḥ | dakṣakarṇabile (5) 
u mohinyai (5) namaḥ | vāmakarṇabile (5) ūṃ prajñāyai (5) namaḥ | kaṃṭhe vaṁ (5) 
śikhivāhinyai (5) namaḥ | dakṣāṃse (5) bhaṃ bhīṣaṇyai (5) namaḥ | vāmāṃse (5) 
yaṃ vāyuvegāyai (5) namaḥ | dakṣabhubhe (5) ṅaṃ bhīmāyai (5) namaḥ | vāmaje 
(5) ṭaṃ vināyakyai (5) namaḥ | dakṣapāṇau (5) ṭhaṃ pūrṇāyai (5) namaḥ | 
vāmapāṇau (5) laṃ śaktyai (5) namaḥ | dakṣakarāṃguṣṭhe (5) jhaṃ jhaṃkāryai (5) 
namaḥ | vāmakarāṃguṣṭhe (5) ñaṃ kūrdinyai (5) namaḥ |

<p. 127b> 
dakṣakara śūladaṃḍe (5) ḍhaṃ kālikāyai (5) namaḥ | vāmakara śūladaṃḍe (5) 
raṃ dīpinyai (5) namaḥ | śūlāgre (5) jaṃ jayaṃtyai (5) namaḥ | hṛdaye (5) paṃ 
pāvanyai (5) namaḥ | udare (5) baṃ laṃbinyai (5) namaḥ | nābhau (5) kṣaṃ saṃhāriṇai 
(5) namaḥ | dakṣastane (5) chaṃ chāgalyai (5) namaḥ | vāmastane (5) laṃ pūtanāyai (5) 
namāḥ | dakṣastanopari (5) āṃ āmodāyai (5) namaḥ | vāmastanopari (5) saṃ 
paramaśaktyai (5) namaḥ | prāṇe (5) haṃ aṃbāyai (5) namaḥ | citte (5) aḥ ichāśaktyai (5) 
namaḥ | nitaṃbadvaye (5) maṃ mahākālyai (5) namaḥ | guhye (5) śaṃ puṣpāstrāyai (5) 
namaḥ | śukre (5) aṃ sūkṣmāyai (5) namaḥ | ūrudvaye (5) taṃ tārāyai (5) namaḥ | 
dakṣajānuni (5) eṃ jñānaśaktyai (5) namaḥ | vāmajānuni (5) aiṃ kriyāśaktyai (5) 
namaḥ | dakṣajaṃghāyāṃ (5) oṃ gāyatryai (5) namaḥ | vāmajaṃghāyāṃ (5) auṃ 
sāvitryai (5) namaḥ | dakṣapāde (5) daṃ vahanyai (5) namaḥ | vāmapāde (5) phaṃ 
phaṭkāryai (5) namaḥ | aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ hasphreṃ hasauḥ naṃ phāṃ hrāṃ hrīṃ 
mālinīṃ sarvāṃgeṣu pūjayāmi (5) namaḥ | iti sarvāṃge vyāpakaṃ kuryāt | iti 
mālinī nyāsaḥ ||

atha śabdarāśinyāsaḥ ||

sa tu prāgukta śrīkaṃṭhādi nyāsa eva tatra prīktatārtīya bījamapahāya paca(-)

<p. 128a> 
praṇavasaṃpuṭitaḥ kāryaḥ | tatra aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ hasphreṃ hasauḥ aṃ 
śrīkaṃṭheśāya pūrṇodaryai hasauḥ hasphreṃ śrīṃ hrīṃ aiṃ nama ityādi || 
iti śabdarāśinyāsaḥ ||

atha trividyānyāsaḥ ||

nābhau aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ hasphreṃ hasauḥ aiṃ hrīṃ aghore hrīṃ saḥ hasau 
hasphreṃ śrīṃ hrīṃ aiṃ namaḥ | hṛdaye (5) paramaghore hūṃ ghorarūpe hasauḥ 
ghoramukhi bhīṣaṇe vama vama piba rahaḥ heṃ ruru rara hrīṃ hrūṃ phreṃ 
hasauḥ (5) namaḥ | bhrumadhye | (5) sphraṃ (5) namaḥ | iti trividyānyāsaḥ ||

atha aghorikāṣṭakanyāsaḥ ||

tatra śirasi (5) aiṃ hrīṃ ghore hrīṃ saḥ aghorāyai (5) namaḥ | bhāle (5) paramaghore 
hūṃ paramaghorāyai (5) namaḥ | bhrumadhye (5) ghorarūpe hasau ghorarūpāyai (5) 
namaḥ | mukhe (5) ghoramukhi saḥ ghoramukhyai (5) namaḥ | kaṃṭhe (5) bhīme saḥ 
bhīmāyai (5) namaḥ | hṛdaye (5) bhīṣaṇe saḥ bhīṣaṇāyai (5) namaḥ | udare (5) 
vamasaḥ vamanyai (5) namaḥ | nābhau (5) pibasaḥ pibanyai (5) namaḥ | 
ityaghorikāṣṭakaṃ nyāsaḥ ||

atha dvādaśāṃganyāsaḥ ||

tatra pādayoḥ (5) śreṃ sidhyai (5) namaḥ | jānvoḥ śreṃ ṛdhyai (5) namaḥ | ūrvoḥ (5) 
śreṃ dyutyai (5) namaḥ | guhye (5) śreṃ lakṣmyai (5) namaḥ | nābhau (5) śreṃ 
kāṃtyai (5) namaḥ | hṛdaye (5) śivāyai (5) namaḥ | kaṃṭhe (5) śre sumukhāyai (5) 
namaḥ | mukhe (5) śreṃ mālinyai (5) namaḥ | karṇayoḥ (5) śreṃ naṃdāyai (5) namaḥ | 
netrayoḥ (5) śreṃ hayavegāyai (5) namaḥ | bhāle (5) śreṃ mahāmukhai (5) namaḥ | 
śirasi (5) śreṃ viśveśāyai (5) namaḥ | iti dvādaśāṃganyāsaḥ ||

<p. 128b> 
atha ṣaḍaṃganyāsaḥ ||

tatra hṛdi (5) śrāṃ sarvajñatāyai (5) hṛdayāya namaḥ | (5) śrīṃ amṛtatejo 
jvālāmilini (5) nitya tṛtyāyai (5) śirase svāhā || (5) śrūṃ vedavedini anādibodhāyai 
(5) śikhāyai vaṣaṭ || (5) śraiṃ vahnivajradharāya svāhā svataṃtratāyai (5) kavacāya 
hūṃ || (5) śrauṃ nityamalutyaśaktaye (5) netratrayāya vauṣaṭ || (5) śraḥ 
anaṃtaśaktiyuktāya pāśupatāstrāya hūṃ phaṭ (5) astrāya phaṭ || iti 
śaḍaṃganyāsaḥ || 

stattanmudrayā kāryaḥ || iti mālinyādiṣoḍhānyāsaḥ || 

atha paṃcamahāratnanyāsaḥ ||

tatra ājñācakre (5) glūṃ gaganaratna gaganapīṭha gaganalokagarbhagāminī 
gagananāthagaganāṃbā gaganeśvari catuḥṣaṣṭhilakṣakoṭiyoginyaṃbā glūṃ (5) 
śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ | viśuddhicakre (5) slūṃ svargaratna svargapīṭha 
svargalokagarbhagāmini svarganāthasvargāṃbā svargeśvarī 
dvātriṃśallakṣakoṭiyoginyaṃbā slūṃ (5) śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ | 
(viśuddhicakre (5) slūṃ svargaratnasvargapīṭha svargaloka) anāhatacakre (5) mlūṃ 
martyaratna martyapīṭha martyaloka garbhagāmini martyanāthamartyāṃbā 
matyeśvarī ṣoḍaśalakṣakoṭi(-)

<p. 129a> 
yoginyaṃbā mlūṃ (5) śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ | maṇipūrake cakre (5) 
plūṃ pātālaratna pātālapīṭha pātālaloka garbhagāmini pātālāṃbā 
pātaleśvarī aṣṭalakṣakoṭiyoginyaṃbā plūṃ (5) śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi 
namaḥ || svādhiṣṭhāne cakre (5) nlūṃ nāgaratna nāgapīṭha nāgaloka 
garbhagāmini nāganātha nāgāṃbā nāgeśvarī turlakṣakoṭiyonyaṃbā nlūṃ (5) 
śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ | iti paṃcamahāratnanyāsaḥ ||

atha parāditrividhanyāsaḥ ||

tatra aṃguṣṭhayoḥ (5) aiṃ parāyai aiṃ (5) namaḥ | tarjanyoḥ (5) hraṁ ichāyai hrūṃ (5) 
namaḥ | madhyamayoḥ | (5) aiṃ jñānāyai aiṃ (5) namaḥ | anāmayoḥ | (5) śrīṃ 
kriyāyai śrīṃ (5) namaḥ | kaniṣṭhayoḥ | (5) hrīṃ kuṃḍalinyai hrīṃ (5) namaḥ | 
karatale karapṛṣṭhayoḥ (5) phreṃ mātṛkāyai phreṃ (5) namaḥ | iti karanyāsaḥ | 

atha hṛdayādi ṣaḍaṃgeṣvebhireva maṃtraiḥ sajātibhirnyaset || 

tataḥ paścimavaktre | (5) aiṃ parāyai aiṃ (5) namaḥ | uttaravaktre (5) hrūṃ ichāyai 
hrūṃ (5) namaḥ | dakṣiṇavaktre (5) aiṃ jñānāyai aiṃ (5) namaḥ | pūvavaktre (5) 
śrīṃ kriyāyai śrīṃ (5) namaḥ | udhvavaktre (5) hrīṃ kuṃḍalinyai hrīṃ (5) namaḥ | 
paravaktre (5) phreṃ mātṛkāyai phreṃ (5) namaḥ | iti parādi trividhanyāsaḥ ||

<p. 129b> 
atha gurupāraṃparyanyāsaḥ ||

tatra śirasi (5) hasakṣamalavarayūṃ sahakṣamalavarayīṃ śrī(-)amukānaṃdanātha 
(5) śrīpā(0) || iti saṃghaṭṭamudrayā svagurupādukāṃ vinyasya | brahmaraṃdhre (5) 
aḥ haṃ saḥ sohaṃ aḥ śauṃ sauḥ jyotiḥ parāṃbānirvāṇānaṃdanātha sauḥ 
śauṃ aḥ sohaṃ saḥ aḥ (5) nirvāṇacaraṇa śrīpā(0) | iti saṃghaṭṭamudrayaiva 
nyaset ||

brahmaraṃdhre (5) hasakṣamalavarayūṃ (sahakṣamalavarayīṃ śrī-
amukānaṃdanātha 5) śrīparapāvaka śrīpā(0) | iti saṃghaṭṭamudrayānyaset | 

tatraiva (5) oṃ hrīṃ kāmadughe amoghe varade vicce sphura sphura śrīṃ śrīṃ (5) 
kulakāmadhenu śrīpā(0) | tatastatraiva dakṣabhāge (5) haslauṃ śuklanati mahāpīṭha 
mahāprakāśānaṃdanātha hasrauṃ (5) śuklacaraṇa śrīpā(0) | vāmabhāge (5) 
