śrīśrīmanmahāśrīcakranagararasāmrājñī 

<p. 148b> 
rakta śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi nama iti brāhmaraṃdhrasya dakṣiṇabhāge 
vinyasya vāmabhāge (4) śrīśrīmanmahāśrīcakranagarasamrāṭaśukla 
śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi nama iti pādāṃbujayugaṃ nyaset || iti 
śrīśrīvidyāsaṃbhavaṣaṣṭhyuttaratriśataraśmikrama nyāsaḥ || 

atra nyāse saptākṣaryaṃte namoṃtatā || mānasapūjāyāṃ tu 
saptākṣarīmātrameva atra kecit || nyāse proktaraśmīnāṃ tattannāmacaturthī 
namoṃtatetyāhuḥ || yathā gurūpadeśaṃ kāryaṃmiti || evaṃ raśmikramaṃ 
kurvansādhake vijiteṃdriyeḥ || dhanadhānyāyurārogyabhogamokṣaphalaṃ bhavet 
|| (1) ||

atha ṛṣyādikaraṣaḍaṃganyāsānvidhāya śivohamiti bhāvayan vakṣyamāṇa 
saṃkṣobhaṇādi navamudrāḥ pāśādicaturmudrāśca badhvā 
sarvāvayavabhāvena kāmakalārūpamātmānaṃ dhyātvā 
śaktyutthāpanamudrāṃ badhvā prātaḥsmaraṇa proktaprakāreṇa 
mūlādhārātkuṃḍalinīṃ sumutthāpya tathaiva ṣaṭcakrabhedana krameṇa 
dhyāyannaṃtaryāṃgaṃ vidhāyatettejasāpariṇatāṃ śrīparadevatāṃ 
hṛdayakamalagatasiṃhāsane śrīcakrarāje kāmeśvarāṃ kasthāṃ 
sarvāvaraṇayuktāṃ trikhaṃḍā

<p. 149a> 
mudrāmudritakaro dhyāyet ||

śrīvidyānaṃdanāthena śivayoḥ priyasūnunā || 
kṛte saubhāgyaratnābdhau taraṃgo trayodaśaḥ || 

[iti śrīsaccidānaṃdanāthacaraṇārabiṃdadvaṃdvāṃtevāśi 
śrīśrīvidyānaṃdanāthena viracite saubhāgyaratnākare trayodaśastaraṃgaḥ] ||

tato dhyānaṃ || 

tatra śrīvāmakeśvarataṃtre || 

udyaccaṃdrodayakṣubdharaktapīyuṣavāridheḥ ||
madhye hemamayīṃ bhūmiṃ smarenmāṇikyamaṃḍitāṃ || (1) ||

tanmadhye naṃdanodyānaṃ madanonmādanaṃ mahata ||
trisābhyuditapūrṇeṃdujyosnājālavirājitaṃ || (2) ||

sadāsaha vasaṃtena kāmaśo devena rakṣitaṃ ||
kadaṃbacūtapunnāganāgakesara caṃpakaiḥ || (3) ||

bakulaiḥ pārijātaiśca sarvarttu kusumojvalaiḥ ||
jhaṃkāramukharairbhṛṃgai kūjadbhiḥ kokilaiḥ śukaiḥ || (4) ||

nānāvarṇairathānyaiśca dvijasaṃghairniṣevitaṃ ||
śakhīkāraṃḍahaṃsādyairnānāpakṣimiṃrāvṛtaṃ || (5) ||

nānāpuṣpalatākīrṇairmiṃttaṃ vṛkṣakhaṃḍakaiḥ ||
paryaṃtadīrghikotphallakamalotpalasaṃbhavaiḥ || (6) ||

rajobhidhūsaraiḥ samyak sevitaṃ malayānilaiḥ ||
dhyātvaivaṃ naṃdanodyānaṃ tatadaḥ prāṃgaṇaṃ smaret || (7) ||

śuddhakāṃcanasaṃkāśaṃ vasudhābhiralaṃkṛtaṃ ||
<p. 149b> 
prāṃgaṇaṃ ciṃtayitvesthaṃ surasiddha niṣevitaṃ || (8) ||

tanmadhye maṃḍapaṃ dhyāyed vyāptabrahmāṇḍamaṃḍalaṃ ||
sahasrādityasaṃkāśaṃ caturasraṃ suśobhanaṃ || (9) ||

ratnatejaḥ prabhāpuṃja piṃjarīkṛta diṅmukhaṃ ||
madhyastaṃbhavinirmuktaṃ koṇastaṃbhasamanvitaṃ || (10) ||

mahāmāṇikyavaiḍuryaratnakāṃcanabhūṣitaṃ ||
muktādāmavitānāḍhyaṃ ratnasopānamaṃḍitaṃ || (11) ||

maṃdavāyusamākrāṃtaṃ gaṃdhadhūpataraṃgitaṃ ||
ratnacāmaraghaṃṭādi vimāne rupaśobhitaṃ || (12) ||

jātīcaṃpakapunnāgaketakī mallikādibhiḥ ||
raktotpalasitāṃbhojamādhavībhiḥ supuṣpakaiḥ || (13) ||

baddhābhiścitramālābhiḥ sarvatra samalaṃkṛtaṃ ||
tīryagūrdhvalasadratnaputalī koṭimaṃḍitaṃ || (14) ||

nānāratnādibhirdivyairnirmitaṃ viśvakarmaṇā ||
tanmadhye vipulāṃ dhyāyedvedikāṃ śatayojanāṃ || (15) ||

sahasrādityasaṃkāśāṃ koṭimāṇikyamaṃḍitāṃ ||
caturdvārasamopetāṃ māṇikyadvāratoraṇāṃ || (16) ||

pradīpaiḥ pūrṇakuṃbhaiśca sarvataḥ samalaṃkṛtaṃ ||
haimībhiḥ pālikābhiśca sāṃkurābhiralaṃkṛtāṃ || (17) ||

ratnapīṭhasthitairdivyairāgamaiḥ pariśobhitāṃ ||
<p. 150a> 
tadaṃtarāṃtarā prodyanmaṇidarpaṇamaṃgalāṃ || (18) ||

madhurodgāravividhagāṃdharvastotra bṛṃhitāṃ ||
śṛṃgārarasasanaddhairnavayauvanalaṃpaṭaiḥ || (19) ||

amarīnikarairnānāmaṇibhūṣaṇabhūṣitaiḥ ||
vīṇāveṇumṛdaṃgādi vādanena ca nṛtyakaiḥ || (20) ||

prīṇayadbhirmahādevīṃ parītāṃ paritaḥ sadā || 
ratnasiṃhāsanaṃ tasyā vedyāmadhye smarechubhaṃ || (21) ||

viraṃci viṣṇurudreśarupapādacatuṣṭayaṃ ||
sadāśivamayaṃ sākṣāttasminparaśivātmakaṃ || (22) ||

puṣpaparyaṃkamāścaryaṃ tatra śrīcakranāyakaṃ || 
tanmadhyayonimadhyasthe śrīmadodyāpīṭhake || (23) ||

paryaṃkabaṃdhavilasatsvastikāsanaśālinī ||
dhyāyetparaśivāṃkasthāṃ padmamadhyobjalākṛtiṃ || (24) ||

tato dhyānaṃ pravakṣyāmi tridatrauḥ sevanīyakaṃ ||
tataḥ padmanibhāṃ devī bālārkakiraṇāruṇāṃ || (25) ||

japākusumasaṃkāśāṃ dāḍimī kusumopamāṃ ||
padmarāgapratīkāśāṃ kuṃkumodaka sannibhāṃ || (26) ||

sphuranmukuṭamāṇikya kikiṇījālamaṃḍitāṃ ||
kālālikulasaṃkāśakuṭilālakapallavāṃ || (27) ||

pratyagrāruṇasaṃkāśa vadanāṃbhojamaṃḍalāṃ ||
kiṃcidarddhedu kuṭilalalāṭamṛdupaṭṭikāṃ || (28) ||

<p. 150b> 
pinākadhanuṣākāra bhrūlatāṃ parameśvarīṃ ||
ānaṃdamuditollolalīlāṃdolitalocanāṃ || (29) ||

sphuranmayūkhasaṃghātavilasaddhemakuṃḍalāṃ ||
sugaṃḍamaṃḍalābhogajiteṃdvamṛtamaṃḍalāṃ || (30) ||

viśvakarmādinirmāṇasūtrasuspaṣṭanāsikāṃ ||
tāmravidrumabiṃbābha raktoṣṭhī amṛtopamāṃ || (31) ||

dāḍimībījavajrābha daṃtapaṃktivirājitāṃ ||
smitamādhurya vijitamādhuryarasasāgarāṃ || (32) ||

anaupamyaguṇopeta cibukodeśaśobhitāṃ ||
kaṃbugrīvāṃ mahādevīṃ mṛṇālalalitairbhujaiḥ || (33) ||

maṇikaṃkaṇakeyūra bhārakhinnaiḥ praśobhitāṃ ||
raktotpaladalākāra raktasukumāra karāṃbujāṃ || (34) ||

karāṃbujanakhajyotirvitānitanabhastalāṃ ||
muktāhāralatopeta samunnatapayodharāṃ || (35) ||

trivalī valanāyukta madhyadeśa suśobhitāṃ ||
lāvaṇyasaridāvarttīkāranābhivibhūṣitāṃ || (36) ||

anarghyaratnaghaṭitakāṃcīyutanitaṃbinī ||
nitaṃbabiṃbadviradaromarājivarāṃkuśāṃ || (37) ||

kadalī lalitastaṃbasukumārotamīśvarīṃ ||
lāvaṇyakadalītulya jaṃghāyugulamaṃḍitāṃ || (38) ||

gūḍhagulphapadadvaṃdvaprapadājitākachapāṃ ||
<p. 151a> 
brahmaviṣṇuśiroratnanighṛṣṭhacaraṇāṃbujāṃ || (39) ||

tanu dīrghāṃgulībhāsvannakhacaṃdravirājitāṃ ||
śītāṃśuśakāśasatakāṃtisaṃtānahāsinī || (40) ||

lauhityajitasiṃdūra japādāḍimarāgiṇīṃ ||
raktavastraparīdhānāṃ pāśāṃkuśakarodyatāṃ || (41) ||

raktapuṣpaniviṣṭāṃ ca raktābharaṇamaṃḍitāṃ ||
caturbhujāṃ trinetrāṃ ca paṃcabāṇadhanudharāṃ || (42) ||

karpūraśākalonmiśratāṃbūlāpūritānanāṃ ||
mahāmṛgamadodāmakuṃkumāruṇavigrahāṃ || (43) ||

sarvaśṛṃgāraveṣāḍhyāṃ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitāṃ || 
jagadāhlādajananīṃ jagadraṃjanakāriṇī || (44) ||

jagadākarṣaṇakarī jagatkāraṇarūpiṇīṃ ||
sarvamaṃtramayīṃ devīṃ sarvasaubhāgyasuṃdarīṃ || (45) ||

iti svaikyena dhyātvā mūlavidyayā svaśirasipuṣpāṃjali datvā 
punarhṛdayakamale yathoktarūpāṃ bhagavatīṃ sāṃgā varaṇāṃ dhyātvā 
vakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇa pīṭhapūjādipūrvakaṃ sāṃgā sāvaraṇāṃ devīṃ 
mānasairupacāraiḥ saṃpūjya naivedyaṃ datvā bhojanāvasareta vaiśvadevaṃ 
kuryāt ||

<p. 151b> 
tatra mūlādhāre ātmāṃtarātmāparamātmajñānātmetyātmacatuṣṭayaṃ 
kḷptaṃ caturasraṃ kuṃḍalyagnisamujvalaṃ kuṃḍaṃ dhyātvā tatra 
śrīparadevatāṃ dhyātvā tanmukhe mūlavidyāṃte āhaṃ tāṃ juhomi svāhā ||
ityādi ahaṃtāṃ saptakaiśūnya kāmakrodhalobhamohamadamātsaryāṇi 
suṣumṇāsrugyuktamanaḥsruveṇa pratyekaṃ hutvā punaḥ hṛdayakamale 
bhuktavatīṃ devīṃ dhyātvā uttarāpotānādi 
sarvopacārairārādhyamūlavidyāṃ yathāśaktiṃ japitvā 
prāṇāyāmādipūrvakaṃ vakṣyamāṇavidhinā japaṃ samarpya śrīguruṃ 
praṇamya svadehaṃ gaṃdhādibhiralaṃkṛtya arghyādipātra sthāpanaṃ kuryāt ||
tatra svavāmāgre vakṣyamāṇaviśeṣārghamaṃḍalavanmaṃḍaviracya tathaiva 
saṃpūjya tatra vakṣyamāṇavidhinā prakṣālitamādhāraṃ saṃsthāpyata 
tathaiva saṃpūjya suvarṇādiracitaṃ kajaśadhūpavāsitaṃ huṃ huṃ 
brahmāṃḍa caṣakāya svāheti vāmakareṇa prakṣālitaṃ aiṁ saṃdīpani 
jvālāmālinī hrīṃ iti saṃdīpanī vidyayā yonimudrayā saṃdīpitaṃ 
kavacenāvaguṃṭhitaṃ oṃ namaḥ | hrīṁ namaḥ | hraṁ kṣruṁ namaḥ | haṃ namaḥ | saḥ 
namaḥ |

<p. 152a> 
iti vinyasta paṃcamaṃtraṃ (4) śrīmahātripurasuṃdaryāḥ mahākalaśaṃ 
sthāpayāmīti tatra kalaśaṃ saṃsthāpyat tatra 
vakṣyamāṇaviśeṣārghapātravatpūryakalāṃtaṃ prapūjya tatra vakṣyamāṇa 
vidhinaiva karpūrādi suvāsitā paryuṣita pārisrutapayaṃḥ samāpūrya 
tatrābjādikaṃ nikṣipya tanmadhye viśeṣārgho vakṣyamāṇaṃ maṃḍalaṃ 
vibhāvya vakṣyamāṇavidhinā somakalāṃtaṃ saṃpūjya taccaturasraṃ paritaḥ (4) 
hṛ sū kha phreṃ pathika devatābhyo hūṃ phaṭ svāhā namaḥ | (4) hasakhaphreṃ 
ācaṃḍālinī hraṃ phaṭ svāhā namaḥ | hasakhaphreṃ krodhacaṃḍālini huṃ 
phaṭ svāhā namaḥ | (4) hasakhaphreṃ dṛṣṭicaṃḍālinī huṃ phaṭ svāhā namaḥ || 
(4) hasakhaphreṃ sparśa caṃ(0) | (4) hasakhaphreṃ sṛṣṭi caṃ(0) | (4) hasakhaphreṃ ghaṭa 
caṃ(0) | (4) hasakhaphreṃ tapanavedha caṃ(0) | (4) hasakhaphreṃ nirdaya caṃ(0) | (4) 
hasakhaphreṃ sarvajanadṛṣṭisparśadoṣa caṃ(0) | (4) hasakhaphreṃ paśupāśā caṃ(0) 
| iti svāgrādi prādakṣiṇyeṇa saṃpūjayediti daśadoṣāṃnnirasya || (4) kāṃ kīṃ 
kūṃ kaiṃ kauṃ kaḥ vikāraśoṣiṇi asya vikārān hanahana svāhā iti hetu 
madhye saṃpūjya || 

svādiṣṭayādibhiḥ pūrvaṃ ṛgbhiḥ paṃcabhirāyataḥ || 
viṣṇuryoniṃ trayeṇaiva tribhiṣṭvādi trayeṇa caṃ ||

<p. 152b> 
imaṃ me ca iti dvābhyāṃ tāmaṃdetyekayā tathā ||
śrīṇāmeketi caikena śutraśāpaṃ vimocayet ||

iti kulārṇava vacanāt ||

uktaṃ paṃcadaśamaṃtraiḥ sakṛtsatkṛdabhimaṃtrayet || maṃtrā ṛgvede yathā ||
svādiṣṭhayāmadiṣṭhayā pavasva somadhārayā || iṃdrāya pātave sutaḥ || ityādi 
idotvena āśasaḥ || ityaṃtaṃ vargaṃ paṭhitvā || viṣṇuryonikalpayatu 
tvaṣṭārūpāṇi piṃśatu || 

asiṃcatuprajāpatirdhātā garbhaṃ dadyātu te ||  
garbhaṃ dhehisinī vāli garbhaṃ dhehi sarasvati || 
garbhaṃ te aśvinau devā vādhattāṃ puṣkara srajā ||
hiraṇmayī araṇī yanniṃryathato aśvinā || 
taṃ te garbhaṃ havāmahe daśame māsi sūtava || (3) ||

tribhiṣṭvaṃ devasaviturvarṣiṣṭhaisomadhāmabhiḥ | agne dakṣaiḥ punī hinaḥ | 
punaṃtu māṃ devajanāḥ punaṃ tu vasavo dhiyā ||
viśve devāḥ punīta mā jātavedaḥ punīhi mā ||
prapyāya svaprasyaṃdasvasomaviśvebhiraṃ śubhiḥ | devebhyaḥ ttamaṃ haviḥ ||

imaṃ me gaṃge yamune sarasvati śutudri stomaṃ sacatāparuṣṇyā ||
asiknyamaruddṛdhe vitastayārjīkīye śruṇuhyāsuṣomayā ||
sitāsite sarite yatra saṃgathe tatrāplutāso divamutpataṃti ||

<p. 153a> 
ye vai tanva (1) visṛjaṃti dhīrāstejanāso amṛtatvaṃ bhajaṃte ||
tā maṃdasānāmanuṣoduroṇa ādhattaṃrayīṃ sahavīraṃ ca casyave ||
kṛtaṃ tīrthaṃ suprapāṇaṃ śubhasyatī sthāṇuṃ patheṣṭhāmavadurmatiṃ 
hataṃ || (3) ||

śroṇāmeka udakaṃ gāmavājati māṃsamekaḥ piṃśati sunayā bhṛtaṃ ||

ā nimrucaḥ śakadeko apābharat kiṃsvit putrebhyaḥ pitarā upāvatu ||

