<p. 154a> 
vikṣaṇamudrayā saṃvīkṣya asramaṃtreṇa prokṣya asramaṃtreṇa kuśaistriḥ 
saṃtāḍayakavacamaṃtreṇa abhyukṣya āghrāya vāmanāsāraṃdhreṇa praviśya 
brahmaraṃdhraṃ gatvā tatrastha ciccaṃdramaṃḍalamadhyagata 
paramāmṛtavāridhau militvā tanmayena rājadaṃtavivarānnetramārgeṇa 
vinirgataṃ jalaṃ vibhāvyasaṃrodhanamudrayā saṃrudhyakavacamaṃtreṇa 
avaguṃṭhanamudrayā avaguṃṭhya vamiti dhenumudrayā amṛtīkṛtya 
paramīkaraṇamudrayā paramāmṛtīkṛtya tatra devīṃ dhyātvā 
gaṃdhapuṣpādibhiḥ saṃpūjya mūlavidyāmaṣṭavāramabhimaṃtrya (4) namo 
bhagavatī grāse (mahe)śvari vāruṇī jalamūrttaya ūrdhvabiṃdugrāhiṇi 
mahālakṣmīśvarī paramadhāmni paramākāśabhāsuri somasūryāgnibhakṣaṇi 
āgacha viśa viśa svabhogadravyaṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa svāhā | iti tatkalaśādbiṃduṃ 
vāmāṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ dhṛtadvitīyakhaṃḍe nādāyordhvamutkṣipyet 
tataḥ kalaśavadanaṃ pātrāṃtareṇa āchādadya uddharaṇapātramādāya 
vāmakare nidhāya (4) amoghāyai namaḥ || (4) sūkṣmāyai namaḥ || (4) ānaṃdāyai 
namaḥ | (4) śāṃtyai namaḥ | iti śakticatuṣṭayaṃ karasthamātroparisaṃpūjya 
kuṃbhasyāchādanapātrasyoparisthāpayediti

<p. 154b> 
kalaśasthāpanaṃ | vidhāya tataḥ kalaśadakṣiṇabhāge śuddhodakena 
caturasravṛttatrikoṇātmakaṃ maṃḍalaṃ caṃdanāliptabhūmau 
vahannāsākārordhvapuṭābhyāṃ karābhyāṃ tritāramuccaran nirmāya praṇava 
tritārādi namoṃttayā mūlavidyayā trikoṇamadhyaṃ saṃpūjya kūṭatrayeṇa 
triṣu koṇeṣu svāgrādi prādakṣiṇyena saṃpūjya caturasre agnīśa nir(-)ṛti 
vāyukoṇeṣu hṛdayādyaṃga catuṣṭayaṃ madhye netraṃ 
prāgādicaturdikṣvastramiti ṣaḍaṃgamaṃtraiḥ saṃpūjya tatra mūlena 
kṣālitamādhāraṃ saṃsthāpya (4) prathamakuṭamuccārya maṃ vahnimaṃḍalāya 
dharmapradadaśakalātmane śrīparadevatāyāḥ sāmānyārghādhārāya nama iti 
saṃpūjya tatra vakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇa vahnerdaśakalāḥ pūjayitvā tatrāstreṇa 
kṣālitaṃ śaṃkhaṃ nidhāya (4) dvitīyakūṭaṃ arkamaṇḍalāyārthaprada 
dvādaśakalātmane śrīparadevatāyāḥ sāmānyārghya pātrāya nama iti 
saṃpūjya tatra vakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇa sūryasya dvādaśakalāḥ 
saṃpūjyagaṃdhādi suvāsitaśuddhatoyena praṇavatritāramūlavidyāṃte viloma 
mātṛkāmuccaran tatpātramāpūrya 

<p. 155a> 
(4) tṛtīyakūṭaṃ oṃ uṃ somamaṃḍalāya kāmaprada ṣoḍaśakalātmane 
paradevatāyāḥ sāmānyārghāmṛtāya namaḥ || iti jalaṃ saṃpūjya tatra 
vakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇa somasya ṣoḍaśakalāḥ saṃpūjya tatra 
prāgvatsavitṛmaṃḍalāttīrthamāvāhya kalaśāmṛtabiṃduṃ datvā tatra mūlena 
gaṃdha (*) ṣpādikaṃ nikṣipya prāgvat ṣaḍaṃgaiḥ saṃpūjya (4) 
hasakṣamalavarayūṃ sahakṣamalavarayīṃ iti navātmakamithunamaṃtreṇa 
trirabhimaṃtrya hsauṃ varaṇāya namaḥ | śauṃ vāruṇi devyai nama iti 
varuṇamithunamaṃtre ca trirabhimaṃtrya mūlenāṣṭadhābhimaṃtrya 
dhenuyonimudre pradarśayediti sāmānyārghaṃ vidhāya tatsamīpe 
sāmānyārgha jalena yakṣakardamādi gaṃdhamiśritena bhumiṃ vilikhya tatra 
vahachvāsordhyapuṭa hastābhyāṃ caturasra vṛtta ṣaṭkoṇātmaṃ maṃḍalaṃ 
vidhāya tanmaṃḍalaṃ śaṃkhamudrāmudrita vāmakareṇa avaṣṭabhya tanmadhya 
trikoṇamadhye sabiṃduturya svararūpāṃ kāmakalāṃ vilikhya (4) 
śrīparadevatāyāḥ viśeṣārghādhāramaṃḍalāya namaḥ | iti maṃḍalaṃ 
saṃpūjya (4) namoṃta mūlena trikoṇamadhyaṃ saṃpūjya trikoṇāgrakoṇe (4)

<p. 155b> 
prathamakūṭaṃ namaḥ | vāme (4) dvitīyaṃ namaḥ | dakṣiṇe (4) tṛtīyaṃ namaḥ | iti 
trikoṇaṃ prādakṣiṇyena saṃpūjya ṣaṭkoṇeṣu prādakṣiṇyena svāgramārabhya 
mūlakūṭa trayasya dvirāvṛtyā pūjyayitvā caturasre prāgvat ṣaḍaṃgāni 
saṃpūjya caturasre svāgrādi caturdikṣumadhye ca prādakṣiṇyena (4) glūṃ 
gaganaratnāya namaḥ | (4) slūṃ svargaratnāya namaḥ | (4) mlūṃ martyaratnāya 
namaḥ | (4) plūṃ pātālaratnāya namaḥ | (4) nlūṃ nāgaratnāya namaḥ | iti 
paṃcaratnāni saṃpūjya punaḥ ṣaṭkoṇeṣu svāgrādi prādakṣiṇyena nyāsokta 
sudhārṇavāsanāya namaḥ potāṃbujāsanāya namaḥ | ātmāsanāya(0) | 
sarvacakrāsanāya(0) | sarvamaṃtrāsanā(0) | sādhyasiddhāsanāya(0) | (5) saṃpūjya 
caturasravṛtta ṣaṭkoṇa trikoṇeṣu (4) kāmarūpapīṭhā namaḥ | (4) 
jālaṃdharapīṭhāya namaḥ | (4) pūrṇagiripīṭhāya namaḥ | (4) uḍyāṇapīṭhāya 
namaḥ | iti pīṭhacatuṣṭayaṃ saṃpūjya | 

śāṃbhavadīkṣāvāṃścet caturasre svāgrādi caturdikṣumadhye ca 
paṃcapraṇavapuṭitaiḥ praṇavapaṃcakaiḥ pūjayet | tadyathā || aiṃ hriṃ śrīṃ 
hsphreṃ hsauḥ aiṃ hsauṁ hspheṃ śrīṃ hrīṃ aiṃ namaḥ || evaṃ (5) hrīṃ (5) namaḥ 
(5) śrīṃ (5) namaḥ (5) hspheṃ (5) namaḥ hsauṃḥ (5) namaḥ || iti saṃpūjayeta | tataḥ (4) 
mūlaṃ sarvaśaktimayī śrīparadevatāyāḥ 
pīṭhacatuṣṭayātmakārghamaṃḍalāya namaḥ |

<p. 156a> 
iti samastamaṃḍalaṃ saṃpūjya tatra mūlena kṣālitamādhāraṃ gṛhītvā (4) 
śrīparadevatāyā viśeṣārghāghāraṃsthāpayāmīti maṃḍaloparisaṃsthāpya (4) 
prathamakūṭamuccārya maṃ vahnimaṃḍalāya dharmaprada daśakalātmane 
śrīparadevatāyā viṣārghapātrādhārāya namaḥ || ityādhāraṃ saṃpūjya 
taduparisvāgrādi prādakṣiṇyena vahnerdaśakalāḥ samāvāhyatāsāṃ 
prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ kuryāt || 

tatra pūrvokta prāṇaprāṇapratiṣṭhā maṃtre mama padasthāne dhumrārcirādi 
nāmiti padaṃ nikṣipya prāṇapratiṣṭhāmaṃtraṃ dhāraṃ spṛśan paṭhediti 
prāṇapratiṣṭhāvidhāya (4) yaṃ dhumrārciṣe namaḥ | (4) raṃ uṣmāyai namaḥ | 
(4) laṃ jvalinyai(0) | (4) vaṃ jvālinyai(0) | (4) śaṃ visphuliṃginyai(0) | (4) ṣaṃ suśriyai na(0) | 
(4) saṃ surūpāyai(0) | (4) haṃ kapilāyai(0) | (4) laṃ havyavāhāyai(0) | (4) kṣaṃ 
kavyavāhāyai namaḥ || iti tāḥ saṃpūjya svarṇādi racitaṃ 
pātramastreṇaprakṣālya śrīparadevatāyāviśeṣārghapātraṃ 
saṃsthāpayāmīti tatra saṃsthāpya (4) dvitīyakūṭamuccārya aṃ 
arkamaṃḍalāyārtha prada dvādaśakalātmane śrīparadevatāyāḥ viśeṣārgha 
pātrāya nama iti pātramadhye

<p. 156b> 
saṃpūjya tatra pūrvoktaṃ maṃḍalaṃ vibhāvya pūrvavatpaṃcaratnāni 
saṃpūjya tathaiva paṃcapraṇavairabhyarcya tatra sūryasya dvādaśakalāḥ 
samāvāhya prāgvattannāma puraḥsaraṃ tāsāṃ prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ vidhāya 
vṛttākāreṇa prādakṣipyena tāḥ pūjayet || tadyathā || (4) kaṃ bhaṃ tapinyai 
namaḥ || (4) khaṃ baṃ tāpinyai(0) | (4) gaṃ phaṃ dhūmrāyai(0) | (4) chaṃ paṃ 
maricyai(0) | (4) ṅaṃ naṃ jvālinyai(0) | (4) caṃ dhaṃ ruvyai(0) | (4) chaṃ daṃ 
suṣumṇāyai(0) | (4) jaṃ ṣaṃ bhogadāyai(0) | (4) jhaṃ taṃ viśvāyai(0) | (4) ñaṃ ṇaṃ 
bodhinyai(0) | (4) ṭaṃ ḍhaṃ dhāriṇyai(0) | (4) ṭhaṃ ḍaṃ kṣamāyai(0) || iti saṃpūjya 
kalaśasthaṃ jalaṃ uddharaṇapātreṇodhṛtya mūlavidyāṃte 
vilomamātṛkāmuccārya tatpātramāpūrya tatrāpi abjādikaṃ nikṣipya aiṃ iti 
aṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ puṣpeṇa tatpātrasthaṃ jalamāloḍya tatpuṣpaṃ 
nirasya klīmiti caṃdanāgurukarpūracorakuṃkumarocanā jaḍāmāṃsī 
śilārasātmakagaṃdhāṣṭakapaṃkalolitaṃ caṃdanādi paṃkalolitaṃ vā 
puṣpaṃ nikṣipyasauritigālinimudrayā nirīkṣya (4) tṛtīya kūṭaṃ uṃ 
somamaṃḍalāya kāmapradaṣoḍaśakalātmane śrīparadevatāyā 
viśeṣārghāmṛtāya namaḥ | iti pātrastha hetumadhye

<p. 157a> 
saṃpūjya tatra pūrvoktaṃ maṃḍalaṃ vibhāvya pūrvavat paṃcaratnāṃtaṃ 
saṃpūjya śāṃbhavadīkṣāyuktasthaistathaiva paṃcapraṇavaiḥ pūjayet || 
tatastatra somasya ṣoḍaśakalāsamāvāhya prāgvatannāma puraḥsaraṃ tāsāṃ 
prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ vidhāya vṛttākāreṇa svāgrādi prādakṣiṇyena tāḥ pūjayet 
|| tadyathā (4) aṃ amṛtāyai namaḥ | (4) āṃ mānadāyai(0) | (4) iṃ pūṣāyai(0) | (4) īṃ 
tuṣṭyai(0) | (4) uṃ puṣpyai na(0) | (4) ūṃ ratyai nama(0) | (4) ṛṃ dhṛtyai(0) | (4) ṝṃ śaśinyai(0) 
| (4) ḹṃ caṃdrikāyai(0) | (4) ḹṃ kāṃtyai(0) | (4) eṃ jyotsnāyai(0) | (4) aiṃ śriyai(0) | (4) oṃ 
prītyai(0) | (4) auṃ aṃgadāyai(0) | (4) aṃ pūrṇāyai na(0) | (4) aḥ pūrṇāmṛtāyai(0) | iti 
saṃpūjya pūrvapūjitamaṃdalamadhyatrikoṇamakathādi trirekhaṃ vibhāvye 
tatkoṇatraye mulavidyāyāḥ kūṭatrayaṃ madhyasya biṃdau kāmakalāṃ 
tatpārśvayoḥ sabiṃduṃhakṣau tatpṛṣṭhe lakāraṃ tatpārśveyorhaṃsavarṇau 
vibhāvyapuṣpākṣatagarbhitāṃ yonimudrābadhvā gurupadiṣṭaprakāreṇa 
mulādhārātkuṃḍalinīmutthāpya ṣaṭckrabhedanakrameṇa suṣumṇāvartmanā 
brahmaraṃdhrastha ciccaṃdramaṃḍalaṃ nītvā tatra sthita paramaśive saṃyojya 
tayoḥ śivaśaktyauḥ sāmarasya sukhānubhavagalitāmṛtadhārāṃ 

<p. 157b> 
saṃcitya rājadaṃtavivarāntayanavartmanā niḥsṛtāṃ yonimudrollasitena 
kareṇānīya (4) mūlavidyāṃte 

brahmāṃḍakhaṃḍasaṃbhūtamaśeṣarasasaṃbhṛtaṃ ||
āpūritaṃ mahāpātraṃ pīyūṣarasamāvahe || (1) ||

aiṁ pluṁ jhrauṃ jūṃ saḥ amṛte amṛtodbhave amṛteśvarī amṛtavarṣiṇī amṛtaṃ 
srāvaya srāvaya svāhā iti tasminnarghāmṛte puṣpākṣataprakṣepeṇa 
tadamṛtadhārāṃ saṃyojyavamiti dhenumudrāṃ pradarśya oṃ hrīṃ haṃ saḥ 
sohaṃ svāhā ityātmāṣṭākṣaraṃ maṃtreṇatrirabhimaṃtrya punaruccārya 
ātmaśakti śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmiti hetumadhye saṃpūjya punaḥ praṇavena 
trirabhimaṃtrya punaḥ praṇavamuccārya paraṃ niṣka śāṃbhavī śrī(0) | iti 
hetumadhye saṃpūjya punaḥ haṃ saḥ iti maṃtreṇa trirabhimaṃtrya haṃ saḥ 
ajapāśakti śrī(0) | iti saṃpūjyamātṛkayā pratyakṣaraṃ biṃdurahitayā 
trirabhimaṃtrya punastāmuccārya mātṛkā sarasvatī śrī(0) | iti hetu madhye 
saṃpūjya mūlatārtīyakūṭena daśadhābhimavyapunastārtīya kūṭamuccārya 
tripurāmṛteśvarī śrī(0) | iti hetumadhya saṃpūjya | (4) hasahakṣamalavarayūṃ 
sahakṣamalavarayīṃ ityānaṃdabhairavamithunavidyābhyāṃ trirabhimaṃtrya 
hasakṣamalavarayūṃ ānaṃdabhairavāya vauṣaṭ 

<p. 158a> 
ānaṃdabhairava śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi tarpayāmī nama iti triḥ saṃtarpya (4) 
sahakṣamalavarayīṃ sudhādevyai vaṭ sudhādevī śrī(0) | iti triḥ saṃpūjya 
saṃtarpya hsauṁ varuṇāya namaḥ | śauṃ varuṇā devyai namaḥ | iti 
varuṇamithunavidyābhyāṃ trirabhimaṃtrya (4) punaḥ pṛthaguccārya varuṇa śrī(0) | 
vāruṇīdevī śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmīti saṃpūjya saṃtarpya tato bālayā 
vakṣamāṇanityā ṣoḍaśamaṃtraiśca sakṛtsakṛdabhimaṃtrya | taddina nityā 
vidyayā tattithi nityāvidyayā ca pṛthak tristrirabhimaṃtrya parāprāsāda 
prāsādaparamaṃtrābhyāṃ urdhvāmnāya dikṣitaścet hsauṁḥ śauṁḥ iti 
maṃtrābhyāṃ trirabhimaṃtrya tataścaraṇadiṃdīkṣītaścet caraṇakulayoginī 
vidyābhyāṃ tristrirabhimaṃtrya tataḥ sauḥ ityanutaraparāvidyayādīkṣitaścet 
tayā trirabhimaṃtrya pūrṇābhiṣiktaścet kāmakalāvidyayā 
trirabhimaṃtrya ṣaḍanvaya śāṃbhavadīkṣā yuktaścet 
tadvidyābhistristrirabhimaṃtryatate vikṣyamāṇa pāṃcabhautika 
maṃtraistristrirabhimaṃtrya sṛṣṭyādi daśakalā hetumadhye samāvāhya 
prāgvatannāmapuraḥsaraṃ tāsāṃ prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ vidhāya oṃ haṃ saḥ 
śuci ṣadvasuraṃtarikṣa

<p. 158b> 
saddhotāṃ vediṣadatithirduroṇasat || nṛṣadvarasadṛtasavyomasadajbāgojā ṛtajā 
adrijā ṛtaṃ bṛhat || anayā ṛcā sakṛdabhimaṃtryapunaruccārya brahmaṇe nama iti 
hetumadhye saṃpūjyakaṃ sṛṣṭyai nama ityādi prāguktakalā 
mātṛkānyāsoktaprakāreṇa kacavargakalāḥ saṃpūjya tataḥ ṭatavargottha jarādi 
daśakalāḥ samāvāhya prāgvat tāsāṃ prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ vidhāya || 
pratadviṣṇustavate vīryeṇa mṛgo na bhīmaḥ kucarogiriṣṭhāḥ || yasyoruṣu triṣu 
vikramaṇeṣvadhikṣiyaṃti bhuvanāni viśvā || anayā ṛcā sakṛdabhimaṃtrya 
punaruccārya viṣṇuve nama iti saṃpūjya ṭaṃ jarāyai nama ityāditāḥ saṃpūjya 
payavargottha kalāstīkṣṇādyāḥ samāvāhya || prāgvat tāsāṃ 
prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ vidhāya || 

tryaṃbakaṃ yajāmahe sugaṃdhipuṣṭivarddhanaṃ ||
urvārukamiva baṃdhanānmṛtyomṛkṣīya māmṛtāt ||

ityabhimaṃtrya punaruccārya rudrāya nama iti saṃpūjya paṃ tīkṣṇāyai nama 
ityādibhiḥ saṃpūjya punaḥ ṣakārādi kṣakārāṃta paṃcavarṇotthāḥ pītādi 
paṃcakalāḥ samāvāhya prāgvat tāsāṃ prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ vidhāya 
gāyatryābhimaṃtrya punaruccārya iśvarāya nama iti saṃpūjya ṣaṃ pītāyai 
nama 

<p. 159a> 
ityāditāḥ saṃpūjya tataḥ svarotthāni nivṛtyādi ṣoḍaśakalāḥ samāvāhya 
prāgvat tāsāṃ prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ vidhāya || viṣṇuryoniṃ kalpayasviti 
maṃtrasya tvaṣṭā garbhakartā ṛṣiḥ anuṣṭūpchaṃdaḥ śrīviṣṇurdevatā 
śrīsadāśi (*) pūjārthe jape viniyogaḥ || viṣṇuryoniṃ kalpayatu tvatvaṣṭārūpāṇi 
piṃśat || āsiṃcatu prajāpatirdhātā garbhaṃ dadhātu te || ityabhimaṃtrya 
punaruccārya sadāśivāya nama iti hetumadhye sakṛtsaṃpūjya aṃ nivṛtyai nama 
ityāditāḥ saṃpūjya mātṛkayā dvirabhimaṃtrya punarabhimaṃtrya mātṛkā 
sarasvatī śrī(0) iti saṃpūjya || 

aiṃ akhaṃḍai karasānaṃdakare parasudhātmani ||
svachaṃdasphuraṇāmatra nidhe hyakularūpiṇi ||

ityanena trirabhimaṃtrya || 

klīṃ akulasthāmṛtākāre siddhijñānakare pare ||
amṛtatvaṃ nidhe hyasmin vastuni klinnarūpiṇi || (1) ||

iti ca trirabhimaṃtrya sauḥ tvadrūpeṇaikarasya tvaṃ davārghye tatsvarūpiṇi || 
bhūtvā parāmṛtākārāmayi ca sphuraṇaṃ kuru || iti ca trirabhimaṃtrya || aiṁ pluṃ 
jūṃ saḥ amṛte amṛtodbhave amṛteśvarī amṛtavarṣiṇī amṛtaṃ srāvaya srāvaya 
svāhā || iti amṛteśvarī 

<p. 159b> 
vidyayā caturvāramabhimaṃtrya | punastāmuccārya amṛteśvarī śrī(0) | iti 
sakṛtsaṃpūjya tataḥ aiṃ vada vada vāgvādini aiṃ klīṃ klinne kledini kledaya 
mahākṣobhaṃ kuru kuru klī sauḥ mokṣaṃ kuru kuru sauḥ hsauḥ || iti dīpanī 
vidyayā paṃcavāramabhimaṃtrya tatastatra mūlavidyāmaṣṭadhā japitvā 
tanmadhye caturasraṃ paścimadvāraṃ viciṃtya tadvārapārśvayoḥ 
kulabaṭukanātha tadvallabhāṃ vā śrī(0) || kulagaṇapatinātha tadvallabhāṃ vā 
śrī(0) || iti dakṣiṇavāmayoḥ saṃpūjya tadaṃtaḥ prāgvat ṣaḍāsanāni saṃpūjya 
tanmadhyatrikoṇamadhyastha biṃdumadhye kāmakalāyāṃ 
vakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇa devīmāvāhya dhyātvā ṣaḍaṃganyāsayogena 
sakalīkṛtya gaṃdhādibhiḥ saṃpūjya vakṣyamāṇa vidhinā devyaṃge 
layāṃgaṃ saṃpūjya tithi 
nityāṣoḍaśanityāgurupaṃktitrayaṃ ṣaḍaṃgayuvatīśca saṃpūjya 
vakṣyamāṇa samaṣṭi yoginī maṃtreṇa triḥ sakṛdvā puṣpāṃjaliṃ datvā 
dhūpadīpau nivedya yoni dhenu mahāyogini triśikhāpadmasaṃkṣobha 
drāvaṇākarṣavaśyonmādamahāṃkuśa khecarī bījayoni 
pāśāṃkuśadhanurbāṇākhyā aṣṭādaśamudrāḥ pradarśa namaskāra 
mudrayā praṇamet ||

<p. 160a> 
atra etāvat katumaśaktaścet abhimaṃtraṇa pūjanayoranyatamaṃ kuryāt | tatrāpi 
asaktaścet ātmāṣṭākṣarapūjāṃ taṃ kṛtvā ānaṃdabhairavamithunaṃ 
saṃpūjya saṃtarpya sṛṣṭyādi kalāpūjāmārabhya śeṣaṃ 
prāgvatsamāpayediti || 

viśeṣārghasthapanavidhiḥ ||

tatastatparatastenaiva vidhinā śrīpātrākhyaṃ pātrāṃtaraṃ sthāpayet tena 
mūladevyatiriktāvaraṇadevatāstarpayet || pūjāsamarpyādikaṃ 
mūladevyāstarpaṇaṃ ca viśeṣārgheṇaiva || tatra anaṃgakusumādi 
paryaṃtamāvaraṇa trayaṃ pūjā samarpaṇamarghadānaṃ ca sāmānyārgha 
jalaireva kuryāt || iti śrīpātrasthāpanavidhiḥ |

tatastadanukrameṇaiva tadadhaḥ paṃkyākāreṇa pādyācamanīya 
madhuparkārthaṃ pātratrayaṃ sāmānyārghavidhinaiva sthāpayet ||
tadaśaktau trikoṇamaṃḍala traye sādhāraṃ prātra trayaṃ nidhāya tatra pātra 
dvayaṃ śuddhajalenāpūrya tṛtīyaṃ madhuparkadraveṇāpūrya teṣu 
viśeṣārghajalaṃ kiṃcidatvā mūlavidyayā pṛthak pṛthak aṣṭavāra 
abhimaṃtrayet || madhuparke tu kāśyapātraṃ praśastaṃ || tāmravarjamanyataraṃ  

<p. 160b> 
vā pātrāṃtareṇāchāditaṃ kuryāt || 
gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatakuśāgratilasarṣapadūrvāḥ sāmānyārghe nikṣipet ||
pādyapātre śyāmākataṃduladūrvākamulāparājitāpuṣpośīrarocanākhya 
dravyāṣṭakaṃ nikṣipet || ācamanīya pātre jātīphalalavaṃgakaṃ kolacūrṇāni 
nikṣipet || ukta dravyālābhe tattadvastu bhāvanayā tadulannikṣipet || 
madhuparkapātre dadhimadhughṛtāni nikṣipyuviśeṣārgha biṃdunā saṃskuryāt ||
dadhyādyalābhe janenaiva tadbhāvanayā pūrayet || 

tataḥ svadakṣiṇāgre pādyādi pātravidhānenaiva punarācamanīya pātraṃ 
prokṣaṇī pātraṃ ca sthāpayet || atrāpyaśaktau pādyādi trayamekasminneva 
pātre dadyāt ||

tataḥ gurumukhādavagata viniyoga vidhau pātra catuṣṭayaṃ sāmānyārgha 
vidhinā prokṣaṇīpātrāt parataḥ sthāpayet || teṣāṃ nāmāni tu gurupātraṃ 
śaktipātraṃ baṭūkapātraṃ ātmapātraṃ ceti | gurupādukā vidyayā 
gurupātraṃ | bālavidyayā śaktipātraṃ || baṭūkapātraṃ tanmaṃtreṇa 
ātmapātramātmāṣṭākṣaramaṃtreṇa ceti tattanmaṃtre 
tatatpātramaṣṭadhābhimaṃtrayet | tataḥ prokṣaṇīpātrodakena 

<p. 161a> 
pātrāṃtaroddhṛtena oṃ aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ aiṃ prathamakūṭamuccārya 
ātmatatvātmane namaḥ | (4) klīṃ dvitīyaṃ vidyātatvātmane namaḥ || (4) sauḥ 
tṛtīyaṃ śivatatvātmane namaḥ | tataḥ (4) aiṃ klīṃ sauḥ samastamuccārya 
sarvatatvātmane namaḥ || iti svātmānaṃ prokṣya punarmulena yāgabhūmiṃ 
yāgopakaraṇāni ca śrīcakraṃ prokṣyasavaṃ vastuṣu dhenumudrāṃ pradarśayet 
|| iti arghyādi sthāpanavidhiḥ ||

atra śrīpātrasthāpanāśaktau viśeṣārgheṇaiva prokta pūjādikaṃ kuryāditi || 

athātmapūjā ||

tatra svapuratastrikoṇamaṃḍale sādhyāraṃ pātraṃ saṃsthāpya 
kalaśodakenāpūrya viśeṣārghabiṃduṃ datvā svadehaṃ caṃdanādi 
raktopacārairalaṃkṛtyātmānamiṣṭadevatārūpaṃ dhyāyan gurugaṇapati 
paradevatāḥ praṇamya mūlādhārādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ bisataṃtuṃ 
tanīyaṃsī caṃdrakoṭi prabhādravāṃ kuṃḍalīnīṃ manolaya paryaṃtaṃ 
dhyātvā paramānaṃdanirbharastadātmakatvena mūlavidyāmapi mūlādi 
brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ tejomayīṃ vibhāvya tattejasāparitaṃ 
sveṣṭadevatārūpaṃ svadehaṃ bhāvayannātmapūjāṃ kuryāt | (tatastatra 
somasya ṣoḍaśakalāsamāvāhya prāgvatannāmapuraḥsaraṃ tāsāṃ prāṇa) ||

<p. 161b> 
tadyathā ||

tatra prāgukta yogapīṭhanyāsa prakaraṇokta prakāreṇa svadehaṃ siṃhāsanatvena 
parikalpya prathamaṃ śirasi praṇava tritārāḍhyāṃ śrīgurupādukā 
vidyāmuccārya śrī(-)amukānaṃdanātha śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi tarpayāmi 
nama iti saṃpūjya saṃtarpya mūlādhāre gaṃ gaṇapati śrīpādukāṃ pū(0) || ta(0) 
| nama iti saṃpūjya saṃtarpya prāgukta yogapīṭhanyāsakrameṇa 
maṃḍūkādyānmūlādhārādin tatsthāneṣu praṇava tritāra caturthyaṃ 
tatattannāmabhirnamoṃtaiḥ siṃhāsanāṃ taṃ saṃpūjya dakṣiṇāṃ 
savāmāṃ savāmoru dakṣiṇoru sarvāṃgeṣu vakṣyamāṇa paṃcapretāsanaṃ 
saṃpūjya dakṣiṇāṃsādi sthāneṣu dharmādi catuṣṭayaṃ mukhādi sthāneṣu 
adharmādi catuṣṭayaṃ ca tathaiva saṃpūjya punarhṛdaya kamala eva māyā vidye 
saṃpūjya madhye paṃcadaśaphaṇānvitamanaṃtaṃ dhyātvā 
tanmadhyaphaṇāyāmaṣṭadalakamalaṃ kāmeśvarī pīṭhaṃ dhyātvā 
naṃtapadmādi paratatvāṃtaṃ saṃpūjya tatkesareṣu prāgādi prādakṣiṇyena (4) 
mohinī śrī(0) | (4) kṣobhiṇī śrī(0) | (4) vaśinī śrī(0) | (4) staṃbhinī śrī(0) | (4) ākarṣaṇī 
śrī(0) | (4) drāvaṇī śrī(0) | (4) āhlādanī śrī(0) |

<p. 162a> 
(4) klinnā śrī(0) | (4) iti saṃpūjya madhye (4) kledinī śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi iti 
saṃpūjya klīṃ sarvaśakti kamalāsanāya nama iti yogapīṭhatvena puṣpāṃjalinā 
samastaṃ dehaṃ saṃpūjya tanmadhyakarṇikāyāṃ śrīcakraṃ vibhāvya (4) 
samastaprakaṭetyādi yoginī samaṣṭi vidyayā triḥ samastaṃ dehaṃ saṃpūjya 
prāgukta yogapīṭhanyāsakrameṇa ṣaḍāsana paryaṃtaṃ prāk nyastasthāneṣu 
saṃpūjya dakṣiṇāṃ sapṛṣṭhadakṣa karṇapṛṣṭhadakṣa śaṃkhadakṣa 
lalāṭadakṣa netradakṣa nāsāpuṭadakṣa cubukahṛdaya trikoṇa tanmadhyeṣu (4) 
nādaśakti śrī(0) | (4) biṃduśakti śrī(0) | (4) kalāśakti śrī(0) | (4) jyeṣṭhāśakti śrī(0) | (4) 
raudrīśakti śrī(0) | (4) vāmāśakti śrī(0) | (4) viṣaghniśakti śrī(0) | (4) dūtaśakti śrī(0) | 
(4) sarvāṃ naṃdāśakti śrī(0) | iti saṃpūjya ||

aṃ kaṃ (36) ityādi śivaśakti sadāśivetyādi nyāsokta samaṣṭi pīṭhamaṃtreṇa 
sarvāṃgaṃ saṃpūjya hṛdayakamale yathoktarūpāṃ bhagavatīṃ dhyāyan 
tattejasā vyāptaṃ svadehaṃ śrībhagavatīrūpaṃ viciṃtya mūlamuccārya 
śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī śrīpā(0) | ta(0) | nama 

<p. 162b> 
iti śirasi triḥpuṣpāṃjalibhiḥ saṃpūjya puraḥsthāpita pātrodabiṃduṃbhiḥ 
saṃtarpya punaḥ prāgvanmulena śirohṛdayaguhyapādadvaya sarvāṃgeṣu 
paṃcapuṣpāṃjalibhiḥ saṃpūjya saṃtarpya hṛdaya trikoṇe śirastrikoṇe vā 
vakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇa layāṃgatithi nityāṣoḍaśa nityāgurupaṃkti 
traya ṣaḍaṃgayuvatīstattatsthāneṣu vakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇa saṃpūjya 
saṃtarpya hṛdaya trikoṇa pūjāyāṃ saṃhāra śrīcakroktanyāsaprakāreṇa 
navāvaraṇaśaktiḥ pūjayet || śirastrikoṇa pūjācet sṛṣṭi śrīcakranyāsakrameṇa 
navāvaraṇaśaktīścakreśvarīśca pūjayitvā tarpayet || etāvat 
kartumaśaktau ṣaḍaṃgayuvatīpūjāṃte samastaprakaṭetyādi samaṣṭi vidyayā 
triḥ saṃpūjya saṃtarpya catuḥsamayacaturāmnāya ṣaṭ darśanadevatāśca 
vakṣyamāṇa śrīcakrapūjākrameṇa pūjayet || urdhvāmnāya 
dīkṣitaścenmahāṣāḍhānyāsoktarūpaṃ svātmānaṃ dhyātvā tadvidyayā 
vakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇa triḥsaṃpūjya śaktaścenmāhāṣoḍhokta 
devatāstanyāsasthāneṣveva saṃpūjya saṃtarpya śirasi parāpādasya gurupaṃkti 
trayaṃ pūjayet ||

<p. 163a> 
tataścaraṇadikṣitaścet prāguktacaraṇādi vidyābhistanyāsasthāneṣu saṃpūjya 
tarpayet || 

tataḥ pūrṇābhiṣiktaścedvakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇa 
śirasikāmakalāpāraṃparyeṇa saṃpūjya saṃtarpyaśāṃvadīkṣāyuktaścet 
tanmithunaṣaṭkaṃ tadgurukramaṃ tadraśmikramaṃ ca prāguktanyāsasthāneṣu 
saṃpūjya tarpayet | atra sarvatrātmapūjāyāṃ vistārāśaktau 
tattanmūladevatāstattadgurukramaṃ ca saṃpūjya saṃtarpayediti saṃkṣepaḥ ||

tataḥ pūrvavat puṣpāṃjali paṃcakaṃ svadehe samastakādiṣu prāguktasthāneṣu 
vidhāyadhūpadīpau nidedya aṃtarhavanaṃ kuryāt ||

tatra mūlādhāre tryasraṃ kuṃḍaṃ vibhāvya tanmadhyastha kālāgnimeva 
kāmāgniṃ vāsanārūpe sādhana prajvalitaṃ prāṇādi paṃcavāyubhiḥ 
saṃrāṃkṣitaṃ kuṃḍalinīrūpa paradevatādhiṣṭhitaṃ cidagnimaṃḍalaṃ 
vibhāvya praṇava tritārādi mūlavidyāṃte dharmādharma havi dīpte ātmāgnau 
manasā sruca | suṣumṇāvartmanā nityamakṣa vṛttirjuhomyahaṃ idaṃ juhomi 
svāhā || iti puṇyapāpakṛtyākṛtya saṃkalpavikalpa dharmātmakaṃ haviḥ 
saptakaṃ saptāhutyā hutvā

<p. 163b> 
tataḥ praṇavatritārādi mūlavidyāṃte prakāśāmarśa 
hastābhyāmavalaṃvyonmanī sucaṃ | dharmādharmakalāstehaṃ pūrṇavahnau 
juhomyahaṃ adharmaṃ juhomi svāheti pūrṇāhuti hutvā nirastanikhilaprapaṃco 
niṣkalabrahmarūpaḥ sādhakaḥ kiyat kṣaṇa tiṣṭhet ||

tato devīrūpamātmānaṃ dhyātvā śrīgurupādukāṃ praṇamya śirasi 
annapūrṇāṃ dhyātvā tanmaṃtreṇa vakṣyamāṇa pūjāprakāreṇa tāṃ 
saṃpūjya saṃtarpya pūjāśiṣṭaṃ tatpātrasthamudakaṃ gurupādukā 
mūlavidyābhyāṃ kuṃḍalyātmaka śrīparadevatā mukhe juhomīti dhiyā 
prāśya śrīparadevatārūpamātmānaṃ dhyāyanprāṇāyāma | ṛṣyādi 
karaṣaḍaṃgaṃ nyāsapūrvakaṃ mūlavidyāmaṣṭottaraśatavāraṃ japitvā 
punaḥ prāṇāyāmapūrvakaṃ japaṃ samarpya stutvā praṇamediti ātmapūjā ||

|| [śrīvidyānaṃdanāthena śivayoḥ priyasūnunā] ||




